<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">Isaiah</book>
  <para style="h">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Isaiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoza fapa Isaian Juda-ho lal Uzia te, Jothama te, Ahaza te, Hezekia te lal laia, Juda-ho leh Jerusalem chungchâng thûa inlârna a hmuh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw vânte u, ngaithla ula; aw leilung, beng chhi rawh; Lalpa chuan thu a sawi e: “Fanaute ka châwmin ka tiseilian a, ka chungah an hel ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bâwngpain a neitu a hria a, sabengtung pawhin a pu chaw pêkna a hre bawk a; Israel-ho erawh chuan an hre si lo va, ka mite chuan an ngaihtuah lo ve,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A, hnam sual, khawlohnaa khat, thil ṭha lo tih chîng, hnam nikhualo an ni. Lalpa chu an kalsan a, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chu an hmusit a, intihrangin an hnungtawlh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engati nge in hel zual deuh deuhva, vuaka in la awm cheu ni le? Lu chu a pumin a nâ a, thinlung pawh chu a pumin a chau ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kephah hnuai aṭanga lû thleng zakin dam lai rêng rêng a awm lo; pem te, vuak duk chur te, pân hnai la te hlîr a ni; chûng chu an hmet ping lo va, an tuam hek lo va, sahriak an hnawih hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In ram chu a ṭiau zo va, in khuate chu meiin a kâng zo va; in ram chu ram dang miten in mit hmuhah an ei zo va, ram dang mite tihchhiat angin a chhe zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zion fanu chu grêp huana vênbûk ang leh, fanghma huana thlâm ang leh, khawpui hual vêl anga hnutchhiahin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan tihboral bâng tlêm tê min lo zuahsak suh sela chuan, Sodom ang khân kan awm daih tawh ang a, Gomorra ang mai khân kan awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sodom rorêltute u, Lalpa thu hi hre rawh u; Gomorra mite u, kan Pathian dân thûah hian beng chhi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “In inthawina zozai hi ka tân eng nge a ṭangkaina awm? Berâmpa hâlrala hlante leh ran châwm thaute thau chu ka hnê ta; bâwngpate leh berâmnote leh kêlpate thisenah pawh ka lâwm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hmaa inlan tûra in lo kal hian, ka biak in hung chhûng kawtlai rah hi tuin nge phût che u ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thil pêk mai maite chu rawn keng tawh suh u; englo rimtui chu ka tân thil tenawm tak a ni. Thla thar te, Chawlhni te, inkhâwmpuia insâwm khâwm te mai mai chu ka ngaithei tawp lo mai; khawlohna a ni, inkhâwm ropui tak pawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In thla tharte leh in hun bi nei kûtte chu ka rilru chuan a hua a ni; ka tân thil hnawksak tak a ni, tuar ka ning tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, in kut in phar hunah pawh in lakah ka mit ka hup tawh ang a; a ni, vawi tam tak in ṭawngṭai hunah pawh ka ngaithla tawh lo vang. In kutte chu thisenin a khat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Insil ula, intifai rawh u; ka mit hmuh phâk lohvah in thiltihte hi a sualna chu dah bo rawh u; sual tih hi bâng tawh ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />thil ṭha tih zir tawh rawh u; rorêlna fel zawng ula, hnehchhiahna tuarte chu ṭanpui ula; pa nei lote chu rorêlsak ula, hmeithaite chu sawipui rawh u,” a tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Hawh teh u, i ngaihtuah tlâng teh ang u! In sualte chu sen lâr angin awm tawh mah sela, vûr angin a vâr ang; sen duk angin sen tawh mah sela, berâm hmul angin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tih nuam tak leh thu âwih taka in awm chuan, in rama thil ṭhate hi in ei ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />nimahsela, in duh loh va in hel chuan, khandaihin a ei zo vang che u,” a ti a; Lalpa ka chuan chu chu a sawi tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Engtizia nge khawpui rinawm tak chu nawhchizuarah a lo chan tâk le aw! Rorêl felnaa khatnu a nih ṭhin vei nên! Amahah chuan felna a awm ṭhîn a, tûnah erawh chuan tualthattute an awm tâk zâwk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />I tangkarua chu a êkchhiaah a lo chang ta a, i uain chu tui nên pawlh a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I mi liante chu hel hmang, rûkrute ṭhian an ni a; mi tinin tham an duh a, lâwmman an ûm ṭhîn. Pa nei lote ro an rêlsak ṭhîn lo va, hmeithaite thu lah an hnênah a thleng ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel-ho Mi Chaka chuan heti hian a sawi a: “A! Mi dotute hi ka tifikiang mai ang a, ka hmêlmate chungah phuba ka la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I chungah ka kut ka thlâk leh ang a, i êkchhia chu fai takin ka tibo vang a, i suan zawng zawng chu ka la bo vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I chhûnga rorêltute chu a tîra an awm ang khân ka awmtîr leh ang a, i chhûnga remruattute chu a hmasa bera an awm ang khân ka awmtîr leh bawk ang. Chumi hnuah chuan ‘Felna Khawpui, Khawpui Rinawm Tak’ an la ti ang che.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zion chu rorêlna fela chhan chhuah a ni tawh ang a, a chhûnga mi hawi kîr lehte pawh felnaa chhan chhuah an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nimahsela, bawhchhetute leh mi sualte tihchhiatna chu a awm rual ang a, Lalpa kalsantute pawh tihboralin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“In sasaw duh takte chu in zahpui tawhin, in huan thlante avâng chuan zak takin in awm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sasua a hnah uai tawh leh huan tui hmu lo ang mai hi in ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, mi chak tak chu zîza ṭawm ang a ni tawh ang a, a hnathawh chu meisî ang a ni ang; tichuan, an kâng dûn ang a, tu mân an timit lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoza fapa Isaian Juda-ho leh Jerusalem chungchâng thu a hmuh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni hnuhnûngahte chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa in awmna tlâng chu tlâng lian chungahte chuan tihnghehin a awm ang a, tlâng tête chungah chuan chawi sânin a awm bawk ang; chutah chuan hnam tinrêngte chu an kal nguah nguah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chi tam takte chu an kal ang a, “Lo haw ula, Lalpa tlângah, Jakoba Pathian inah chuan i chho vang u; tichuan, anin a kawng chanchinte chu min zirtîr ang a, a kalkawngahte chuan kan kal ang,” an ti ang. Zion aṭang chuan dân thu chu a lo chhuak dâwn si a, Lalpa thu chu Jerusalem aṭangin a lo chhuak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan hnam tin kârah ro a rêl ang a, chi tam tak pawh a zilhhau vang; an khandaihte chu leilehna hmâwr zumahte an chher ang a, an feite chu thei kung ah chhumna chem kawmahte an chher ang; hnam dangin hnam dang chungah khandaih an lek tawh lo vang a, indo dân pawh an zir tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Jakoba chhûngte u, lo haw ula, Lalpa êngah i lêng ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawchhak lam tih dân te, Philistia dawite an chîng a, ram dang mite tih dânte an zawm tâk avângin i mi Jakoba chhûngte chu i kalsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An ram chu tangkarua leh rangkachakin a khat a, an sumte chu chhiar sên rual a ni lo; an ram chu sakawrin a khat a, an tawlailîrte chu chhiar sên rual a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An ram chu milemin a khat a; anmahni kuta thawh chhuah, anmahni zungṭangtea siam chu an be ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite chu an kûn a, an tlâwm bawk a; nimahsela, anni chu ngaidam suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa hlauhawmna leh a mawina ropuina pumpelh tûrin lungpui kârah te chuan lût ula, vaivutah biru rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihring induhnate chu tihtlâwmin a awm ang a, mite chapona chu tihhniamin a awm ang, chumi nîah chuan Lalpa chauh chu chawi sânin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa ni chu inngaisâng leh chapo zawng zawng chungah leh chawisâna awm zawng zawng chungah chuan a la awm dâwn si a; tichuan, tihtlâwmin an awm ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lebanon tlânga sidar thing sâng tak leh chawisâna awmte zawng zawng chungah te, Basan rama sasua zawng zawng chungah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tlâng lian sâng tak chungah te, tlâng tê chawisâna awm zawng zawng chungah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />in sâng, sâng tak zawng zawng chungah te, kulh tlângpui bang nei zawng zawng chungah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tarsis lawng lian zawng zawng chungah te, thil lem duhawm zawng zawng chungah te pawh a la awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihring induhnate chu tihhniamin a awm ang a, mite chapona chu tihtlâwmin a awm ang; chumi nîah chuan Lalpa chauh chu chawi sânin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, milemte chu an boral daih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, lei hi nasa tak taka tinghîng tûra a thawh hunah, Lalpa hlauhawmna lak aṭang leh a mawina ropuina lak aṭang chuan, mite chu lungpui pûkahte leh lei kuaahte chuan an lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan miten an tangkaraw milemte leh an rangkachak milem te, biak tûra an siamte chu, buikelek hnênahte leh bâk hnênahte chuan an paih ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />lei hi nasa taka tinghîng tûra a thawh hunah, Lalpa hlauhawmna lak aṭang leh a mawina ropuina lak aṭang chuan, lungpui pûkahte leh khâm lungpui khi-ahte chuan an lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An hnâr chauhva thaw awm mihring rin hi bânsan tawh rawh u; eng kawngah nge rin tlâk an nih tehlul ni?
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan, Jerusalem hnên ata leh Juda-ho hnên ata chu an rin pui leh an rin ber, an rin pui chaw zawng zawng leh an rin ber tui zawng zawng chu an lâksak mêk a nih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />mi chak leh indo thiamte nên, rorêltu leh, zâwlnei leh, aienthiam leh upate nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />sawmnga hotu leh, mi zahawm leh, remruattu leh, themthiam leh aikaihthiamte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, an mi liantea awm tûrin naupangte ka pe ang a, nausênten an chungah ro an rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, mite chu hnehchhiahin an awm ang, mi tin inhnehchhiahin an awm ang a, mi tin mahni ṭhenawmte nên inhnehchhiahin an awm ang; naupang chu upa chungah chapo takin an awm ang a, mi chhe tê pawh mi zahawm chungah chapo takin an awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miin a unau a pa inah chelhin, “Nang chuan silhfên i nei a, kan rorêltuah awm la, he chhiatna hi i kutah awm rawh se,” a tih hunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chumi hunah chuan ani chuan a aw a chhuah ang a, “Kei zawng siamṭhatuah ka awm dâwn lo ve, ka inah ei tûr a awm si lo va, silhfên a awm hek lo; mite rorêltuah mi siam lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ropuina hmusita an ṭawng leh thiltihte chu Lalpa do zâwng a nih avângin Jerusalem chu a chhe zo va. Juda-ho chu an tlu zo ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An hmêl lan dânin anmahni a hêk chawp a, an sualna chu Sodom ang maiin an lantîr a; an zêp lo. An nunna chung chu a pik e! Thil ṭha lovin an inthungrûl chawp si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi fel thûah chuan, “An la ṭha dâwn,” ti rawh u, an thiltih rahte chu an ei dawn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi sual chung chu a pik e! An la chhe dâwn a ni, an kuta thiltih thungrulhna chu an hnênah pêk a la ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mite zawng anmahni hnehchhiahtute hi naupangte an ni a, hmeichhiaten an chungah ro an rêl ta. Aw ka mite u, in hruaitute chuan an hruai sual che u a, in kalna kawngte chu an tichhe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chu sawipui tûrin a lo ding chhuak a, mite ro rêl tûrin a lo ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a mite upaho chungah leh an mi lianho chungah ro a rêl ang; Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan, “Nangmahniho hi in ni, grêp huan ei zotute chu; mi retheite laka sum lâk chu in inahte a ni a awm ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engtizia nge ka mite chu in nem sâwra, retheite hmai chu in râwt sawm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu Lalpa chuan, “Zion fanute chu chapo taka an awma, dâk âwr âwr leh mi melh hraw hrawa an kala, an kal chu ti awh awha an kala, an kete an pên rîk chhawng chhawng avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Zion fanute chhîpah chuan pân khir a awmtîr ang a, Lalpa chuan an zahmawhte pawh a tilang ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Lalpan an incheimawinate chu a lâksak ang, kebun te, lên lukhum te, nghâwngkawl te chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />bengbeh uai diah diah te, bânbun te, inkhuhna puan te chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />lû cherna te, kebun khaidiat te, kâwnghrên te, rimtui bâwm te, invênna te chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />hming nemna zungbun te, hnâr vuah te chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />kût ni thuamhnaw te, kawrfual te, puan sîn te, iptê te chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />dârthlalang te, puan zai sîn te, diar te, intuam mawina puan te chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, mawsawla rimtui tak aiah thil ṭawih a awm ang a; kâwnghrên aiah hruizên a awm ang a; sam hniar siau aiah lû kawlhna a awm ang a; puan mawi tak aiah saiip puan ven a awm ang a; hmêlṭhat aiah thîr linga deh chhiatna a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I mite chu khandaiha tihtlûkin an awm ang a, i mi chak takte chu indonaah an tlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kulh kawngkhârte chu an âwm inchûmin an ṭap ang a; ani chu a ruak ang a, leiah a ṭhu ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan hmeichhe pasarihin mipa pakhat an chelh ang a, “Keimahni chaw kan ei ang a, keimahni silhfênte kan inbel ang e; i hming chauh min puttîr la; kan hmingchhia hi min chhilhsak rawh,” tiin an sawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Lalpa pêng chu mawi tak leh ropui takin a awm ang a, Israel-ho la damte tân chuan leia rahte chu ṭha tak leh mawi takin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpan rorêlna thlarau leh kanna thlarauva Zion fanute bawlhhlawhna chu a sil fai hnu leh, Jerusalem thisen chu a chhûng ata a tlen fai hnu chuan, Zion-a la awm leh Jerusalem-a la awmte chu thianghlim an ti ang, Jerusalem-a la damte zînga hming ziak zawng zawngte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Zion tlânga awmna zawng zawng chungah leh, a inkhâwmpuite chungah chuan chhûnah chhûm leh meikhu, zânah mei alh êng a siamsak ang. Ropuina zawng zawng chungah chuan englo zâr a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhûnah ni sa hliahtu atân leh, thlipui leh ruahpui lakah inhumhimna leh, bihrûkna hmun atân bâwktê a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka duh taka thu, grêp huan chungchâng thu chu, ka duh taka tân hlain ka sa teh ang. Ka duh taka chuan tlâng lei ṭha tak maiah grêp huan a nei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a vêlin lei a lai khuar a, a lungte chu a chhar fai a, grêp hrui ṭha ber mi a phun a, a laiah chuan in sâng a sa a, chutah chuan grêp sâwrna khur pawh a lai a; tin, grêp raha rah tûrin a beisei a; nimahsela, grêp suak maiin a lo rah ta zawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tûnah hian, aw Jerusalem-a awmte leh Juda mite u, khawngaih takin kei leh ka grêp kâra thu hi min ngaihtuahsak teh u khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka grêp huanah hian ka tih tawh ang lo liam kha chuan, a chungah eng nge tih leh chuan tûr lo la awm ta ni le? Eng vângin nge, grêp raha rah tûra ka beisei nên khân, grêp suaka a lo rah mai kha ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah hian ngai teh u, ka grêp huan chunga ka tih tûr chu ka hrilh ang che u: a hlîng pal chu ka la bo vang a, ei zawhin a awm ang; a lung pal chu ka tichim ang a, rah behin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tiram vek ang a; sah novin a awm lo vang a, laih phutin a awm hek lo vang; buar leh hnimhlîngneite a ṭo zâwk ang. Chhûmte pawh a chunga ruah rêng rêng sûrtîr lo tûrin thu ka pe bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa grêp huan chu Israela chhûngte hi an ni a, Juda mite hi a kûng duhawm tak chu an ni si a. Rorêlna fel a beisei a; nimahsela, ngai teh, hnehchhiahna a lo awm ta zâwk a; felna a beisei a; nimahsela, ngai teh, mangang au thâwm a lo awm ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ram lailiah anmahni chauh an awm theihna tûra, mi tel vena hmun rêng rêng awm lo khawp hiala in leh in inzawmtîr zêl leh, lo leh lo inzawmtîr zêl ṭhîntute chung chu a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan ka bengah heti hian a ti, “Tihtak zetin in tam tak, lian tak tak, mawi pui puite chu, luahtu awm lovin a la ram ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Grêp huan ṭîn sâwm hmunah bath khat chauh a la haw dâwn a, buh chi homer khat tuhin ephah khat chauh a la haw dâwn si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zu um tûra zîng tak taka thova, uainin a tihruih bûng hma loh va zân rei tak tak thlenga awm ṭhînte chu an chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ṭingṭang leh perhkhuangte, khuangtê leh phênglâwngte, uain nên an ruaiṭhehnaahte chuan an awm ṭhîn a; nimahsela, Lalpa hnathawh chu an ngaisâng ṭhîn lo va, a kut thiltih chu an ngaihtuah ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka mite chu hriatna an neih loh avângin sala hruaiin an awm ta a; an mi zahawmte chu an ril a ṭâm a, an mipuite chu tuihâlin an dangro zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Seol chuan a duhna chu a lo tizau va, a kâ chu teh rual loh khawpin a âng ta a; an ropuina te, an mipui te, an ropui bûng bûngna te, an zînga lâwm taka awmte nên chuan an lût thla ta duah duah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tête chu tihkûnin an awm a, mi liante chu tihtlâwmin an awm a, chapo mitte chu tihhniamin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa erawh chu rorêlnaa chawi sânin a awm ta zâwk a, Pathian, Mi Thianghlim chu felnaa tihthianghlimin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, berâmnote chu an tlatna hmuna an tla angin an tla dial dial ang a, mi thau pui pui hmun rama thilte chu vâkvaihoten an ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bumna hruihruala khawlohna hnûka, tawlailîr hruizêna sualna hnûk chu an chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Kan hmuhna tûrin ti thuai sela, a thiltih tûr chu ti rang rawh se; kan hriat theihna tûrin Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima remruat chu lo hnaiin lo thleng rawh se,” ti ṭhîntute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo chu thil ṭha tia, thil ṭha chu thil ṭha lo ti ṭhîna, êng chu thima ngaia, thim chu ênga ngai ṭhîna, thil thlum chu thil khâa ngaia, thil khâ chu thil thluma ngai ṭhîntute chu an chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mahni ngaiha fingte leh mahni mit hmuha bengvârte chu an chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uain in kawnga mi chak tak, zu chawhpawlh kawnga thahrui nei mite chu an chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tham ei avânga mi sual thiam chantîr ṭhîna, mi fel felna lâksak ṭhîntute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, mei alhin buhpâwl a kâng ral duak duak ṭhîn ang leh, hnim ro chu mei alha a tlu zawih zawih ṭhîn angin an zung chu ṭawihna angin a awm ang a, an pâr chu vaivut angin a chho chuai chuai ang; Sipaihote Lalpa dân chu an duh lohva, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlim thu chu an ngaihnêp avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa thin chu a mite chungah a thawk a, a kut chu an chungah a lek a, a vua a; tichuan, tlângte chu a khûr dur dur a, an ruangte chu kawtthlêr laiahte chuan bawlhhlawh ang maiin a awm rem rum a. Chuti kauva a tih pawh chuan a thinur chu a la reh si lo va, a kut chu a la lek ta cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hnam tin hla taka mite tân chhinchhiahna a târ chhuak ang a, kâwlkil ata ko tûrin a faifûk ang; tichuan, ngai teh, anniho chu rang takin an lo kal thuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An zîngah tu mah an hah lo vang a, an inchhuih hek lo vang; tu mah an muthlu lo vang a, an muhîl hek lo vang; an kâwnghrên chu phelh dulin a awm hek lo vang a, an pheikhawk chilhna chu a chat hek lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />an thalte chu zum tak a ni a, an thal ngul zawng zawngte chu kawih sain a awm ṭhup a; an sakawr tinte chu meilung ang maia ngaih a ni ang a, an tawlailîr kête chu ṭhâwngaleivir ang maia ngaih a ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An thâwm ri hum hum chu sakeibaknei hâhum ang mai a ni ang a, sakeibaknei vânglaite hâhum ang maiin an ri hum hum ang; a ni, an ri hum hum ang a, an sa seh tûr chu an seh ang a, him takin an kal bopui ang a, chhan chhuaktu tûr tu mah an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan tuifinriat ri hum hum angin an chungah an ri hum hum ang. Tichuan, miin ram chu an han thlîr chuan, ngai teh, thim leh manganna hlîr a ni a, êng lah chu, chumia chhûmahte chuan tihthimin a awm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Uzia a thih kum khân Lalpa chu lalṭhutphah sâng tak chawisâna a ṭhu ka hmu a, a silhfên hmâwr fual chuan biak in chu a tikhat ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kiangah chuan seraf-te an ding a, thla paruk an nei ṭheuh va: an thla pahnihin an hmai an khuh a, pahnihin an kephahte an khuh a, pahnihin an thlâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, “Sipaihote Lalpa chu a thianghlim e, a thianghlim e, a thianghlim e; lei pum pui chu a ropuinain a khat,” tiin an inau tawn an inau tawn ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, a autu au thâwmah chuan a kawngka bul lungphûm lamin a nghîng ta dur dur a, in chu meikhuin a khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu veleh, kei chuan, “Hmui bawlhhlawh pu mi ka niha, hmui bawlhhlawh pu mite zînga awm ka nih avângin ka chung a va pik êm! Ka boral ta a nih hi; ka mitin Lal, sipaihote Lalpa chu a hmu ta si a,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, seraf pakhat, maichâm ata chaicheha a cheh, meiling kengin ka hnênah a lo thlâwk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka ka a han dep a, “Ngai rawh, hei hian i hmui a tawk ta; tichuan, i khawlohna lâk bo a ni ta a, i sual pawh tlen fai a ni ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, “Tu nge ka tirh ang a, tu nge kan tân kal ang?” tiin Lalpa aw chu ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, keiin, “Kei heta hi ka awm, mi tîr ta che,” ka ti a. Tin, ani chuan, “Kal la, he chite hi hrilh rawh: ‘Bengin a hriat zawng hria ula, a ngaihna erawh chu hre suh u; a hmuh chu hmu ula, hriat erawh chu hre suh u,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He chite thinlung hi tithau la, an bengte tingawng la, an mitte maimitchhîntîr rawh; chuti lo chuan, an mitin an hmu ang a, an bengin an hria ang a, an thinlungin an hre bawk ang a, an hawi kîr leh ang a, tihdamin an awm dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan, “Lalpa, eng chen nge ni ang?” ka ti a. Tin, ani chuan a chhâng a, “Khawpuite mihring awm awm lova a rama, inte urtu awm lova ram chu a ṭiau veka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpan mite chu hla taka a sawna, ram chhûngah hmun kalsan hnu tam tak a awm hma loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a chhûngah chuan sâwm zîngah pakhat pawh la awm sela, ei zawhin an awm leh nghâl ang; nimahsela, ṭhîl leh sasua kih hnua a bul a la awm reng ṭhîn angin, chi thianghlim chu a bul la awm reng chu a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Uzia fa Jothama fapa Ahaza lal lai chuan heti hi a ni a, Suria lal Rezina leh Israel lal Remalia fapa Peka chu Jerusalem rûn tûrin an chho va; nimahsela, an hneh thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Davida chhûngte chu, “Suria chu Ephraim nên an ṭang dûn ta,” tiin an hrilh a. Tichuan, a thinlung leh a khua leh tuite thinlung chu, ramhnuai thingte thliin a tinghîng suau suau ang hian tihnghînin a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chuan Isaia hnênah, “Nang leh i fapa Sear-jasuba chu, dîl chhakta zâwk tuilâkna tâwpah, Puansutu Phûl lamlianah chuan, Ahaza hmuak tûrin kal chhuak tawh ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a hnênah, ‘Fîmkhur la, awm hle hle rawh; meichher bung khu mai mai pahnih, Suria lal Rezina leh Remalia fapaa thinurna nasa tak chu hlau suh la, i thinlung chu zâm suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Juda chu han beiin han tibuai ila, chutah chuan kan tân luhna tûr siamin, a lai takah Tabeela fapa chu lalah i ṭhuttîr ang u,” tiin, Suria leh Ephraim leh Remalia fapa chuan an phiar che avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a: “An thu phiar chu a puitling lo vang a, a hlawhtling hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Suria lû chu Damaska a ni a, Damaska lû chu Rezina lek a ni si a. Kum sawmruk leh kum nga ral hmain Ephraim chu chi tih tlâk loh va awm tûrin tihchhiat vekin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ephraim lû chu Samari a ni a, Samari lû chu Remalia fapa lek a ni si a. In rin duh loh chuan tihnghehin in awm ṭhuai lo vang,” tiin,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Ahaza a be leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Lalpa i Pathian hnênah chhinchhiahna dîl rawh; Seol thûk tak ata emaw, vân sâng tak ata emaw,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahaza erawh chuan, “Ka dîl lo vang, Lalpa pawh ka fiah hek lo vang!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Aw Davida chhûngte u, tûnah ngaithla teh u; mihring tihhah hi thil tê tak têah in ruat a ni maw, ka Pathian lam pawh tihhah in duh zêl ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa ngei chuan chhinchhiahna a pe ang che u: ngai teh u, nula thianghlim pakhat a rai ang a, fapa a hring ang a, a hmingah Immanuela a sa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan thil ṭha lo lam duh loh nachâng a hriat hunah leh, thil ṭha lam duh nachâng a hriat hunah chuan bâwnghnute khal leh khawizu a ei ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naupang chu thil ṭha lo lam duh loh nachâng leh, thil ṭha lam duh nachâng a hriat hma pawhin lal pahnih i huatate ram chu a ṭiau dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ephraim chuan, “Juda a ṭhen ni ata la thleng ngai lo nite chu Lalpa chuan i chungah leh, i khua leh tuite chungah leh, i pa chhûngte chungah chuan a thlentîr ang, Assuria lal ngei chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa chu Aigupta lui tâwp rêttea tho awm leh, Assuria rama khuai awm chu, ko tûrin a faifûk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, an lo kal ang a, an zain kawr chhe rek rukah te, lungpui pûkah te, hnim hlîng nei zawng zawngah te, ran tlatna hmun zawng zawngah te an fu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Lalpan bakmehchem hawh, Luipui piah rama Assuria lal awm chu hmangin, lû leh ke hmul chu a ziat fai ang a; khabe hmul pawh a ziat bo vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, mi pakhatin bâwngla pakhat leh berâm pahnih chauh a vulh ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />nimahsela, heti hi a ni ang a, hnute tui tam tak an la pêk dâwn avângin hnute tui khal a ei ṭhîn ang; ram chhûnga la awm apiangin hnute tui khal leh khawizu an ei ṭheuh dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, hmun tin, grêp hrui sâng, tangkaraw sâng man awmna apiangte chu buar leh hnimhlîngnei hmun mai a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ram zawng zawng chu buar leh hnimhlîngnei hlîr a lo nih tâk avângin, chutah chuan thal leh thal ngul kengin an kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, tlâng, bâwngtuthlawha laih tawh zawng zawngah chuan, buar leh hnimhlîngnei hlauh avângin i kal lo vang a; bâwngchalte tlattîrna leh berâm chîl mai mai atân a ni tawh zâwk ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Lehkha ziakna phêk hlai tak la la, mihring kawlawmin a chungah ‘Maher-salal-has-baza tân’ tiin ziak rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tichuan, hretu rinawm, puithiam Uria leh Jeberekia fapa Zekaria chu hriatpuitu atân ka siam ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, zâwlneinu hnênah chuan ka kal a; tichuan, ani chuan nau a pai a, fapa a hring ta a. Chutichuan, Lalpan ka hnênah, “A hmingah Maher-salal-has-baza sa rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naupang chuan, ‘Ka nu,’ ‘Ka pa,’ tih nachâng a hriat hmain Damaska hausaknate leh Samari laka râllâk sumte chu Assuria lal hmaah an kal bopui dâwn si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah a sawi leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hêng chite hian Silo-a tui dam taka luang dêl dêlte chu an duh loh avâng leh, Rezina leh Remalia fapa chunga an lâwm avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ngai teh, Lalpa chuan Luipui tui, khauh tak leh tam tak (Assuria lal leh a ropuina zawng zawng) chu an chungah a luantîr ang; tichuan, a kuang zawng zawng chu a lo liam dûl dûlin, a kam zawng zawngah pawh a liam dûl dûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda-ho ram thlengin a tuam lût dûl dûl ang a, a liamin a luang tlang dûl dûl ang a, nghâwng pawh a chîm phâk hial ang; tin, a thla zâr chuan, aw Immanuel, i ram vâng lam zawng zawng hi a awh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Chi tinte u, buai ta nuai nuai che u, keh sawmin in awm dâwn nia; ram hla taka mi zawng zawngte u, beng chhi rawh u. Inrâlthuam rawh u, keh sawmin in awm dâwn nia; inrâlthuam rawh u, keh sawmin in awm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inrâwn khâwm rawh u, eng mah a ni hlei lo vang e; thu sawi rawh u, a puitling hlei lo vang e, Pathian kan hnênah a awm si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan kut chak takin heti hian ka hnênah a sawi a, he chite kawngah hian ka kal ve lohna tûrin mi thunun a nih hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“He chite hian, ‘Phiar an nei e,’ an tih ṭhin nazawng chu, ‘Phiar an nei e,’ ti ve suh u; an ṭih pawh chu ṭih ve lovin, hlau ve hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa , amah ngei chu in tithianghlim tûr a ni; amah chu in ṭiha ni sela, amah chu in hlauhva ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chu hmun thianghlim a ni ang a; Israela chhûng hnihte tân erawh chuan tlûkna lung leh dâlna lungpui a ni zâwk ang a, Jerusalem-a awmte tân thang leh fal a ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, mi tam takin chu chu an chhuihin an tlu ang a, tihkehin an awm ang a, an âwk ang a, manin an awm ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hriattîrna thu zial hi phuar la, dân thu hi ka zirtîrte zîngah nemin chhinchhiah rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan Jakoba chhûngte laka a hmai thuptu Lalpa chu ka nghâk ang a, amah chu ka thlîr reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai teh, kei leh Lalpa mi pêk naupangte hi, Israel-ho zîngah hian Sipaihote Lalpa , Zion tlânga awm laka chhinchhiahna atânte leh thilmak atânte kan ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, miin, “Ramhuai aienthiam zâwl leh dawithiam hrâm chuap chuap leh phun nuah nuahte chu râwn rawh u,” an tih hunah che u chuan heti hian chhâng rawh u: “Miten an Pathian chu an râwn zâwk tûr a ni lâwm ni? Mi nungte tân chuan mitthi an râwn tûr em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dân Thu leh Hriattîrna Thu chu râwn tûr a ni,” tiin. Chumi thu ang zêla an sawi loh chuan an tân khua rêng rêng a vâr ṭhuai dâwn lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangang tak leh rilṭâm chungin ram chu an fang ang a; tin, heti hi a ni ang a, an ril a ṭâm hun chuan an thin chu a ur êm êm ang a, an lal leh an Pathian chu ânchhia an lawh bawrh bawrh ang a, an vanvadâk vak vak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, lei lam an en ang a, manganna leh thimna, thlaphân nguina chu an hmu ang; tichuan, thim chhah mupah hnawh bovin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nimahsela, thlaphânga awm tawhi tân chuan nguina rêng rêng a awm tawh lo vang. Hmânlai chuan Zebulun ram leh Naphtali ram chu hmuhsitawmin a awmtîr a; nimahsela, hun hnuhnûngah chuan ropui takin a awmtîr ta, dîl kamah, Jordan râlah, hnam tin Galili chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi, thim hnuaia kalte chuan êng nasa tak an hmu ta; thihna hlim rama awmte chungah ngei chuan êng chu a lo êng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hnam chu i titam ta a, an hlimna pawh i tipung ta; buh seng laia hlim angin i hmaah an hlim ta a, miin râllâk sum an sema an hlim ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ritphurhna nghâwngkawl leh a kokia zâwn fung, a hnehchhiahtu talhtum chu, Midian-ho hneh ni ang khân i tihtliahsak ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Indona hmuna mi râlthuama an inthuamna zawng zawngte leh an silhfên thisen kai hniang hnuangte chu hâla tuah ral tûr lek a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan tân naupang a lo piang a, fapa pêkin kan awm ta a; rorêlna chu a kokiah a chuang ang a: a hmingah chuan Remruattu Maka, Pathian Chaka, Chatuan Pa, Remna Lal, an ti dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ram a zau zêl ang a, a ramah remnain tâwpintai a nei lo vang; Davida lalṭhutthlêngah a ṭhu ang a, dik tak leh fel taka rorêlin a rawn tinghet ang, tûn aṭanga kumkhuain. Sipaihote Lalpa ṭhahnemngaihna chuan chûng chu a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jakob-ho ramah thu a thawn a, Israel-ho chungah a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, mi zawng zawng, Ephraim-ho leh Samari-a awm, chapo tak leh rilrua uangthuang taka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Leirawhchante chu chim mah sela, lung chang chherin kan rem mai ang; theipui thingte chu sah chhumin awm mah sela, sidar thingtein kan thlâk mai ang,” titute chuan an la hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan Rezina dotute chu amah do tûrin a chawisâng ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a hmêlma, a hma lama Suria-hote, a hnung lama Philistia-hote chu a chawk tho vang; tichuan, kâ ângin Israel-ho chu an ei zo vang. Chuti kauva a tih pawh chuan a thinur chu a la reh si lo va, a kut chu a la lek ta cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, mite chuan anmahni vawtu lam chu an hawi chuang si lo va, Sipaihote Lalpa chu an zawng chuang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan Israel-ho aṭang chuan a lû leh a mei, tûmkau leh phûngladin ang maiin ni khat thilah a chhawk vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Upa leh mi zahawmte chu a lû chu an ni a; dâwt zirtîr ṭhîn zâwlneite chu a mei chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hêng mite hruaitute hian an hruai sual ṭhîn a ni; an hruaiate chu tihboralin an awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chu an tlangvâlhote chungah a lâwm lo vang a, an fahrahte leh hmeithaite chu a khawngaih hek lo vang; an zain Pathian zah lo mi leh thil ṭha lo titute an ni ṭheuh va, kâ zawng zawng chuan thu lawi lo a sawi ṭheuh si a. Chuti kauva a tih pawh chuan a thinur chu a la reh si lo va, a kut chu a la lek ta cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Suahsualna chu mei angin a alh hluah hluah si ṭhîn a; buar leh hnimhlîngneite chu a kâng ral ṭhîn, a ni, ramhnuai thing bit zîngahte chuan a kâng hluah hluah a, a khu chho ngut ngut ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa thinur avângin ram chu a kâng chhia a, mite pawh chu meia tuah tûr thing ang an ni a; tu mân mahni unau pawh an zuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, miin an ding lama mi an chuh ang a, an ril a la ṭâm cheu vang; an vei lama mi an ei ang a, an tlai chuang lo vang; mi tinin mahni bân tî an ei ṭheuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Manase-hovin Ephraim-ho an ei ang a, Ephraim-hovin Manase-ho an ei ang; tin, an pahnih chuan Juda-ho an do dûn ang. Chuti kauva a tih pawh chuan a thinur chu a la reh si lo va, a kut chu a la lek ta cheu va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dân chimawm tak siama, thupêk khirh tak ngaihtuah chhuaktute u, in chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hetiang hian mi khawngaihthlâkte dik takin in rêlsak duh lo va, retheite ṭhat vena tûr in dang tlat a, hmeithaite in ei a, fahrahte in rawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, an kan nîah che u leh hla tak aṭanga ṭiauna lo thleng tûrah chuan eng nge in tih tâk ang le? Ṭanpui dîlin tu hnênah nge in tlân tâk ang le? In ropuina chu khawiah nge in hnutchhiah tâk ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Salho hnuaiahte an kûn ang a, thahho hnuaiahte an tlu ang, chu chauh chu an chan a ni tawh ang. Chuti kauva a tih pawh chuan a thinur chu a la reh si lo va, a kut chu a la lek ta cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hawh Assuria mi, ka thinurna talhtum, ka lungnih lohna kengtu tiang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Râllâk la tûr leh, thil lâksak la tûr leh, kawtthlêr chirhdiak anga rap tûrin ani chu Pathian zah lo hnam do tûrin ka tîr ang a, ka thinurna mite bei tûrin thu ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chuan chutiang chu a tum a ni lo va, chutiang chu a rilru pawhin a ngaihtuah hek lo; hnam tam namên lova tam tihchhiat leh tihboral a ni a rilrûk zâwk ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka mi lian zawng zawngte hi lal vek an ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kalno khua chu Karkhemis khua ang mai a ni tawh lâwm ni? Hamath khua chu Arpad khua ang mai a ni tawh lâwm ni? Samari khua chu Damaska khua ang mai a ni tawh lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka kut hian milemho ram, Jerusalem khua leh Samari khuaa mi aia milem siam chawp ṭha zâwk neitu pawh, a zawng chhuak ta si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samari khua leh a milemte chunga ka tih ang khân, Jerusalem khua leh a milemte chungah pawh hian ka ti ve lo vang em ni?” a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa chuan Zion tlâng leh Jerusalem khaw chunga a hnathawh tûr zawng zawng a thawh zawh hunah chuan, Assuria lal rilru uangthuang rah leh a mit chapo ropuina chu ka la hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka kut chaknain ka ti ta a ni, ka finna nên hian, ka bengvâr si a; chi tin ramrîte lah chu ka sawn a, an rote lah ka chhuhsak a, lalṭhutphaha ṭhute lah chu mi huai tak tih angin ka hnûk thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka kut hian chi tin hausaknate lah chu sava bu angin a zawng chhuak a; miin sava tui a pui rauhsan hnute an la angin leilung luah zawng zawng hi ka la vek ta a ni; thla zâp emaw, kâ âng emaw, hrâm emaw rêng rêng pawh an awm lo,” a ti vei si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hreipui hian thil cheh nâna hmangtu chu a uankhum dâwn em ni? Thingzaina hian a hrûttu chu a hnuaichhiah dâwn em ni? Talhtumin a lektute chu a lek vêl zâwk ang leh, tiangin thing ni si lo a lek zâwk ang mai hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a mi thaute zîngah chuan chêrna a tîr ang a; a ropuina hnuaiah chuan mei alh lai mêk ang hian mei chhêmin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Israel-ho Êntu chu mei atân a ni ang a, an Mi Thianghlima chu mei alh atân a ni bawk ang; chu chuan ni khat thilah a hnimhlîngneite leh a buarte chu a tikângin a tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ram ngaw leh a lei ṭha hmun ropuina pawh chu, thlarau leh taksa lamin a tiboral ang; tichuan, chhinchhiahna kengtu a chauh hun lai ang a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ram ngawa thing la awm chhunte chu naupang ziak tham leka tlêm a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Israel-ho la awm chhunte leh Jakoba chhûngte zînga a la damte chuan, anmahni thattu chu an ring leh tawh lo vang a; Lalpa , Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chu tihtak zetin an ring tawh zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A la awm chhun, Jakob-ho la awm chhunte chu, Pathian chak tak hnênah chuan an la kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />I mi Israel-ho chu tuifinriat ṭiau vaivut zâtin awm mah sela, a la awm chhunte chauh chu an kîr leh dâwn si a; rorêlna dik takin a tihchhiat vek tûr an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan tâwpna, tâwpna thleng ngei tûra ruat tlat chu, lei chung zawng zawng lailiah chuan a la siam dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, “Aw ka mi, Zion-a awmte u, Aigupta rama an tih ang khân talhtuma vua che uin a tiang chu in chungah lek mah sela, Assuria mi chu hlau suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rei lo tê achinah chuan lungnih lohna chu hrîk thlâkin a awm tawh ang a, ka thinurna pawh anmahni tihboralnain hrîk thlâkin a awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Oreb lungpuia Midian-ho an thah lai ang khân, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan amah bei tûrin vuakna chu a chawk tho vang a; a tiang chu tuifinriat chung lamah a awm ang a, Aigupta rama a lek ang khân a lek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, a ritphurh chu i koki ata lâk bovin a awm ang a, a nghâwngkawl chu i nghâwng ata lâk bovin a awm bawk ang, hriak thih avâng chuan nghâwngkawl chu tihchhiatin a awm tawh ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aiath khua a thleng ta, Migron khua a kal tlang ta; Mikmas khuaah a bungrua a dah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kâwnah an liam ta; Geba khuaah an riak ta. Rama khawho chu an khûr an khûr ta; Saula Gibea khawho chu an tlân bo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aw Galim khaw fanu, i awin ring takin au rawh! Aw Laisa khua, ngaithla rawh! Aw Anathoth, i va khawngaihthlâk êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Madmena khawho tlân bovin an awm ta; Gebim khuaa awmte chu tlân bo tumin an inhâwr khâwm luai luai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Vawiin ngei hian Nob khuaah a châm dâwn; Zion fanu tlâng, Jerusalem mual pâwng chu, a kut a thin khum e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan thil râpthlâk takin a zârte chu a sât thla ang a; sâng tak takte chu kihin a awm ang a, a lawr bîkte pawh chu râwt hniamin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thîrin ramhnuai thing bit takte chu a kit ang a, Lebanon sidar thingte chu mi ropui kihin a tlu dur dur ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesaia bul aṭangin chawrno a lo chhuak ang a, a zung aṭangtea puak chhuak chu a rah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa thlarau - finna leh hriat theihna thlarau, remruatna leh chakna thlarau, hriatna leh Lalpa ṭihna thlarau chu - a chungah a fu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lâwmna chu Lalpa ṭihnaah a ni ang, a mita a hmuh angin ro a rêl lo vang a, a benga a hriat angin a zilhhau hek lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />retheite chu fel takin ro a rêlsak zâwk ang a, leia mi thuhnuairawlhte tân chuan thlei bîk nei lovin a zilhhausak bawk ang; a kâ talhtumin lei hi a vua ang a, a hmuia thawin mi suaksualte chu a that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Felna hi a taihrên a ni ang a, rinawmna hi a kawnghrên a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chinghnia chu berâmno nên an awm dûn tawh ang a, keitê chu kêlno nên an bawk dûn tawh ang; bâwngno leh sakeibaknei vânglai leh ran châwm thaute chu an awm ho tawh ang a; naupang têin a hruai duah duah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sebâwng leh savawm an tla ang a; an notête chu an bawk za dial dial tawh ang; tin, sakeibaknei chuan bâwngpa angin buhpâwl a ei tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nau hnute hne lai chu rûlrial kaw kotlângah a tualchai ang a, nau hnute hnêk bâng tawh chuan rûlmuk tawmkûk kotlângah a kut a nghat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tlâng thianghlimah rêng rêng chuan intihnat a awm tawh lo vang a, intihchhiat a awm tawh hek lo vang, tuite hian tuifinriat a khuh reng angin, leilung hi Lalpa hriatnain a khat zo vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Jesaia zung, mi tin chhinchhiahna atâna ding chu, amah ngei chu hnam tinin an râwn ang a; a chawlhna hmun chu a ropui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa chuan a miteho thi bâng la awm chhun, Assuria ram ata te, Aigupta ram ata te, Pathros ram ata te, Kus ram ata te, Elam ram ata te, Sinar ram ata te, Hamath khua ata te, tuifinriat thliarkâr atate la leh tûrin a vawi hnihnaah chuan a kut a la phar leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, hnam tin tân chhinchhiahna a târ chhuak ang a, Israel hnawh chhuahhote chu a hruai khâwm ang a, Juda darhhote chu kâwlkil li ata a hruai khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Ephraim-ho îtsîkna chu a bo tawh ang a, Juda-ho tibuaitute chu tihboralin an awm tawh ang; Ephraim-hovin Juda-ho an îtsîk tawh lo vang a, Juda-ho pawhin Ephraim-ho chu an tibuai tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, anniho chu thlang lamah Philistia-ho kokîah chuan zuk thlâwkin an zuk fu ang a; khawchhak fate chu an rawk za ang; Edom leh Moab-ho chungah chuan an kut an thlâk ang a; Amona thlahte chuan an thu an âwih tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Aigupta tuifinriat tengsâwl chu a tichhe vek ang a; Luipui pawh chu a thli lum huam huam chuan a kut a thin khum ang a, luitê pasariha siam khawpin a vua ang a, mite chu kephah pawh huh lovin a kal kaitîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, Aigupta ram ata an chhoh nia Israel-ho tâna lamlian a lo awm ang khân, a miteho thi bâng la awm chhunte tân chuan Assuria ram aṭangin lamlian a lo awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan heti hian i la sawi ang, “Aw Lalpa , lâwm thu ka hrilh ang che; ka chungah lo thinur ta mah la, i thinur chu a reh ta a, nangin mi thlamuan ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh, Pathian chu mi chhandamtu a ni a, ka ring ang a, hlauvin ka awm lo vang; ‘ Lalpa JEHOVA chu ka chakna leh ka hla a ni si a; mi chhandamtu a lo ni ta bawk a,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, chhandamna tuikhur ata te chu hlim takin tui in la chawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hian in la sawi ang, “ Lalpa hnênah chuan lâwmthu hril ula, a hming lam ula, a thiltihte chu mi tin zîngah hriattîr ula, a hming chu chawimawiin a awm tih sawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chawimawiin hla sa rawh u, ani chuan thil ṭha berte chu a lo ti tawh si a; chu chu leilung luah zawng zawngah hian hriatin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion-a awmte u, ring takin au ula, au tuar tuar rawh u, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima in zînga awm chu a ropui si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon khaw phur rit, Amoza fapa Isaian a hmuh chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi lianho kawngkâahte chuan an luh theihna tûrin, tlâng kawlh vulah chuan chhinchhiahna târ chhuak ula, ring takin anni chu au ula, kutin zaizir rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimah ngeiin ka mi ruatho chu thu ka pe ta, a ni, ka mi chak tak, ka mi induh taka hlimte chu, ka thinur hrithlatu atân ka ko ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu! Tlânga mipui au thâwm, mipui tam tak thâwm ang mai chu! Chu! Hnam tin rama mi awm khâwmho sa mur mur thâwm chu! Sipaihote Lalpa chuan râl bei tûrin sipaiho a pun hlawm a nih chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anniho, Lalpa leh a lungnih lohna hriamhreite chu, ram hla tak ata, kâwlkil tâwp rêt aṭangin, ram zawng zawng hi tichhe tûrin an lo kal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chiau vak vak rawh u, Lalpa ni chu a hnai tawh si a; Engkimtitheia aṭangin chhiatna a lo thleng dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, kut zawng zawng a chak lo vang a, mihring thinlung tinrêng pawh a tui ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An hlau vang a, natna leh lungnih lohnate chuan a man hlawm ang a; hmeichhe nau vei ang maiin an nâ ang; mak intitawnin an awm hlawm ang; an hmêlte chu mei alh hmêl ang mai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh, ram tiṭiau tûr leh chuta mi sualte chu a chhûng ata tiboral tûrin, Lalpa ni chu nasa takin, thinrimna leh thinurna nasa tak nên a lo thleng dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vân arsite leh a chhohreivûngte chuan an êng an chhuah lo vang a; ni chu a chhuah laia tihthimin a awm ang a, thla pawhin a êng chu a êntîr dâwn tawh lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, khawvêl hi an sualna avângin ka hrem ang a, mi suaksualte chu an khawlohna avângin ka hrem bawk ang; tin, mi chapo ṭawng chaltlai chu ka tireh ang a, mi hlauhawm chapona chu ka tihniam bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi hi rangkachak thianghlim ai pawha vâng zâwkin ka siam ang a, mihring ngei hi Ophir rangkachak thianghlim ai pawha vâng zâwkin ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, vân khi ka tikhûr ang a, Sipaihote Lalpa thinrim avângin, a thinurna nasa tak nîah chuan, lei pawh hi a awmna hmun sawn dâwrh khawpa tihnghînin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, sakhi ûm nek ang leh berâm tu ma khalh khâwm loh angin, mi tinin mahni chipuite lam ṭheuh an hawi ang a, mi tin mahni ram lamah ṭheuh an tlân bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu pawh an hmuh apiang chhun tlangin an awm ang a, tu pawh an man apiang khandaiha tihthlûkin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An nausênte pawh an mit hmuhah sawm dep khawpa lei vuak nâna hmanin an awm ang a; an inte chu rawkin a awm ang a, an nupuite chu pâwngsual tâwkin an awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai teh, Media-ho anmahni bei tûrin ka chawk tho vang a, chûngho chuan tangkarua an ngaihsak lo vang a, rangkachakah pawh an lâwm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An thal ngulte chuan tlangvâlte chu a tisawm ang a, mi rîla rah khawngaihna rêng rêng an nei lo vang a; an mit chuan naupangte a zuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, Babulon, ram tin ropuina, Kaldai-ho chhuan thil mawi tak chu, Pathianin Sodom leh Gomorra a tihboral lai ang khân a la awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eng tikah mah chutah chuan mi an awm tawh lo vang a, chhuan awm chhûng zawng zawng chuan a chhûngah awm an awm hek lo vang; Arab miten chutah chuan an puan in an zâr lo vang a, berâm vêngtuten chutah chuan an berâm rualte an bawhtîr hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thlalêra ramsate chutah chuan an bawk ang a, an inte chu thil nung ngui taktein a khat ang a; sava nghâwngseite chutah chuan an chêng ang a, sathârte chutah chuan an tualchai tawh zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, chinghniate chu an kulhbîngah chuan an hrâm ang a, sihalte pawh an lal in nuam tak takahte chuan an hrâm bawk ang. A hrem hun tûr chu a thleng dâwn tawh a, a nite pawh tihseiin a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jakob-ho a khawngaih ang a, Israel-ho chu thlangin anmahni ram ngeiah a la awmtîr dâwn si a. Ram dang mite chuan anmahni an zawm ang a, Jakoba chhûngte chu an vuan tlat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, mi tin chuan anmahni an hruai ang a, an hmun tûr chu an thlen ang a, Israela chhûngte chuan Lalpa ramah chuan anni chu bâwihpaahte leh bâwihnuahte an la nei ang a; anmahni sala neitute chu salah an la man ang a, anmahni tiduhdahtute chungah chuan ro an la rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, i lungngaihna ata te, i buaina ata te, hnathawh hautak zet an thawhtîrna che ata te Lalpan a chawlhtîr che nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />he tihelna thu hi Babulon lal au khumin i la sawi ang: “Engtizia nge hnehchhiahtu chu a va reh ta êm! Engtizia nge rangkachak khawpui chu a va reh ta êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi suaksual tiang a titliak ta, rorêltute lal tiang chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mi dang chunga râwngrâ taka inleka, an tlâwm tawhte tihduhdah bâng ngai lote.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leilung pum pui hi a châwl a, a reh rawih rawih a; hla an sa chhuak phut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ni, i chung thu avângin fârte chu an hlim a, Lebanon tlânga sidar thingte nên, ‘Tihtlâwma i awm achin chu kit thlutu tûr rêng rêng kan hnênah an lo chho ngai ta lo,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnuai lam ata Seol chu i lo thleng hmuak tûr chein, nangmah avângin a buai mur mur a ni; mitthi, leia puipa zawng zawng chu nangmah avângin a chawk tho va; hnam tin lal zawng zawng chu an lalṭhutphah ata a kai tho ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chuan nangmah biain, i hnênah heti hian an sawi ang: ‘Nang pawh keimahni angin i chak lo ve ta elo? Keimahni awm angin i awm ta elo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I ropui bûng bûngna chu Seol-a hruai thlâk a ni ta, i perhkhuang ri bur burte nên; changpât chu i hnuaiah an phah a, englo lungte chuan an khuh ta che a nih hi,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Aw vârparh, zîng lam fapa, eng tizia nge vân ata i tlâk tâk chu le! Hnam tin titlâwmtu, eng tizia nge leia sah thlâka i awm tâk chu le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I rilruah chuan, ‘Vânah ka chho vang a, Pathian arsite chung lamah khian ka lalṭhutphah ka chawisâng ang; inkhâwmna tlâng, hmâr tâwp rêta awmah chuan ka ṭhu ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chhûm aia sâng zâwkahte khian ka chho vang a, Chungnungbera ang maiin ka awm ang,’ i tih ṭhin vei nên khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, Seol-ah, khuarkhurum tâwp rêtahte chuan hruai thlâkin i awm dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hmu che apiangin an en ngun ang chia, ‘He mi hi maw lei tikhûra, ram tin tinghînga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />khawvêl thlalêr anga siama, a khaw awmte tiborala, a salte an in lama kal tûra chhuah ngai lova chu?’ tiin i chanchin an la chhût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hnam tin lal zawng zawng, an zain, mahni in ṭheuhvah ropui takin an muhîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang erawh chu a zung puak chhuak tenawm tak leh, râl thah, khandaiha chhun tlang, khuarkhuruma lungte zînga chhukho silhfên angin i thlân in aṭanga hla takah paih chhuahin i awm tâk zâwk hi, ruang rah beh ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I ram i tihchhiata, i khua leh i tuite i thah avângin an zîngah phûmin i awm ve lo vang; thil ṭha lo titute thlahte hming chu kumkhuain an lam lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An thawha, leilung an neiha, lei chung hi khuaa an tihkhah loh nân, an pute sualna avângin a fate thah zai rêl rawh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, “Anmahni bei tûrin ka tho vang,” Sipaihote Lalpan a ti, “Babulon aṭanga hming leh a la awm chhunte leh, fapa leh fapaa fapa chu ka tiboral ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Sakuh tân rovah ka siam bawk ang a, dîlahte pawh ka siam ang; tihboralna hmunphiahin ka phiat bawk ang,” Sipaihote Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan hetianga sawiin chhia a chham ta, “Matheilovin ka ngaihtuah ang tak hian a lo thleng ang a, ka ruat ang tak hian a awm bawk ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ka ramah chuan Assuria mi chu ka tichhia ang a, ka tlângahte chuan ka chîl nek ang, tih ang hian. Chumi hunah chuan a nghâwngkawl bahtîr chu anmahni aṭang chuan a bo tawh ang a, an rit phurhtîr chu anmahni kokî aṭang chuan a bo tawh bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu chu a ni, lei chung zawng zawnga thuruat chu ni, chu bawk chu a ni, hnam tinrêng chunga kut phar chu ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ruat tawh si a, tuin nge sûtsak ang? A kut chu pharin a awm tawh a, tuin nge lâk kîrtîr ang?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lal Ahaza thih kumah khân he phurrit hi a lo awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw, Philistia ram pum pui, nangmah vuakna tiang a tliah tâk avângin lâwm suh; rûl zung aṭang chuan rûlmuk a chhuak dâwn si a, a rah chu rûl alh thlâwk thei a la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi rethei fa tîrte chu an tla dial dial tawh ang a, mi, pachhiate chu him takin an bawk tawh ang; nanga zung erawh chu ṭâmin ka tithi ang a, i ta la awm chhunte chu thahin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aw kawngkhâr, chiau vak vak rawh; aw khawpui, au rawh; aw Philistia, i pumin i tui ral zo ta; hmâr lam aṭangin meikhu a lo chhuak si a, an hun ruatahte chuan hnufual rêng an awm ngai lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Philistia hnam palaite chu engtin nge kan chhân ang le? “ Lalpan Zion chu a din a, a mite zînga retheite chu amahah an tlu lût ang,” tiin a ni ang chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab ram phurrit chu. Zan khatah Moab rama Ar khua chu tihchhiatin a awm a, eng mah lova siamin a awm ta si a; zan khatah Moab rama Kir khua chu tihchhiatin a awm a, eng mah lova siamin a awm ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bajith-ah leh Dibon-ah, hmun sângahte chuan ṭap tûrin a chho ta a. Moab-ho chuan Nebo leh Medeba chu an ṭah khum vak vak a; an lû zawng zawng a kawlh vek a, khabe hmul tinrêng pawh mehin a awm ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An kawtthlêrahte chuan saiip puan an veng a; an in chungahte leh an mual zau laiahte chuan mi tin chu nasa taka ṭapin an chiau vak vak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Hesbon-ho pawh an au va, Eleale-ho nên an aw chu Jahaz khua lam pawhin an lo hria a; chuvângin, Moab-ho râlthuama inthuamte chu ring takin an au va; an nunna chu an kawchhûngah chuan a khûr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moab-ho avângin ka thinlung chu a au va; an mi ṭhate chu Zoar khuaah leh Eglath-selisija-ah an tlân a. Luhith chhovah chuan ṭap chungin an kal chho a ni; Horonaim kawngah chuan chhiatna auvin an au chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimrim tuite chu a kang ang a, hlobet chu a vuai zo dawn si a; hlobet chawrno chu a râwp a, thil hring rêng rêng a awm ta si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, an sum la neih chhunte leh an dah ṭhatte chu tuipuisuthlah Lui râlah chuan an kal bopui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Au thâwm chu Moab ramri vêlahte chuan a thang si a; a chiau vak vak thâwm chu Eglaim khaw lamah a thang a, a chiau vak vak thâwm chu Beer-elim khaw lamah a thang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dimon tuite chu thisenin a bual zo vek si a; Dimon chungah chuan thil nasa lehzual ka thlentîr dâwn si a, Moab-ho zînga tlân chhuakte leh, chu rama la awm chhunte hnênah chuan sakeibaknei ka tîr ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ram rorêltu tân berâmnote chu Sela khua thlalêr lama awm aṭang chuan, Zion fanu tlângah chuan thawn rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Moab fanute chu sava, a bu ata rau darh thlâwk thlâwkte angin, Arnon lui kaiahte an awm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rem min ruatsak la, ro min rêlsak rawh; i hlim chu chhûnlaiah zân angin siam la; hnawh chhuahte chu bihrûktîr rawh, tlân bo chu mantîr suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab zînga mi hnawh chhuaha awmte chu i hnênah awm rawh se; an tân tichhetu hmêl lakah chuan bihrûkna hmun ni rawh. Hlêprutu chu eng mah lova siamin a awm ta si a, tihchhiatna a reh ta a, hnehchhiahtute chu ram aṭang hian tihboralin an awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, lalṭhutphah chu khawngaihnaa tihnghehin a awm ang a; chumi chungah, Davida puan inah chuan mi pakhat, rorêlin, rorêlna fel zawngin, thil fel rang taka ti nghâlin tihtak zetin a ṭhu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moab-ho chapona thu, an chapo êm êm a ni tih kan lo hria a; an ṭawng chaltlaizia leh, an chapozia leh, an thinurzia thu chu; an uannate chu eng mah a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Moab-ho chu Moab-ho chungah an chiau vak vak ang a, mi tin an chiau vak vak ang. Kir-hareseth grêp rêp hlâwm chu lungchhe vânkaiin in la ṭah chhan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hesbon lote chu a chul zo ta si a, Sibma grêp hrui nên; hnam tin lalte chuan a kûng ṭha mite chu an titliak pheng phung a, Jazer khaw thleng thlengin a zâm hlawm a, thlalêrah a zâm lût a; a pêngte chu a zâm darh sung a, tuipui chu a zâm kai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, Sibma grêp hrui chu Jazer ṭahin ka ṭah ang a; aw Hesbon leh Eleale, ka mittuiin ka leih ang che; i nipui rahte chungah leh i buh seng chungah chuan inbei au thâwm chu a tla ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lâwmna chu lâksakin a awm ta, lo ṭha tak aṭangte chuan hlimna chu lâksakin a awm ta bawk a; grêp huanahte chuan hla sak rêng rêng a awm tawh lo vang a, thâwm hlimawm rêng rêng a awm tawh hek lo vang; grêp sâwrna khurahte chuan rap sâwrtu rêng rêngin uain an rap chhuak tawh lo vang; grêp seng au chu ka tireh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka rîlte hi Moab khawngaih avângin ṭingṭang angin a ri a, ka kawchhûng chu Kir-heres khawngaih avângin ṭingṭang angin a ri bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, Moab chu a inlan hunah, hmun sângah intihaha, ṭawngṭai tûra a hmun thianghlima a lo kal hunah chuan a hlawhtling lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chûng chu Moab chungchâng thu Lalpan tûn hma lama a sawi kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tûnah erawh chuan Lalpan , “Inhlawhfa kum chhiara kum thum chhûngin Moab ropuina chu, a mipui tam takte chawpin, hmuhsitawma awmtîrin a awm ang a; a la awm chhunte chu tlêm tê tak meuh, sawi tham loh an ni ang,” tiin a sawi ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Damaska khaw phurrit chu. “Ngai teh, Damaska chu khawpui ni tawh lo tûrin lâk bo a ni ta; tichuan, in chim khâwm mai a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aroer khuate chu tlânsanin a awm ta; berâm rualte awmna tûr a ni mai ang, chûng chu an bawk ang a, tu mân an tihlau lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ephraim lakah kulhpui chu a bo vang a, Damaska lakah ram chu a bo vang, Suria rama la awm chhunte pawh an bo vang, Israela thlahte ropuina ang lekin an awm ang,” Sipaihote Lalpan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Jakoba ropuina chu tihchêrin a awm ang a, a tisa thauna chu a lo chêr tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, buh sengtupan buh a lâka, a vuite chu kuta a hlep ang mai hi a ni ang a; a ni, Rephaim ruamah miin buh vui hmaihte chu an chhar ang mai hi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, olive thing vuak hnua a ziding sâng ber chhîpah rah pahnih pathum emaw, thing rah tak zâr sei berah te pali panga emaw a awm ṭhîn ang hian, chutah chuan hmaih chhar tûr a la awm ang,” Lalpa , Israel-ho Pathian chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan miin an Siamtu lam an en tawh ang a, an mitte chuan Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chu a thlîr tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maichâm, anmahni kutchhuak lamte chu, an en tawh lo vang a, anmahni kuta siam, Aseri-te emaw, ni lemte emaw an zah tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan an khaw nghet takte chu ngawbing leh tlâng chhîpa hmun tlânsan hnu, Israela thlahte hmaa an tlânsan hnu ang kha a ni ang; tichuan, hmun tihṭiau a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian, i chhandamtu i theihnghilh a, i chakna lungpui chu i hre reng si lo; chuvângin, kûng mawi tak takte i phun ṭhîn a, a chhûngah chuan ṭang danglamte i vit bûr fur ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />i phun niin i ping vêl ṭhîn a, zîngah chuan i thil chi chu i tipâr ṭhîn; nimahsela, rah lawh chu lungngaihna leh natna nasa tak nîah chuan a bo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A, mipui tam tak ri dur dur, tuifinriat ri dur dur anga ri dur durte leh, hnam tin ri hum hum, tui nasa tak ri hum hum anga ri hum humte chu aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnam tin chu tui tam tak ri hum hum angin an ri hum hum ang: nimahsela, ani chuan a zilhhau vang a; tichuan, hla takah an tlân bo vang a, tlânga buhsî thli len ang leh vaivut thlipui len vir mup mup angin ûmin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tlai lamah chuan, ngai teh, thil râpthlâk tak a awm a; tin, khawvâr hmain an awm ta lo. Chu chu râllâka min lâksaktute chan a ni a, min rûksaktute pual a ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A, thla zâp ri hum hum ram, Ethiopia rama luite râla awm,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tuipuiah, tui chunga luang lawngahte palaiho tîrtu chu! Zualko chak takte u, hnam sâng thlerh thlawrh, mâm tak hnênah, an chhuah ṭan achin tûn thlenga mi hlauhawm takte hnênah chuan kal rawh u; chu hnam chuan ram an sem ṭhîn a, an rap thlu bawk ṭhîn, an ram chu luite chuan a sem darh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawvêla awm zawng zawng leh leilung luahte u, tlângahte chhinchhiahna an târ chhuah hunah en rawh u; tawtawrâwt an ham hunah ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpan ka hnênah heti hian a sawi a ni: “Ka awm hle hle ang a, ka awmnaah hian ka thlîr reng ang; ni sat laia khaw lum thiang vel vul ang leh buh seng khaw lum laia daifîm chhûm ang hian,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Grêp lawh hun hmaa a pâr a rêma, a pâr chu grêp puama a lo chan hunah chuan, a pêng tê tê chu thei kûng ah chhumna chemtein a ât chhum dâwn si a, a pêng zâm darhte chu a la bovin a sât chhum bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng chu tlânga sava kohamte tân leh, leia sate tân chuan hnutchhiahin an awm hlawm ang; tichuan, sava kohamte chuan anni chu nipui chhûngin an ei ang a, leia sa zawng zawng chuan thlasik chhûngin an ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan, Sipaihote Lalpa hming awmna hmun, Zion tlângah chuan, Sipaihote Lalpa hnêna pêk atân mi sâng thlerh thlawrh, mâm takte hnên ata, an chhuah ṭan achin tûn thlenga mi hlauhawm takte hnên ata chu, lâwmman an rawn sin ang; chu hnam chuan ram an sem ṭhîn a, an rap thlu bawk ṭhîn, an ram chu luite chuan a sem darh a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta ram phurrit chu. Ngai teh, Lalpa chu chhûm chak tak chunga chuangin Aigupta ram a lo thleng ta e; Aigupta ram milemte chu a hmaah chuan an khûr zawih zawih ang a, Aigupta-ho thinlung chu an kawchhûngah a tui ral mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tin, Aigupta mite chu Aigupta mite vêk bei tûrin ka chawk tho vang; tichuan, mi tinin mahni unau beiin, mi tinin mahni ṭhenawm beiin, an inkâp ang; khua leh khua an inbei ang a, ram leh ram an inbei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Aigupta-ho thlarau chu an kawchhûngah chuan eng mah lova siamin a awm ang a; an remruat chu ka tichhia ang; tichuan, milemte leh, aikaihthiamte leh, ramhuai aienthiam zâwlte leh, dawithiamte chu an râwn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mite chu hotu nunchhe tak kutah ka hlân ang a; tichuan, lal kawlh takin an chungah ro a rêl tawh ang,” Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, tuipui tuite chu a kang ang a, lui chu a luang bovin a lo kangchat tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Luite chu a rimchhia ang a; Aigupta ram tui luangte chu a kâm telh telh ang a, a kangchat mai ang; phairuangte leh tui hnimte chu a vuai zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nile lui kianga, Nile lui kam ngeia ran tlatna phûlte leh, Nile lui kianga thil chîn zawng zawngte chu a lo ro vang a, len bovin a awm ang a, a awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sangha mantute pawh chu an ṭap ang a, Nile luia nghakuai khai ṭhîn zawng zawngte chuan âwm an inchûm ang a, tuia lênkhang zâr ṭhînte chu an chau tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu zîza zai sîn dek mite leh puan ngo tah mite chu an mualpho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, a lung bante chu tihsawmin a awm ang a, inhlawhfa ṭhîn zawng zawngte chu an rilruin an lungngai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zoan khuaa mi liante chu an â ngawt mai; Pharaoa remruattu fing berte remruat chu sa remruat ang mai a lo ni ta; Pharaoa hnênah, “Mi fing fapa, hmasâng lalho fapa ka ni,” engtiziaa ti ṭhîn nge in nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawiah nge i mi fingte chu le? Anni chuan hrilh nghâl che rawh se; Aigupta ram chunga thil thleng tûr, Sipaihote Lalpa ruatte chu hre rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zoan khuaa mi liante chu mi â an lo ni ta a, Noph khuaa mi liante chu bumin an awm ta; Aigupta hnamho kila lungte chuan Aigupta-ho chu an vah botîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Aigupta-ho zîngah luhlulna thlarau a awmtîr ta; tichuan, zu rui mi chu a luakah a pai thlawk thlawk ang hian, Aigupta-ho chu an hnathawh tinrêngah a kal kawitîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta-ho tân luiin emaw, meiin emaw, tûm kauvin emaw, phûngladinin emaw thawhsak theih a awm tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Aigupta-ho chu hmeichheho ang an ni ang a, Sipaihote Lalpan an chunga a kut a thin avângin hlauvin an khûr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda rama awmho chu Aigupta-ho tân chuan râpthlâk tak an lo ni tawh ang a, an hming an lamna apiangte chuan an hlau vang, an chunga thleng tûr Sipaihote Lalpa thuruat avâng chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Kanaan-ho ṭawnga ṭawng leh, Sipaihote Lalpa hnêna chhechhama thu tiam ṭhînte chu, Aigupta ram chhûngah khaw panga a awm ang a; pakhat chu Boralna Khua an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Aigupta ram laiah chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a awm ang a, a ramrîah chuan Lalpa tân lungphun a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu chu Aigupta rama Sipaihote Lalpa tân chuan chhinchhiahna leh hriatna a ni ang; hnehchhiahtute avângin Lalpa an la au dâwn si a; tichuan, anin chhandamtu leh humhimtu a tîr ang a, ani chuan anniho chu a chhan chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chu Aigupta-ho hriat a ni tawh ang a, Aigupta mite chuan chumi nîah chuan Lalpa chu an hre tawh ang; a ni, inthawina leh thilpêkin chibai an bûk ang a, Lalpa hnênah chuan thu an tiam ang a, an hlen bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Aigupta-ho chu a vua ang; a vua ang a, a tidam bawk ang; tichuan, Lalpa hnênah an kîr leh ang a, ani chu anmahni ngen thlûkin a awm ang a, anmahni a tidam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Aigupta ram aṭangin Assuria ram thlengin lamlian a awm ang a; tichuan, Assuria mite chu Aigupta ramah an kal ang a, Aigupta mite chu Assuria ramah an kal bawk ang; Aigupta mite chuan Assuria mite nên Pathian chibai an bûk tlâng tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Israel-ho chu Aigupta-ho leh Assuria-ho pathumtu an ni ang a, lei lailîah hian malsâwmna an ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan, “Ka mi Aigupta-hote leh ka kutchhuak Assuria-hote leh ka rochan Israel-hote chu malsâwmin awm rawh se,” tiin mal a sâwm si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Assuria lal Sargona tirhin Tartana chu Asdod khuaa a lo kala, Asdod khua a beiha, a lâk kum khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />chumi lai chuan Lalpan Amoza fapa Isaia kâ chuan, “Kal la, i kâwnga saiip puan kha phelh la, i kêa i pheikhawk kha dah rawh,” tiin a sawi a. Tichuan, chutiang chuan a ti a, saruak leh pheikhawk bun lovin a kal a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Ka chhiahhlawh Isaia hi, Aigupta-ho chungah leh Ethiopia-ho chungah chhinchhiahna leh thilmak atân kum thum chhûnga saruak leh pheikhawk bun lova a kal ang hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Assuria lal chuan Aigupta-ho mante leh Ethiopia-ho salte chu, a pui a pangin, saruak leh pheikhawk bun lo leh mawng langin Aigupta-ho mualphona tûrin a hruai bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, an beisei ber Ethiopia-ho leh an ropuina ber Aigupta-ho avâng chuan, mangang tak leh mualpho takin an awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, chumi nîah chuan he tuifinriat kama mi hian, ‘Ngai teh, kan beisei ber, Assuria lal laka min chhan him tûra min puitu atâna kan tlânna chu, heti hi a ni ta si a; keini hi engtin nge kan tlân chhuah ang?’ an la ti ang,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuipui thlalêr phurrit chu. Chhim rama ṭhâwngaleivir a kal tlang angin thlalêr aṭangin, ram hlauhawm tak aṭang chuan a lo kal e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Inlârna khirhkhân tak ka hnênah hriattîr a ni tawh; vervêk taka titu chuan vervêk takin a ti a, rawktu chuan a rawk a. Aw Elam-ho, kal chho rawh u; aw Media-ho, hual rawh u; an rûmna zawng zawng chu ka tireh vek tawh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka kâwngte hi natna nasa takin a khat a, hmeichhe nau vei natna anga natnain mi man ta; benga hre thei lo khawpin na ka tuar a, khaw hmu thei lo khawpin ka mangang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thinlung hi a thaw hlawp hlawp a, thil râpthlâk takin mi tihlau va; tlai nêm ka nghahhlelh ṭhin kha ka tân khurhnaah a chang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dawhkân chu an buatsaih a, râlvêngtu chu an vêntîr a, an ei a, an in a. Mi liante u, tho ula, phaw kha hriak hnawih rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah heti hian a sawi a ni: “Kal la, râlvengtu vêntîr rawh; ani chuan a thil hmuh chu sawi rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sipai pâwl te, sakawr chung chuang, a kawp zêla kal te, sabengtung pâwl te, sanghâwngsei pâwl te a hmuh hunah chuan ngun takin a ngaithla kiau vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ani chu sakeibaknei angin a au va, “Aw Lalpa, chhûnah chuan râlvên bûk chungah hian ka ding fo va, zankhua khuain ka vênnaah hian mi awmtîr fo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />En teh, hetah hian mihring pâwl, sakawr chung chuang, a kawp zêla kal an lo kal e,” tiin. Tin, amah vêk chuan, “Babulon khua chu a tlâwm ta, a tlâwm ta! An pathianho milem siam chawpte zawng zawng chu leiah tihkeh sawmin a awm ta,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw ka buh vuak sa, ka hruiha buh, Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel-ho Pathian laka ka hriat chu ka hrilh che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Duma phurrit chu. Miin Seir tlâng aṭangin mi au va, “Râlvêngtu, zân hi eng ti nge ni tawh? Râlvêngtu, zân hi eng ti nge ni tawh?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Râlvêngtu chuan, “Zîng a lo ni dâwn ta e, zân pawh. In zawh duh chuan zâwt rawh u; hawi leh ula, lo kal rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Arabia ram chunga phurrit chu. Aw Dedan-ho khualzin pâwl tinte u, Arabia rama ramhnuaiah in riak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuihâl hnênah chuan tui an rawn la a, Tema rama awmte chuan an chawin tlân bote chu an hmuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khandaihte lakah, khandaih phawi sa lakah leh, thal ngul kawih sa lakah leh indona nasa tak lak ata tlân bo an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian ka hnênah a sawi si a: “Inhlawhfa kum chhiara kum khat chhûngin Kedar-ho ropuina zawng zawng chu a bo zo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />thal kâp mi, Kedara thlahte zînga mi chak tak la awm chhun chu, tlêm tê an ni ang; Lalpa , Israel-ho Pathian chuan chu chu a sawi tawh si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Inlârna ruam phurrit chu. Eng in ti nge ni le, in chungahte in lâwn vek ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw, au thâwma khat, khawpui sa mur mur, khaw hlim tak, i chhûnga an thahte chu khandaiha thah an ni lo va, inkahnaa thi an ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I rorêltu zawng zawng chu an tlân bo za a, thal kâp mite phuarin an awm a; i ta an hmuh zawng zawng chu phuar khâwmin an awm a, hla tak aṭanga rawn tlân bote chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, kei chuan, “Mi en lovin, lehlam en rawh u, ka ṭap vak vak dâwn e; ka miteho fanu râllâka an lâk thûah chuan mi hnêm duh harsa suh u,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inlârna ruamah hian buaina te, manganna te, rah behna te, Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa hnên ata a lo thleng a. Kulh bang tihchim a ni a, tlângahte mangangin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Elam-ho chuan thal bâwm an keng a, mihring chuanna tawlailîrte leh sakawr chung chuang mite nên; Kir-ho chuan phaw tuamna chu an phelh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, i ruam ṭha berte chu tawlailîrtein a khat ta a, sakawr chung chuang mite chu kulh kawngkhâr bulah an tlim hmur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Juda-ho khuhna chu a la bo va; tichuan, chumi nîah chuan ngawpui ina râlthuamna chu in en ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Davida khaw kulhpui chhe laite in en bawk a, a tam tih in hria a; tin, dîl thlangta zâwk tuite chu in luan khâwmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Jerusalem inte in chhiar a, kulhpui bang siam ṭhat nân inte chu in ṭhiat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dîl hlui tui awmna tûrin kulhpui pahnih kârah chuan tui tlin khâwmna in siam a; nimahsela, chûng titu lam chu in en si lo va, hmasânga lo siamtu chu in ngaihsak hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan, ṭap tûr leh âwm inchûm tûr leh lû tikawlh tûr leh saiip puan veng tûrin a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, ngai teh, hlimna leh lâwmna te, bâwng talhna leh berâm talhna te, sa eina leh uain inna te a awm ta zâwk a. “I eiin i in ang u, naktûkah chuan kan thi dâwn si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Sipaihote Lalpa chu ka bengah a inhriattîr a, “Matheilovin he sualna hi in thih hma loh zawng in lakah tlen fai a ni tawh lo vang, Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, “Kal la, he sum enkawltu tehchai hnênah hian, Sebna, lal in chunga hotua awm hnên ngeiah chuan, kal rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah heti hian sawi rawh: ‘Hetah hian eng nge i tih? Hetah hian tute nge i neiha, thlân hetah i ker kuak tehchai ni? Ama tân sâng taka thlân a ker kuaka, ama tân lungpuia awmna a siam tehchai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa chuan mi chakin a paih angin a paihin a paih vak ang che; a ni, a fûnin a fûn tlat ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan mathei lovin bâwl hlûm angin a tivir ang chia, ram zau takah a vawrh lût ang che; chutah chuan i thi ang a, chutah bawk chuan, nang, mahni lal in chhûng timualphotupa, i ropuina tawlailîrte chu a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I hnathawhna ata a hnawt chhuak ang chia, ani chuan i hotu nihna ata chu a hnûk thla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, ka chhiahhlawh Eliakima, Hilkia fapa chu ka ko vang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ani chu i kawrfual hi ka hâktîr ang a, i kâwnghrên hian ka tichak ang a, i rorêlna hi a kutah ka kawltîr ang; tichuan, ani chu Jerusalem-a awmte tân leh Juda chhûngte tân pa a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Davida chhûngte chabi chu a kokîah ka dah ang a; ani chuan a hawng ang a, tu mân an khâr lo vang; a khâr ang a, tu mân an hawng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chu, kilhna hi hmun nghet taka an kilh tlat angin ka tinghet tlat ang a; tichuan, ani chu a pa chhûngte tân lalṭhutphah ropui tak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, amahah chuan a pa chhûngte ropuina zawng zawng chu an la bâng vek ang, a fate leh a thlahte bungbêl tê tinrêng, berhbu bungbêl aṭanga tui dahna bungbêl zawng zawng thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan, kilhna, hmun nghet taka kilh tlat awm chuan a la dâwl lo vang; sah thlâka awmin, a tla tawh ang a, a chunga thil rit awm chu tihboralin a awm tawh ang; Lalpan chu chu a sawi tawh si a, Sipaihote Lalpa chuan a ti,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tura khaw phurrit chu. Tarsis lawng liante u, chiau vak vak rawh u; in rêng rêng awm lo khawpa Tura chu tihchhiata a awm tâk hi; chu chu Kupra ram aṭangin in lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuipui kama chêngte u, ngawi rawh u, Sidon khaw sumdâwngte u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuipui chunga kalin Aigupta ram Nile lui buh in chaw a, ram tinah in hralh a, in hlêp chu in sum hnâr ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Zidon, zak rawh; tuifinriat, tuifinriat kulhpui chuan thu a sawi ta si a, “Nau ka vei ngai lo va, ka hring ngai hek lo; tlangvâl lah ka châwm ngai hek lo va, nula pawh ka tiseilian ngai hek lo,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuthang chu Aigupta ram a thlen hun chuan Tura thuthang chu nasa takin an vei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tarsis-ah va kai ula; thliarkâra awmte u, chiau vak vak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hei hi maw in khaw hlim tak, a hlunzia murakeka mi tawh, a kêin hla taka awm tûra a hruai ṭhina chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lallukhum khumtîrtu khua Tura chungah hian tuin nge hei hi thleng tûrin ruat? Chuta sumdâwngtute chu mi liante an ni a, chuta sumdâwng mite chu leia mi zahawmte an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chuan chapote ropuina tihtlâwm leh khawvêl mi zahawmte tihmualpho a tum tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Tarsis fanu, Nile lui angin i ramah chuan luang liam rawh; i kâwng hrênna rêng rêng a awm tawh loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuifinriat chungah a kut a phar a, ramte chu a tinghîng a; Lalpa chuan Kanaan ram chungchâng thûah thu a pe a, a kulhbîngte tichhe tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Aw Zidon fanu nula, mi hnehchhiah, i hlim leh tawh lo vang. Tho la, Kittim ramah kai rawh; chutah pawh chuan chawlhna rêng rêng i hmu chuang lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />En teh, Kaldai-ho ram hi, hêng mite hi an awm tawh lo; Assuria mi chuan thlalêra ramsate tân a ruat tawh a ni. An in sângte chu an sa a, chuta lal inte chu an tiboral a, in chhiaah a siam ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tarsis lawng liante u, chiau vak vak rawh u; in kulhbîng chu tihchhiatin a awm tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Tura khua chu, lal pakhat kum chhiara kum sawmsarih chhûng chu theihnghilhin a awm ang. Kum sawmsarih ral hnuah chuan, nawhchizuar hlaa an sawi angin Tura khaw chungah chuan a la thleng ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nang nawhchizuar, mite theihnghilh tawh hnu, ṭingṭang la la, tual fang rawh; ṭingṭang kai la, hla tam tak sa rawh, hriata i awm leh theihna tûrin,” tih ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, kum sawmsarih a ral hnu chuan Lalpa chuan Tura khua chu a tlawh ang a, a sumdâwnna a chhunzawm leh ang; khawvêl ram tinah a inzuar leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, a sum deh chhuah leh a hlawh chu Lalpa hmaa awmte tân a ni dâwn si a, hnianghnâra an eiah leh, silhfên ropui tak an neih theih nân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa chuan lei hi a tiruakin, a tiram dâwn a, a khaikhup ang a, a awmate chu a tidarh dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, vântlâng chunga tih angin puithiam chungah pawh tih a ni ang; bâwihpa chunga a awm angin a pu chungah pawh a awm ang; bâwihnu chunga a awm angin a pi chungah pawh a awm ang; leitu chunga a awm angin hralhtu chungah pawh a awm ang; pûktîrtu chunga a awm angin pûktu chungah pawh a awm ang; a pung ûma pûktîrtu chunga a awm angin a hnêna a pung petu chungah pawh a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lei hi tihruah fai kêlh leh tihchhiat fai kêlhin a awm ang; chu thu chu Lalpan a sawi tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lei hi a ṭapin a chuai e, khawvêl hi a chauvin a chuai e, leia mi chungnungte chu an chau ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lei hi a awmnate hnuaiah chuan a bawlhhlawh zo ta; dânte chu an bawhchhiata, thuruat chu an tihdanglama, kumkhaw thuthlung chu an bawhchhiat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, ânchhe lawhnain lei hi a ei zo va, a awmate chu thiam loh chantîrin an awm ta; chuvângin, leia awmte chu an kâng hlum a, mi tlêm tê chauh an la awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uain thar chu a ṭap e, grêp hrui chu a chau ve, thinlunga hlim zawng zawngte chu an rûm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuangtête hlimna chu a reh e, lâwm taka awmte thâwm chu a tâwp e, ṭingṭang hlim ri chu a reh e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hla sa chungin uain an in lo vang; zû chu a intute tân kha tak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Buaina khawpui chu tihchimin a awm ta; tu mah rêng rêng an luh loh nân in tin khârin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uain avângin kawtthlêrahte chuan ṭap thâwm a awm a; hlimna zawng zawng tih thimin a awm a, he ram hlimna hi a bo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawpuiah chuan ṭiauna hnutchhiahin a awm a, a kulh kawngkhâr chu vuak chhiatin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lei lailîa mi tin zîngah hetiang hian a la awm dâwn si a, olive thing vuak hnua rah a la awm ṭhîn ang leh, grêp lawh hnua grêp hmaih lawh tûr a la awm ṭhîn ang mai hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chûngte chuan an aw an chhuah ang a, an au vang; Lalpa ropuina avângin tuifinriat aṭangin ring takin an au ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan Lalpa chu khawchhak lamah chawimawi rawh u, Lalpa , Israel-ho Pathian hming ngei chu, tuifinriat kam ruamahte chuan chawimawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kâwlkil tâwpa hla sakte kan hria, “Mi felte hnênah ropuina awm rawh se,” tih hla hi. Nimahsela, kei chuan, “Ka chêr tawlh tawlh a, ka chêr tawlh tawlh a, ka chung a pik e! Vervêk taka titute chuan vervêk takin an ti a; a ni, vervêk taka titute chuan vervêk tak takin an ti,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw leia awm, hlauhawmna te, khuarkhurum te, thang te chu i chungah a awm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, heti hi a ni ang a, hlauhawm thâwm aṭanga tlâna chu, khuarkhurumah a tla ang a; khuarkhurum chhûng ata chhuak chhova chu, thangah a âwk ang; chung lama tukverhte chu hawnin a awm si a, leilung nghahchhante chu a nghîng bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lei hi a keh chhe vek a, lei hi tihralin a awm zo va, lei hi nasa takin a nghîng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lei hi zu rui mi angin a pai thlawk thlawk ang a, bâwkte sâwi angin a sâwi luai luai ang; a bawhchhiatna chu a chungah rit takin a awm ang a; tichuan, a tlu ang a, a tho leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa chuan chung lama mi chungnungho pâwl lian tak chu a hrem ang, leia lei lalte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, mi tângho khuarkhuruma hruai khâwma an awm angin chûngho chu hruai khâwmin an awm ang a, tân inah khungin an awm ang a, ni rei tak hnuah chuan hremin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan thla khi zak takin a awm ang a, ni khi mualpho takin a awm ang; Sipaihote Lalpa chu Zion tlângah leh, Jerusalem khuaah leh, a upaho hmaah chuan ropui takin lalah a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang chu ka Pathian i ni a; ka chawimawi ang chia, i hming ka fak ang; thilmak tak, hmasânga remruatte chu, rinawm tak leh thutakin i ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawpui pawh lei pâwngah i chantîr a; khua kulhpui nei pawh khaw chhiaah i chantîr a; ram dang mite lal in pawh khua lovah i chantîr si a; eng tikah mah sakin a awm leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi chak takte chuan an chawimawi ang chia, hnam hlauhawm takte khawpui chuan an hlau vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi hlauhawmte thaw chu thlipuiin bang a nam sawk sawk anga a lo awm laite hian, nang chu mi rethei tân kulhbîng, pachhe mangan lai atân kulhbîng, thlipui lakah inhumhimna, ni sa hliahna i ni si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmun rova khaw lum chu i tireh ṭhîn ang hian, ram dang mite thâwm chu i tireh ang; khaw lum chu chhûm hliaha tihreha a awm ṭhîn ang hian, mi hlauhawmho hla sa chu tihrehin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, he tlângah hian Sipaihote Lalpa chuan mi tinrêngte tân thil thautein ruai a ṭheh ang, uain te a fê nêna inchiah reng, thil thau takte thlînga khat, uainte a fê nêna inchiah reng ṭha taka thlit fai chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, mi tinrêng an vawm khuhna pâwn lam leh, hnam tinrêng an khuhna chu he tlângah hian a tichhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thihna chu a lem hlen ta; Lalpa Pathian chuan mi zawng zawng hmai ata chu mittuite a hru fai ang a; a mite hmingchhiatna chu leilung luah zawng zawng ata a la bo vang; Lalpan chu chu a sawi tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan, “Ngai teh u, hei hi kan Pathian a nih hi; ani hi kan nghâk reng a; tichuan, min chhandam ang. Hei hi Lalpa chu a nih hi; ani hi kan nghâk reng a, a chhandamnaah chuan kan lâwmin kan hlim ang,” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />He tlângah hian Lalpa kut chu a innghat ang a, Moab chu, buhpâwl hi êkdûr thlia rah beha a awm ṭhîn ang hian, ama hmunah rah behin a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, tui hleuhtun tui hleuh tûra a vai ang hian, chumi zîngah chuan a kutte a vai ang; tin, a chapona chu a kut vervêkna chawpin Lalpan a dah hniam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, i kulh bangte in sâng kulhpui chu a tichimin, a dah hniamin, leiah, vaivut thleng rawk khawpin a titlu ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Juda-ho ramah he hla hi an sa ang: “Khawpui nghet tak kan nei a; ani chuan chhandamna chu kulh bangte leh kulhpuite tân a ruat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnam fel, thutak zâwmtu chu a luh theihna tûrin kulh kawngkhârte chu hawng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I chunga rilru nghattu chu, nangmah a rin che avângin thlamuang tak maia awm tûrin i vêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chu kumkhuain ring rawh u, Lalpa JEHOVA-ah chuan kumkhaw Lungpui a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chuan sâng taka awmte chu a titlâwm ta si a, khawpui sâng tak chu; chu chu a dah hniam a, lei thleng rawkin a dah hniam a, vaivut thleng rawkin a titlu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kê chuan a rap bet ang; retheite kê leh pachhiate pên ngei chuan,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi fel kawng chu dikna a ni a; nang thinlung dik tak pu chuan mi fel kawng chu i tirual ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ni, aw Lalpa , i rorêlna kawngah chuan kan nghâk reng chia; kan nunna duh zâwng chu i hming lam leh nangmah hriat rengna lam hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka nunnain zânah ka duh chia; a ni, ka kawchhûnga ka thlarau awm hian zîng takah ka zawng ang che; i rorêlnate chu leia a lo awm apiangin khawvêla awmte chuan felna chu an zir ṭhîn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi suaksual chu duhsakin awm mah sela, felna a zir chuang hlei lawng e; dikna ramah chuan dik lo takin a ti ang a, Lalpa ropuina a hmu chuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa , i bân i phar a, an hmu si lo; i mite tâna i ṭhahnemngaihna chu hmu se, an zak ang; a ni, nangmah dotute chu meiin a kâng ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa , nangin remna min ruatsak ang; nangin kan hna zawng zawng pawh min thawhsak si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan Pathian, nangmah chang ni lovin, lal dangte pawhin kan chungah thu an nei tawh ṭhîn a; nimahsela, nangma ṭanpui ngeiin i hming hi kan lam tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anni chu an thi ta a, an nung tawh lo vang; an ral ta a, an tho tawh lo vang; chuvângin, nangin anni chu i hremin i tichhia a, an hriat rengna zawng zawng pawh i tiboral ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />He hnam hi i tipung ta a, aw Lalpa , he hnam hi i tipung ta; nang chu chawimawiin i awm ta; he ram hi a ramri zawng zawng i tizau ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa , an mangan laiin an zawng ruai ṭhîn chia, i hremna chu an chunga a tlâk laiin an ṭawngṭai mawlh mawlh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmeichhe nau pai, hrin hun hnai tawh chu a na ṭhîn a, nau vei nâa a chiau vawng vawng ṭhîn ang hian, aw Lalpa , keini pawh i hmaah kan awm ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nau kan pai a, kan nâ a, thlî ang lek kan hrin kha; leiah hian chhan chhuahna kawng rêng kan tikaw lo va, khawvêla awmho lah an tlu hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I mitthite chu an nung leh ang a; ka mi ruangte chu an tho leh ang. Vaivuta awmte u, harh ula, hlim takin zai rawh u; i daifîm chu thlaite daifîm ang a ni a, lei hian mitthite chu a paih chhuak dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hawh u, ka mite u, in pindan chhûngahte lût ula, in kawngte chu inkhâr khum rawh u; lungnih lohna hi a kian hma loh chu, mit khap kâr lek pawh ni se, biru rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Lalpa chu an sualna avânga leia awmte hrem tûrin a awmna ata a lo chhuak dâwn a ni; lei pawh hian a thisente chu a tilang ang a, mi an thahte chu a khuh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Lalpa chuan, a khandaih hriam ṭha tak lian pui, rinawm tak chuan leviathan rûlpui chak tak leh leviathan rûlpui chhawknghawlh nghut chu a hrem ang a, tuipuia dragon awm chu a that bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan, grêp huan mawi tak chawimawiin hla sa rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hi a vêngtu ka ni; mitkhapkâr tinin tui ka leih ang a, tu mân an khawih loh nân a chhûn a zânin ka vêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thin a rim tawh lo va. Buar leh hnimhlîngneite lo awm mah se ka thlo vang a, hmun khatah ka hâl ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei min rem duh chuan ka ângchhûngah lo tlu lût se, mi rem rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hun lo la thleng tûrah chuan Jakob-ho chuan zung an kai ang a; Israel-ho chu an kuhmûmin an pâr ang; tichuan, lei chung hi rahin a tikhat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah vawtute a vuak ang takin amah chu a vaw ve em ni? A nih loh leh, ama thahte thahna ang takin amah chu thahin a awm em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah chu i kal botîr laiin a tâwk lekin amah chu i hnial a; khawchhak thli tleh nîah chuan a thaw na tak chuan amah chu a lên sawn ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, hei hian Jakob-ho khawlohna chu tlen fai a ni ang a, hei hi an sual kal bopuina rah hlîr a ni; Aseri-te leh ni lemte chu tho tawh lo tûr khawpin, maichâm lung zawng zawng chu, tlak lung den phel rem rum ang maia an siam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khua, kulhpui nei chu a khawhar a, awmna, mi hnuchhawn leh kalsan hnu a ni ta si a, thlalêr ang maiin; chutah chuan bâwngno a tla ang a, chutah bawk chuan a bawk ang a, a ṭangte chu a ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A zârte chu a vuai hun chuan thliahin a awm ang; hmeichheho an lo kal ang a, an hâl mai ang; hriat theihna rêng rêng nei lo mite an ni si a; chuvângin, an siamtu chuan anni chu a khawngaih lo vang a, anmahni dintu chuan anni chu a duh rêng rêng a duhsak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Lalpa chuan, lui a kuang khata luang dûl dûl aṭangin, Aigupta luitê thlengin a rah a vaw thla ang a; tichuan, aw Israela thlahte u, a mal mala chhiarin in awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, tawtawrâwt lian pui an hâm ang a; tichuan, Assuria rama boral lek lekhote leh, Aigupta rama hnawh chhuahho awmte chu an lo kal ang a; Jerusalem khuaa tlâng thianghlimah chuan Lalpa chu chibai an bûk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraim-ho zu ruih hmangte chapona lallukhum chung leh, an mawina ropui pangpâr chuai mêk, uain chiah hneha awmho ruam ṭha takin a khum chung chu a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa chuan mi chak thiltithei tak a nei a; ani chuan rial nasa tak tla dur dur, thlipui thil tichhe rem rum ang leh, tuilian nasa tak liam zur zur ang maiin leiah a paih chawrh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ephraim-ho zu ruih hmangte chapona lallukhum chu rah behin a awm ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />an mawina ropui pangpâr chuai mêk, ruam ṭha takin a khum chu, nipui hmaa theipui hmin hmasa ber, a entuin a hmuha, a kuta a awm veleha a ei zawh mai ṭhin ang chu an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Sipaihote Lalpa chu, a mi la awm chhunte tân ropuina lallukhum leh mawina lukhum te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />rorêl tûra ṭhua tân rorêlna thlarau te, kulh kawngkhâr bula rawn beiho dang kîrtute tân chakna te a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûngte pawh chu uain avângin an thle an thle a, zu avângin an pai an pai a; puithiamte leh zâwlneite chu zu avângin an thle an thle a, uain lem zawhin an awm a, zu avângin an pai an pai a; inlârna thûah an thle an thle ṭhîn a, rorêlna thûah an pai an pai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmun fai rêng rêng awm lo khawpin dawhkân zawng zawng chu luak leh thil bawlhhlawhin a khat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hriatna lam chu tu hi nge a zirtîr dâwn tehchai? Thuchah chu tu hi nge a hriattîr dâwn tehchai? Hnute hnêk bâng hlimte leh hnute hnêktîr tawh lohte hi em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thununna thu chunga thununna thu chherchhuana, thununna thu chunga thununna thu chherchhuana; dân chunga dân chherchhuana, dân chunga dân chherchhuana; hetah tlêm tê, sawtah tlêm tê,” tih hlîr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni; nimahsela, hmui danglam pu mi hmangin, ṭawng hrangin hêng mite hnênah hian thu a sawi tawh zâwk ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hei hi a ni, chawlhna chu ni, hahte chu chawlhtîr rawh u! Hei hi a ni, intihharhna chu ni,” a tihate chu; nimahsela, an ngaithla duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, an kala, zangthala an tlûka, an keh sawma, thanga an awha, mana an awm theihna tûrin, Lalpa thu chu anniho tân chuan, “Thununna thu chunga thununna thu chherchhuana, thununna thu chunga thununna thu chherchhuana; dân chunga dân chherchhuana, dân chunga dân chherchhuana; hetah tlêm tê, sawtah tlêm tê,” tih hlîr a ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan, mi hmuhsit hmang mite u, he mite, Jerusalem khuaa awmho rorêlsaktute u, Lalpa thu hi hre rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Thihna lakah thu kan thlung ta, Seol nên thu kan intiam ta; vuakna tuilian liam chu a luan tlang hunah pawh keini thleng chuan a luang lo vang; dâwt thute kan inhumhim nân kan hmang a, dâwt hnuaiah kan biru ta si a,” in tih avângin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />chuvâng chuan Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a sawi: “Ngai teh, lung, lung fiah hnu, a kila lung hlu tak phûm nghet tak chu, Zion-ah chuan lungphûm atân ka rem hi; a ringtu chu a hmanhmawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rorêlna fel chu a tihngîlna hruiah ka hmang ang a, felna chu dâr mûm khaiah ka hmang ang; rial chuan inhumhimna dâwt thute chu a chhu bo vek ang a, tuite chuan bihrûkna chu a chîm pil ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, thihna laka in thu thlun chu phelhin a awm ang a, Seol nêna in thu intiam pawh chu a ding chhuak lo vang; vuakna tuilian liam chu a luan tlang hunah, chumi hunah chuan a rah behin in awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A luan tlang apiangin a la zêl ang che u; a tûk a tûk tin, a chhûn a zânin a luang tlang dâwn si a; thuchah awmze hriat chu thil râpthlâk hlîr a ni ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khum chu thluan nân a tawi lutuk si a, puanthuah chu inkhuh nân a tê lutuk bawk si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hna, a hna danglam chu, a thawh theih nân leh, a thiltih, a thiltih danglam chu, a hlen theih nân, Lalpa chu Perazim tlânga a tho ang khân a tho dâwn si a, Gibeon ruama a thinur ang khân a thinur dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi hmuhsit hmangtute ni tawh suh u; chuti lo chuan, in kawl bunte chu rinawm takin an siam dah ang e; tâwpna, tâwpna thleng ngei tûra ruat tlat chu, lei pum pui chunga a thlen tûr thu Lalpa, Sipaihote Lalpa hnên aṭang chuan ka hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Beng chhi ula, ka aw hi hre rawh u; ngaithla ula, ka thusawi hi hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leilettu chuan chi theh nân lei a let reng ngai em ni? A lei tlangte chu a tikehin a tisawm reng ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A chung chu a chawh rual zawhin mohuri te chu a theh darh lo vem ni? Zîra te pawh a theh lo vem ni? Buh te pawh a tlarin, barli te pawh a hmun ruatah, vai buhtun te pawh a vau hrûlah a tuh ṭhîn lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A Pathian chuan ani chu fel takin a thununin a zîrtîr ṭhîn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mohuri chu buh chîlna khâwl hriamin an chîl ngai si lo va, zîra chungah chuan tawlailîr ke chu an lirhtîr ngai hek lo; mohuri chu tiangin an vua a, zîra chu talhtumin an vaw zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chhang siamna buh chu râwt sawmin a awm ṭhîn a, kumkhuain a vaw reng dâwn si lo; a tawlailîr ke leh a sakawrte chuan tidarh mah sela, a râwt sawmtîr ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chûng pawh chu Sipaihote Lalpa , inrâwnna kawnga mi mak tak leh, finna kawnga mi ṭha tak lakah chuan a chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E! Ariel, Ariel, Davida awm hmun khuarna khua! Kumah kum belh rawh u; kûtte chu lo thleng leh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan Ariel hi ka timangang ang a; tichuan, sûnna leh ṭahna a awm ang; tin, ani chu ka tân Ariel ang a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, nangmah beih tumin i vêlah ka ep ang chia, kulh siamin ka hual vêl bawk ang chia, bei tûr chein hual vêlna kulhbîngte ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, tihtlûkin i awm ang a, lei hnuai aṭangin thu i sawi ang a, i ṭawng chu vaivut zîngah zawi têin a ri chhuak ang; i aw chu ramhuai aienthiam zâwl aw ang lekin lei hnuai aṭangin a chhuak ang a, i ṭawng chu vaivut zîng aṭangin a lo chhuak se se ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangmah dotu mipuite chu vaivut dip tak angin an awm ang a, mi hlauhawmho mipuite chu buhsî boral ṭhînte ang hian an awm bawk ang; a ni, chu chu mitkhapkâr lekah a lo awm thut ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawpui ri te, lîr nghîng te, ri nasa tak te, ṭhâwngaleivir te, thlipui te, thil kan ral hmang mei alh tein anni chu Sipaihote Lalpa hremin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Ariel dotu hnam zawng zawng mipuiho, amah leh a kulhbîng beitute zawng zawng leh amah timangangtu zawng zawngte chu, mumang ang lek an ni ang, zâna inlârna ang lek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi, rilṭâmin mumang a neihin chaw a lo ei ṭhîn a; nimahsela, a han harh a, a kua chu a lo la ruak ang hi a ni ang; a nih loh leh, mi, tuihâlin mumang a neihin tui a lo in ṭhîn a; nimahsela, a han harh a, a lo la chauvin tui a la châk ang hi an ni ang: Zion tlâng beitu, hnam zawng zawng mipuiho chu chutiang chu an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ding reng ula, mak ti rawh u, nuam leng ula, mitdelin awm rawh u! An rui a, nimahsela uain vâng a ni lo; an pai an pai a, nimahsela zu vâng a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mut duhna thlarau chu in chungah a leih bua a, in mit, zâwlneite chu, a maimitchhîntîr a; in lu, hmutheitute chu, a khuh ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, inlârna rêng rêng in tân lehkhabu châr tlat thu ang a ni ta, chu chu miten lehkha thiam mi hnênah, “Khawngaih takin hei hi chhiar rawh,” tiin an pe ṭhîn a. Tin, ani chuan, “Ka chhiar thei lo, châr tlat a nih hi,” a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, lehkhabu chu lehkha thiam lo mi hnênah, “Khawngaih takin hei hi chhiar rawh,” tiin a pe ṭhîn a; tin, ani chuan, “Lehkha ka thiam lo,” a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “He mite hian mi rawn hnaih a, an ka leh an hmuiin mi chawimawi ṭhîn tak a; nimahsela, an thinlung chu ka hlatah an sawn a, an mi ṭihna chu mihring thupêk an inzirtîr mai chu a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />chuvângin, ngai teh, he mite zîngah hian thilmak ka ti leh nghâl ang, thilmak, thilmak tak mai chu; tichuan, an mi fingte finna chu a boral tawh ang a, an mi bengvârte hriatna chu thupin a awm tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An remruat chu Lalpa laka thup tûra thûk taka zawngtute chu an chung a pik e! An thiltihte chu thim hnuaiah a awm a, “Tuin nge min hmu ang? Tuin nge hriat pawh min hria ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thilte hi in tiletling vek ṭhîn e a! Bêlvawtu chu bellei ang leka ngaihin a awm dâwn em ni, thilsiam chuan a siamtu chu, “Ani mi siam ka ni hlei nêm,” a tih ni? A nih loh leh thil dintu chu a thil din chuan, “Hriatna rêng a nei lo,” a tih ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rei lo tê chinah a ni lâwm ni Lebanon chu lei ṭha tak hmuna chantîrin a awm dâwna, lei ṭha tak hmun chu ram ngawa ngaihin a awm dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan bengngawngte chuan lehkhabu thute chu an bengin an hre tawh ang a, mitdel mitte chuan thim hnuai leh thim zîng aṭangin a hmu tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuhnuairawlhte pawh chuan Lalpa -ah chuan an hlimna chu an tipung tawh ang a, mihring zînga retheite chu Israel-ho Mi Thianghlimaah chuan an lâwm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi hlauhawm chu eng mah lova siamin a awm tawh a, hmusittu chu a reh tawh a, khawlohna nghâkhleltute zawng zawng chu tihboralin an awm tawh si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />chûngte chuan mi chu thupawi thûa thil tisualtuah an siam ṭhîn a, kulh kawngkaah zilhtu awh nân thang an kam ṭhîn a, mi fel chu thil eng mah lo maiin an pumpelhtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa , Abrahama tlantu chuan Jakoba chhûngte chungchâng thûah heti hian a ti: “Jakob-ho chu tûnah chuan an mualpho tawh lo vang a, an hmai chu a dâng tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An fa, ka kutchhuakte chu, an zîngah an hmuhin ka hming chu an tithianghlim tawh zawk ang; a ni, Jakob-ho Mi Thianghlima chu an tithianghlim ang a, Israel-ho Pathian chu an ṭih tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thlarauva vâk bote pawh chuan an lo hre thiam tawh ang a, mi phunnawite chuan thu zirtîr chu an zir tawh ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Fa hel hmangho chu an chung a pik e! Chûngho chuan mi an râwn a, kei erawh chu mi râwn si lo va, an sual chunga sual an belhchhahna tûrin khuhnain an khuh a, ka thlarau thuin erawh chuan an khuh si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pharaoa chaknaa intichak tûr leh, Aigupta hlim ring tûrin, ka kâ zâwt si lovin Aigupta rama chhuk tumin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, Pharaoa chakna chu in mualphona a ni tawh ang a, Aigupta hlim in lo ring hi in zahna a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mi liante chu Zoan khuaah an awm a, a palaite chuan Hanes khua an thleng ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An tân hnemhnânna rêng nei lo mi, ṭanpui ni lova, hnemhnânna nei mi ni hek lova, zah leh hmingchhiatna ni zâwkte chu, an zain an la zahpui ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhim rama sate phurrit chu. Manganna leh thlaphânna ram, sakeibakneinu leh sakebakneipa, rûlmuk leh rûl alh thlâwk thei chhuahna chu, an sum chu sabengtungno chungah te, an rote chu sanghâwngsei zângpâwngah te phurhtîrin, an tâna hnemhnânna nei lo mite hnênah pêk tûrin an kal tlâng dual dual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aigupta chuan sâwt lo tak leh ṭangkai lo takin a ṭanpui ṭhîn si a; chuvâng chuan a ni, ani chu “Rahab ṭhu hle hle-i” ka vuah ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûnah kal la, chûng chu an hmaa lehkha ziakna phêkah ziak la, lehkhabuah pawh ziak rawh, tûn hnua kumkhaw tlaitluan atân a nih theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûngho chu mi hel hmang te, fa dawthei te, fa, Lalpa dân ngaithla duh lo te an ni si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hmutheitute hnêna, “Hmu suh u”, zâwlneite hnêna, “Thil dikte min hrilh lâwk suh u, thil nuam lam kan hnênah sawi rawh u, bumna thu hrilh lâwk rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kawng lovah kal rawh u, kawng sîrah pêng rawh u, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chu kan hma ata hi tibo rawh u,” ti ṭhîntute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chuan heti hian a sawi a: “He thu hi in hmuhsit avâng leh, hnehchhiahna leh luhlulna in rina, a chunga in innghah avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />he khawlohna hi nangni tân chuan lung bang sâng tak chhe lai, chim lek lek, pâwng pûr, vawilehkhata mitkhapkâr lova chhe rup tûr ang hi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, bêlvawtu bêl an tikeh sawm ang hian, zuah awm hlek lova keh sawmin a them zîngah lampei, thuka mei lâkna tûr emaw, tuikhura tui thâlna tûr emaw pawh awm lo khawpin, a tikeh sawm ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chuan heti hian a sawi tawh si a: “Kîr leha châwla awmin, chhandamin in awm ang a, muang taka awmnaah leh ring taka awmnaah hian in chakna a awm ang,” tiin; nimahsela, in duh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ni lo, sakawr chung chuangin kan tlân dur dur ang,” in ti zâwk si a; chuvângin, in tlân dur dur ngei ang: “Thil chak tak chungah kan chuang ang,” in ti a; chuvângin, a ûmtu tûr che u chu chak tak an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi pakhat hrâwkin mi sângkhat an tlân dur dur ang a, mi panga hrâwkin in tlân dur dur ang, a tâwpah chuan tlâng chhîpa pholêng târ ang leh, mual chunga chhinchhiahna awm anga hnutchhiahin in la awm mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan a khawngaih theihna tûr che uin a nghâk ang a, a lainat theihna tûr che uin chawimawiin a awm ang. Lalpa chu rorêl felna Pathian a ni si a; amah nghâktute zawng zawng chu an eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite chu Jerusalem-a Zion-ah chuan an awm dâwn si a; in ṭap leh tawh lo vang. In au thâwmah chuan ani chuan a khawngaih ngei ngei ang che u a; a hriat veleh a chhâng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan manganna chaw leh hrehawmna tui pe che u mah sela, in zirtîrtute chu biruin an awm tawh lo vang a, in mitin in zirtîrtute chu a hmu zâwk tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ding lama in pên veleh emaw, vei lama in pên veleh emaw, in bengin in hnung lama thu, “Hei hi kawng a nih hi, tah hian kal rawh u,” tiin a hre zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, in tangkaraw milem siam tangkaraw tîa cheina leh, in rangkachak milem chhûn rangkachak tuia luanna chu in tibawrhbâng ang. Thil bawlhhlawh angin in paih tawh ang a, chûngho hnênah chuan, “Kal bo daih rawh,” in ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan in buh chi leia in tuh tûr tân chuan ruahtui chu a pe ang a, leia thil ṭote pawh chu chawah a pe ang; chu chu ṭha tak, hlâwk tak a ni ang. Chumi nîah chuan in rante chu ran tlatna hmun zau takahte chuan an tla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bâwngpa leh sabengtungno lei lettute chuan chaw al, suahdûr leh sisêpa tihfai sa an ei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Inthahna nasa tak nia ralvên in sângte chu a chim ni chuan, tlâng sâng tinah leh mual pâwng sâng tinah chuan luipuite leh luite tui luangte a lo awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu Lalpa chuan a mite sil chu a tuama, an sahna pem chu a tihdam nîah chuan, thla êng chu ni êng tlukin a awm tawh ang a, ni êng chu a leh sarihin, ni sarih chhûng êng tlukin a awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa hming chu, a thinurnaa alh hluah hluahin meikhu chhah mup chho ngut ngut zîngah chuan, hla tak aṭangin a lo kal e; a hmuite chu lungnih lohnain a khat a, a lei chu thil kan ral hmang mei ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A thaw chu, boralna thlangraa hnam tin thlei tûrin lui, nghâwng thleng zeta a kuang liam dûl dûl ang a ni; tin, mi tin kaah chuan hruai sualtîrna hnuh dinna hrui a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tin, zâna kût thianghlima an kût laia hla an sa angin hla in sa ang; Lalpa tlânga Israel-ho Lungpui hnên thleng tûra phênglâwng nên an kal laia thinlung hlimna an nei angin, thinlung hlimna pawh in nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a aw ropui tak chu a hriattîr tawh ang a, a thinurna nasa tak leh thil kan ral hmang mei alhin, thlipui leh ruahpui leh rialin, a kut thlâk dân chu a entîr tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa aw avâng chuan Assuria mi, talhtuma mi vaw ṭhîntu chu, tihkeh sawmin a awm dâwn tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chu tiang ruat saa Lalpan a vuak apiangin khuangtête leh ṭingṭangte nên a vua ang a; a tiang leka inbeihnaahte chuan anmahni a bei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topheth khuar zau tak leh thûk tak, thing chheh khah, lal hâlna tûr an buatsaih daih tawh a; a tikâng tûrin Lalpa chuan kât lui anga luang mei a thaw chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta rama ṭanpuina zawng tûra zuk kala, sakawrte chunga rinna nghata, a tam avânga tawlailîrte leh an chak êm avânga sakawr chung chuang mite ringa, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima lam en si lova, Lalpa pawh râwn si lote chu an chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Râwn lo mah sela ani pawh fing tak asin, thil ṭha lo a rawn thlentîr ang a, a thute chu a lamlêt lo vang; thil ṭha lo titute chhûngkua bei tûrin a tho zâwk ang a, thil tisualtute ṭanpuina do tûrin a tho bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta mite chu Pathian an ni lo va, mihring mai an ni a; an sakawrte chu thlarau a ni lo va, tisa mai a ni. Lalpan a kut a phar hunah chuan a ṭanpuitu chu a pai thlawk thlawk ang a, a ṭanpuia pawh chu a tlu ang a, an za chuan an boral tlâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian ka hnênah a sawi si a: “Sakeibaknei leh sakeibaknei vânglaiin a sa a hauh lai chuan, berâm vêngtu tam tak a bei tûrin koh chhuahin awm mah sela, an aw chu a hlau dâwn lo va, an bengchhen avângin a tîm chuang dâwn hek lo ang hian, Sipaihote Lalpa chu Zion tlângah leh a mual pâwngah bei tûrin a lo chhuk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Savate an bu chunga an thlâwk an thlâwk ang hian Sipaihote Lalpa chuan Jerusalem khua chu a vêng ang; a vêngin a chhan chhuak ang a, a kal hlênin a humhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Aw Israela thlahte u, nasa taka in helsan tâka lam chu hawi leh tawh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan mi tinin mahni tangkaraw milem leh mahni rangkachak milem - sualna atâna nangmahni kuta in insiam chawpte chu an la paih bo dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Chumi hunah chuan Assuria chu mihring khandaiha tihthlûk ni lovin, khandaih tihthlûkin a awm ang a, khandaih, mihringte ta ni lovin amah chu a ei zo vang. Tin, khandaih lak ata a tlânchhia ang a, a tlangvâlte chu salah an man ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, a lungpui chu thil râpthlâk avângin a boral ang a, a mi liante chu chhinchhiahna avângin an mangang ang,” tiin, Lalpa , a mei Zion-a awma leh, a rawh tuina mei Jerusalem-a awma chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh, fel taka rorêl tûr lal a lo awm ang a, dik taka ti ṭhîn hotute an lo chhuak bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlipui laka bîkna hmun ang leh thli hrâng laka inhumhimna ang a ni ang; thlalêra lui luang ang leh ram rova lungpui lian tak hlim ang mai chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An mit chuan chiang takin a hmu ang a, an beng pawhin fiah takin a hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rilrua hmanhmawh chuan hriat thiam a zir ang a, dangâwkte pawh nâl takin an ṭawng thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi sual chuan tu ma zah a kai lo vang a, mi duhâm chuan ngaihsân a hlawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi sual chuan thu â a chhâk chhuak a, suahsual dân tûr a suangtuah a, a thiltih leh a kamchhuakte chu Lalpa elsên zâwng hlîr a ni; rilṭâmte ei tûr a lâksak a, tuihâlte in tûr a tihbuaksak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi duhâm chu khawlo tak a ni; retheite chu dâwta tichhe tûrin thil sual a phiar chhuak a, pachhiate chu an diknaah pawh a dang tlat ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi ṭha erawh chuan dik takin thil a ti a, thu dik a ṭan tlat ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmeichhe nuam tâwlte u, tho ula, ka thu hi ngaithla teh u; fanu ngaihsamte u, ka thusawiah hian beng chhi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmeichhe ngaihsamte u, kum khat leh ni eng zât emaw chinah chuan in mangang tawh ang; grêp lawh tûr lah a awm dâwn si lo va, grêp lawh khâwm tûrah chuan eng mah a haw dâwn hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmeichhe awm mai maite u, khûr rawh u; mi ngaihsamte u, mangang takin awm rawh u; inhlîp ula, saruakah insiam ula, in kâwngahte chuan saiip puan veng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lo duhawmte avâng leh grêp hrui rah duh mi avâng chuan an âwm an chûm an chûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite ramah hian hnimhlîngneite leh buarte chu a tla ang, a ni, khawpui hlim taka hlimna in zawng zawng chungahte chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal in chu kalsanin a awm dâwn si a, mi tamna khawpui chu chhuahsanin a awm ang; a mual pâwng leh a râlvên bûk chu kumkhaw pûkah te, ram sabengtung lâwmna te, ran rual tlatna hmun te a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />chung lam aṭangin a thlarau a rawn pe leh ang a, thlalêr chu lei ṭha tak hmunah a chang ang a, lei ṭha tak hmun chu ram ngawa ngaiha a awm hun chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rorêl felna chu thlalêrah chuan a chêng ang a, felna chu lei ṭha tak hmunah chuan a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, felna hnathawh chu remna a ni ang a, felnaa thil chhuak chu kumkhuaa muang taka awmna leh ring tlata awmna a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, ka mite chu râlmuanga awmnaah leh, in nghet takahte leh chawlhna hmun muanawm takahte chuan an awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, ram ngaw chu tithlu tûrin rial a tla dur dur ang a; khawpui chu tihtlâwm dêrin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui luanna zawng zawng kama chi theh ṭhîna, bâwngpa leh sabengtung thlah ṭhîntute u, in eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang rawk tâwk ngai si lova rawktu, vervêk taka tih tâwk ngai si lova vervêk taka titu, i chung a pik e! Mi rawk i bân hunah rawk i la tâwk ve ang a; vervêk taka i tih zawh hunah i chungah vervêk takin an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , min khawngaih ang che; kan nghah reng che hi. Tûk tin kan bân lo ni la, mangan hunah chuan min chhandamtu lo ni bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sa mur mur thâwmah chuan mi tin an tlân bo ta a; nang i thawh meuh chuan hnam tin tihdarhin an awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In sum râllâka lâk tûr chu pangangin thil a thiar khâwm sup sup ang hian thiar khâwmin a awm ang a; khaukhuapte an zuang sup sup ang hian anniho chu sum chungah an zuang sup sup ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chu châwisanin a awm ta, chung lamah khian a awm si a: ani chuan Zion chu rorêl felna leh felnain a tikhat ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I dam chhûng chuan awm nghehna a awm ang a, chhandamna te, finna te, hriatnate a awm ṭeuh vang; Lalpa ṭihna chu a ro a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />En teh, an pasalṭhate chu pâwn lamah an au va, remna palaite chu an ṭap zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lamliante chu a ṭhing ṭhiap ṭhuap a, mi zin veivâk an awm ta lo. Ani chuan thuthlung chu a bawhchhia a, khuate chu a hmusit a, mihring a ngaihsak ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram chu a ṭapin a chau va, Lebanon chu a zakin a vuai a; Saron chu thlalêr ang a ni ta, Basan leh Karmel chuan an hnahte an thing thla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Tûnah chuan ka tho vang a, tûnah chuan chawi sânin ka awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hnim ro in pai ang a, buhpâwl in hring ang; in thaw chu nangmahni kâng ral tûr mei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi tinrêngte chu chinai lung rawh ang, hnimhlîngnei sâm hnu meia an paih ang chu an ni ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hla taka awmte u, ka thiltih hi bengin lo hre rawh u, hnai tea awmte u, ka thiltihtheihzia hi hre rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion-a mi sual awmte chuan an hlau va; Pathian zah lo mite chu khurhnain a man ta a. “Kan ral hmang mei, kumkhuaa alh chu, kan zîngah tu nge tuar thei awm ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Fel taka awma dik taka sawi ṭhîntu, hnehchhiahnate hlâwkpuina rêng rêng lungtena, tham la duh lova kut thinsana, thisen chhuah thu ngaithla duh lova beng hupa, sualna rêng rêng en duh lova maimitchhîng ṭhîna chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />chu mi chu chung lamah a awm ang a; a kulhbîng sâng chu lungpui kulhbîngte chu a ni ang a; a chaw chu a hnênah pêk a ni ang a, a tuite chu a awm ngei ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I mite chuan lal chu a mawinaah chuan an la hmu ang a, ram parh zau tak an la thlîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“A chhiartu kha khawiah nge a awm tâk? Chhiah chawi bûktu kha khawiah nge a awm tâk? Ralvên in sângte chhiartu kha khawiah nge a awm tâk?” tiin i thinlungin thil râpthlâk tak kha i ngaihtuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi kawlh tak, ṭawng ril tak i hriat theih loh va ṭawng mite, ṭawng hrang i hriat thiam loh va ṭawngte chu i hmu tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan kûtna khawpui Zion chu en teh; i mitte chuan Jerusalem chu awmna muanawm tak, puan in eng tik maha sawn lo tûr, a kaih marna khen eng tik maha phawi lo tûr, a kaihna hrui rêng rêng chat lo tûr ang chu a hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutah chuan Lalpa , lui zau tak tak leh lui tête awm thliah thluahna hmun chu, ropui takin kan hnênah a awm zâwk ang; chûng tui chungah chuan indona lawng lian pui karfung nei mi rêng rêng a kal lo vang a, lawng lian ropui tak pawhin a kal pêl hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chu kan Rorêltu a ni a, Lalpa chu dân min petu a ni a, Lalpa chu kan Lal a ni; ani chuan min chhandam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I hruite chu tihdulin a awm a, an puanzâr ngul bul chu an tinghet thei lo va, puanzâr chu an zâr thei lo. Chumi lai tak chuan râllâk sum tam tak chu semin a awm a, kebaite pawhin râllâk sum an la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chumi khuaa awm chuan, “Ka damlo ve,” a ti lo vang a, a chhûnga mi awmte chu an sual ngaihdam a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnam tinte u, benga hre tûrin lo hnai rawh u; mi tinte u, ngaithla rawh u! Lei leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte chuan bengin hre rawh se, khawvêl leh a chhûng ata chhuak zawng zawngte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hnam tinrêng chungah chuan lungnih lohna a neiin, an sipaiho zawng zawng chungah chuan thinrimna a nei si a; anni chu a tiboral vek a, thahah a pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An zînga thahate chu paih chhuahin an awm ang a, an ruang rimchhia chu a chho vut vut ang a, tlângte chu an thisena tihtuiin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vâna awmho zawng zawngte khi tihralin an awm ang a, vân khi lehkhabu zial mi an zial angin zialin a awm ang a; a awmho zawng zawngte khi, grêp hrui ata a hnah a vuai a, a tla ṭhîn ang leh, theipui kûng ata a hnah vuai a tla ṭhîn ang hian, an vuai zovin an tla vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka khandaih chuan vânah tlai takin a in ta si a: ngai teh, chu chu, rorêl tûrin, Edom-ho chungah leh ka ânchhe lawh mite chungah chuan a chhuk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa khandaih chu thisenin a tlai a, thaunaa tihthauvin a awm ta, berâmnote leh kêlte thisenin, berâmpa kal thautein: Lalpa chuan Bozra khuaah chuan inthawina a nei a, Edom ramah chuan thahna nasa tak a nei bawk si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Selepate pawh chu an ruala sah thûkin an awm ang a, bâwngpate, bâwngchalte nên; an ram chuan thisen a rui ang a, an vaivut chu thaunaa tihthauvin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa phuba lâk ni a ni tawh si a, Zion avânga inbeihna thûa thungrulhna kum chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Edom lui tuite chu lawng hnaia chantîrin a awm ang a, a vaivut chu kâta chantîrin a awm bawk ang a, a ram chu lawng hnai kâng hluah hluahah a chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A chhûn a zânin tihmihin a awm lo vang a; a meikhu chu kumkhuain a chho ngut ngut ang. Chhuan awm chhûng zawng zawng chuan chhiain a awm reng ang a; kumkhua pawhin tu mân an pal lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuivalawng leh sakuhin chumi ram chu an nei zâwk ang a, chingpirinu leh choâk chutah chuan an awm ang. Lalpan a tichhe vek ang a, hmun ruakah chuan a sahal a khai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An mi ṭhate chu ram awp tûrin an ko vang a; nimahsela, chutah chuan koh tûr tu mah an awm lo vang a; an mi lian zawng zawng chu eng mah lo an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An lal inahte chuan hnimhlîngneite a ṭo vang a, an kulhpui chhûngahte chuan ṭaiṭên leh buarte a ṭo vang; sihalte awmnaah leh savanghâwngseite tân tuallai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, thlalêra ramsate chu chinghniate nên an intâwk ang a, sathâr chuan a ṭhian a ko vang a; a ni, zân thil hlauhawm pui chuan chutah chuan awm hmun a khuar ang a, ama tân chawlh hmun tûr a hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutah chuan rûlthal chuan bu a chhep ang a, a tui ang a, a keu vang a, a awp khâwm ang; a ni, chutah chuan mute chu kawppui nei ṭheuhvin an awm khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa lehkhabuah zawng ula, chhiar rawh u: chûng zîngah chuan pakhat mah kim lo a awm lo vang a, pakhat mah kawppui nei lo a awm lo vang. Ka kâ ngeiin thu a pe a, a thlarau ngeiin chûng chu a hruai khâwm ta hlawm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan an tân ṭhum a vâwrsak a, a kutin hruia tehin ram chu a semsak hlawm a; kumkhuain an nei ang a, chhuan awm chhûng zawng zawngin chutah chuan an awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thlalêr leh ram pilril chu a lâwm ang a, ram ro chu a hlimin phûl pangpâr angin a pâr ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a pâr vul chûk ang a, lâwm tak leh hla sain a hlim ang. Lebanon ropuina chu a hnênah pêk a ni ang, Karmel leh Saron mawina nên. Lalpa ropuina an hmu ang, kan Pathian mawina nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kut chak lote chu tichak ula, khûp zâwite chu tinghet rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thinlung dawihte hnênah chuan, “Chak takin awm ula, hlau suh u! Ngai teh u, in Pathian chu phuba lâkna nên a lo kal ang, Pathian thungrulhna nên chuan; a lo kal ang a, a chhandam ang che u,” ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan mitdelte mit chu tihmenin a awm ang a, bengngawngte beng chu tihvârin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan kebaite chu sakhi angin an zuang ang a, ṭawngtheilote lei chu hlim takin a zai ang. Thlalêrah chuan tuite a lo chik chhuak luah luah dâwn si a, ram rovah chuan luite tui a lo chik chhuak luah luah bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ṭiau dip sa tak hmun chu dîlah a chang ang a, lei tuihâl tak chu tuihnaahte a chang ang; sihalte chênna, an mutnaah chuan, hlobet, phairuang leh phûngladin nên a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutah chuan lamlian a awm ang a, chu chu ‘Thianghlimna Kawng’ an ti ang; mi bawlhhlawhte chu chutah chuan an kal lo vang a; amaherawhchu, hêng mite tân hian a ni zâwk ang; mi zin veivâkte, a ni, mi âte pawh, chutah chuan an bo lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sakeibaknei rêng rêng chutah chuan a awm lo vang a, sa koham rêng rêng chutah chuan a chho hek lo vang, chutah chuan hmuh tûr pawh a awm lo vang; tlante erawh chu chutah chuan an kal zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa tlante chu an kîr leh ang a, hla sa chungin Zion chu an thleng ang a; chatuana lâwmna an lû chungah a awm tawh ang. Hlimna leh lâwmna an hmu ang a, lungngaihna leh rûmna chu a bo tawh ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia lal kum sâwm leh kum lina kumah chuan heti hi a ni a, Assuria ram lal Senakeriba chu Juda rama khua kulhpui nei zawng zawng bei tûrin a han chho va, a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Assuria lal chuan Rabsakea chu sipaiho tam tak hruaiin, Lakis khua aṭangin Jerusalem khuaa Lal Hezekia hnênah chuan a tîr a. Tin, dîl chhakta zâwk tuilâkna kianga puan sutu phûl lamlianah chuan a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chhûngte chunga hotua awm Hilkia fapa Eliakima te, lehkhaziaktu Sebna te, chanchin ziaktu Asapha fapa Joa te chu a hnênah an lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Rabsakean an hnênah, “Hezekia hnênah heti hian sawi rawh u, ‘Lal ropui tak Assuria lal chuan heti hian a ti: I rinna i nghahna hi eng nge ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Indona atân chuan i remruat leh i chakna hi thu mai mai a ni ka ti. Tu nge i rin a, ka chunga i hel tâk ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai teh, he luang sâwp tiang, Aigupta-ho hi i ring a nih hi; chumi chu miin a rinchhan chuan a kutah a chhun lût ngawt ang; Aigupta lal Pharaoa chu amah ringtu zawng zawng chungah chuan chutiang chu a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nih loh leh, ka hnênah, “ Lalpa kan Pathian chu a ni kan rin ni,” i tih chuan, ani chu Hezekian Juda-ho hnênah leh Jerusalem-ho hnênah, “He maichâm hmaah chauh hian in be tûr a ni,” tiin, a hmun sângte leh a maichâmte a lâk bosaka kha a ni lâwm ni?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, khawngaih takin, ka pu Assuria lal hnênah chuan thu tiam rawh; tichuan, keiin sakawr sânghnih ka pe ang che, nangin a chunga chuang tûrte i hmuh theih dâwn phawt chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Engtin nge tawlailîrte leh sakawr chung chuang mite lam thûah Aigupta-ho chunga i rinna nghatin, ka pu chhiahhlawh tê berte zînga hotu pakhat pawh hi i dan zawh dâwn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, he ram hi tichhe tûra bei tûrin Lalpa tel lova lo chho em ka nih? Lalpan ka hnênah, ‘Chu ram chu bei tûrin chho la, tichhe rawh,’ mi ti a ni, tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Eliakima leh Sebna leh Joa-te chuan Rabsakea hnênah, “Khawngaih takin i chhiahhlawhte hi Suria ṭawngin min be tawh rawh, chu chu kan hre thei si a; kulh bang chunga mite beng hriatah Juda ṭawngin min be tawh suh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, Rabsakea chuan, “Ka pu chuan i pu hnên chauhvah leh i hnên chauhvah hêng thu hi sawi tûrin mi tîr em ni? Kulh bang chhûnga ṭhuho, nangmahni nêna mahni êk la ei tûr leh mahni zun la in tûrte hnênah hian mi tîr zâwk a ni lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Rabsakea chu a ding a, Juda ṭawngin aw ring takin a au va, “Lal ropui tak Assuria lal thute hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal chuan heti hian a ti, ‘Hezekia bumin awm duh suh u, ani chuan a chhan him thei dâwn si lo che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekian, “ Lalpa chuan mathei lovin min chhan him ang; he khawpui hi Assuria lal kutah pêkin a awm lo vang,” tiin sawi mah sela, Lalpa chu Hezekia sawi avângin ring duh chuang hek suh u.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hezekia thu ngaithla suh u; Assuria lal chuan heti hian a sawi si a: ‘Min rem ula, ka hnênah hian lo chhuak rawh u; tin, ka lo kala, nangmahni ram anga buh leh uain awmna ram, chhang leh grêp huante awmna rama ka kalpui hma loh che u chuan, mi tinin mahni grêp hruia mi leh mi tinin mahni theipui kûnga mi ei ṭheuh ula, mi tinin mahni tuikhur tui in ṭheuh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Lalpan min chhan him ang,” tia Hezekian a thlêm tâk dah che uin, fîmkhur rawh u. Hnam tin pathian zînga mi rêng rêngin an ram chu Assuria lal lakah an chhan him ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hamath leh Arpad-ho pathiante kha khawiah nge an awm tâk? Sepharvaim-ho pathiante kha khawiah nge an awm tâk? Samari khua kha ka lakah an chhan him ta em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng ram pathian zawng zawng zînga mi chuan tute nge an ram ka lakah chhan him ni? Lalpa chuan Jerusalem khua hi ka lakah a chhan him tehchai ang maw?’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anni erawh chu an ngawi reng a, thu pakhat mahin an chhâng lo; lal thupêk chu, “Ani chu chhâng suh u,” tih a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chhûngte chunga hotua awm Hilkia fapa Eliakima te, lehkhaziaktu Sebna te, chanchin ziaktu Asapha fapa Joa te chu silhfên pawh thlêr inbelin Hezekia hnênah chuan an lo thleng a, Rabsakea thusawite chu an hrilh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Lal Hezekia chuan chu chu a hriat veleh a silhfênte chu a pawt thlêr a, saiip puan a inbel a, Lalpa inah chuan a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a chhûngte chunga hotua awm Eliakima leh, lehkhaziaktu Sebna leh, puithiamho upate chu saiip puan inbelin Amoza fapa zâwlnei Isaia hnênah a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, anni chuan a hnênah, “Hezekian heti hian a ti, ‘Vawiin ni hi manganna leh hmuhsitna ni a ni; nautê chu an pian a hun tawh si a, anmahni hring tûrin chakna a awm tawh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rabsakea, a pu Assuria lalin Pathian nung sawi chhe tûra a tirha thusawite chu, Lalpa i Pathian chuan a bengin a la hria a ni thei e; tichuan, a thusawi, Lalpa i Pathianin a benga a hriatahte chuan a la zilhhau vang. Chumi avâng chuan a la awm chhunte tân chuan i ṭawngṭaina chu hlân chho rawh,’ a ti e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lal Hezekia chhiahhlawhte chu Isaia hnênah an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Isaian an hnênah, “In pu hnênah heti hian in sawi tûr a ni, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, “I thu hriat, Assuria lal chhiahhlawhten min sawichhiatnate kha hlau suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, a kawchhûngah chuan thlarau eng emaw ka awmtîr ang a; tichuan, thuthang a hria ang a, ama ramah a haw leh ang; tichuan, ama ram ngeiah chuan khandaiha tihtlûkin ka awmtîr ang,” a ti e,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, Rabsakea chu a kîr leh a, Assuria lal chuan Libna khua a lo bei lai a va hmu a; Lakis khua ata chu a kal chhuak tih a hre tawh reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Assuria lal Senakeriba chuan Tirhaka, Ethiopia ram lal chungchâng thu, “Nangmah bei tûrin a chhuak ta,” tiin mi sawi a hria a. Tichuan, chu chu a hriat veleh Hezekia hnênah palaite a tîr a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Heti hian Juda-ho lal Hezekia hnênah in sawi tûr a ni: ‘I rin Pathian chuan, Jerusalem khua Assuria lal kutah pêk a ni lo vang, tiin bum che suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh, Assuria lalten ram zawng zawng tichhe vekin an chunga an thiltihte kha i bengin i hria e; tichuan, nang tehlul hi chhanhimin i awm dâwn bîk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnam tin pathiante chuan Gozan-ho te, Haran-ho te, Rezeph-ho te, Eden fa Tel-asar khuaa awm te, min thlahtuten an tihboralte kha an chhan him em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath lal te, Arpad lal te, Sepharvaim khawpui lal te, Hena lal te, Iva lal te kha khawiah nge an awm tâk?’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chuan palaite kut ata lehkha chu a hmu a, a han chhiar a; tichuan, Hezekia chu Lalpa inah chuan a han lût a, Lalpa hmaah chuan a phah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Hezekia chu Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Aw Sipaihote Lalpa , Israel-ho Pathian, cherub chunga ṭhua, nang hi, nang chauh hi, leilung luah ram zawng zawng Pathian chu i ni; nang chuan lei leh vân hi i siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i beng rawn dawh la, ngaithla teh; aw Lalpa , i mit meng la, en teh; Pathian nung sawi chhe tûra mite tîrtu Senakeriba thu zawng zawng hi ngaithla teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa , Assuria lalten ram zawng zawng leh an lei chu an tichhe ngei tak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />an pathiante chu meiah an paih bawk a; chûngte chu pathian an ni lo rêng a ni, mihring kuta siam, thing leh lung an ni zâwk. Chuvângin, an tiboral a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw Lalpa kan Pathian, nang hi, nang chauh hi, Lalpa i ni tih leilung luah ram zawng zawng hian an hriat theih nân a lakah min chhandam ang che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Amoza fapa Isaia chuan Hezekia hnênah mi a tîr a, heti hian a ti a, “ Lalpa , Israel-ho Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Assuria lal Senakeriba chhiatna tûr lama ka hnêna i ṭawngṭai avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />hei hi a chungchâng thu Lalpan a sawi chu a ni: Zion fanu nula chuan a hmusit chia, a nuihsan che; Jerusalem fanu chuan a lû a thin khum che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu nge i tihhmingchhiata i sawi chhiat ni? Tu chungah nge i aw i tihpâwra i mit i tihsân? Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chung ngeiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I chhiahhlawhte hmangin Lalpa chu i tihmingchhia a, “Ka tawlailîr tam tak nên tlâng hmun zo, Lebanon ram rilahte hian ka lo thleng chho ta a; a sidar thing sâng takte leh a fâr thing ṭha mite hi ka kit ang a; a hmun zo hla ber, a lei ṭha hmun ram ngawah chuan ka lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuichhunchhuah ka lai a, tui ka in ṭhîn a, ka kephah hnuai hian Aigupta lui zawng zawng chu ka tikang vek ang,” i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keiman hmânlai ata chûng chu ka tih a ni a, hmasâng ata chûng chu ka siam a ni tih i hre lo vem ni? Kulhpui nei khuate tichim tûrin ka ti che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvângin, a chhûnga awmte chu an chak mang lo va, an hlau va, an lo mualpho tâk kha; phûl hlobet ang leh, hnim hring ang leh, in chunga hlobet ang leh, lo buh ṭhat hma ang lek an nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan i ṭhut te, i chhuah te, i luh te, ka chunga i thinurziate hi ka hria asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka chunga i thinur avâng leh, i ṭawng chaltlaizia chu ka bengah a lo luh chhoh tâk avâng hian, ka hnârvuah chu i hnârah ka vuah ang a, ka thîrbarh chu i hmuiah ka vuah bawk ang a, i lo kalna kawng ngeiah khân ka kîrtîr leh ang che, tih hi,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, hei hi i tân chhinchhiahna tûr chu a ni ang: kuminah hian buhhli in ring ang a; nakkumah pawh chumi hli bawk chu in ring ang; tin, a kum thumnaah chuan buh tuh ula, ât ula, grêp huante siam ula, a rah ei rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Juda chhûngte zînga la dam chhunte chu a chhuk zâwnga zung kaia, a chho zâwnga rahin a awm leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jerusalem aṭangin a la awm chhunte chu an chhuak ang a, Zion tlâng aṭangin a la dam tûrte chu an chhuak bawk ang. Sipaihote Lalpa ṭhahnemngaihna chuan chûng chu a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan Assuria lal chungchâng thûah heti hian a ti, ‘Ani chuan he khawpui hi a lo thleng lo vang a, hetah hian thal a kâp hek lo vang, phaw nên a kiangah a lo kal hek lo vang a, a beihna tûrin lei kulh a siam hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A lo kalna kawngah, chumiah ngei chuan a kîr leh ang a, he khawpui hi a lo thleng lo vang, Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Keimah avâng leh ka chhiahhlawh Davida avângin he khawpui hi chhan him tûrin ka hum dâwn a ni,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a va chhuak a, Assuria-ho riahhmunah chuan mi nuai khat leh sîngriat leh sângnga a tihlum a; tin, zîng taka mi an han thawh chuan, ngai teh, mitthi ruang hlîr a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chutichuan, Assuria lal Senakeriba chu a chhuak a, a kal bo va, a inah a haw a, Ninevi khuaah chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, a pathian Nisroka inah chuan pathian a biak laiin a fapa Adrammeleka leh Sarezera-te chuan khandaihin an sât hlum a; tichuan, an tlân bo va, Ararat ramah an lût a. Tichuan, a fapa Esar-haddona chuan a aiawhin ro a rêl ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Hezekia chu thih ngamin a nâ a. Tichuan, Amoza fapa zâwlnei Isaia chu a hnênah a lo kal a, a hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, ‘I chhûngte khawsak dân tûr rêlsak rawh; dam chhuak lovin i thi ngei dâwn si a,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, Hezekia chu bang lam hawiin a let a, Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa , i hmaah thutak leh thinlung ṭha famkim pua ka awm ṭhinzia leh, i mit hmuha thil ṭha ka tih ṭhinzia kha khawngaih takin hre reng ang che,” a ti a. Tin, Hezekia chu a ṭap ta zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa thu chu Isaia hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Kal la, Hezekia hnênah sawi rawh, ‘ Lalpa , i pu Davida Pathian chuan heti hian a ti, “I ṭawngṭaina kha ka hria a, i mittuite pawh ka hmu a; ngai teh, i dam chhûng nite hi kum sâwm leh kum ngain ka tisei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, nang leh he khawpui hi Assuria lal lakah ka chhan him ang a, he khawpui hi ka hum ang.” ’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan a thil sawi hi a ti ngei dâwn tih, hei hi i tân Lalpa laka chhinchhiahna tûr chu a ni ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ngai teh, Lal Ahaza dâr chin tehnaa ni hlim saw, rahka sâwmin ka tikîr ang,” a ti a. Chutichuan, ni hlim chu rahka sâwm a kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Juda lal Hezekia damlo, a dam leh hnua a lehkha ziak chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ka dam chhûng nite chhûnlai takah hian thlân awngkâahte ka lût dâwn a; Ka dam chhûng kum la bâk tûrte chu chhuhin ka awm ta,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Lalpa , Lalpa ngei chu, mi nung ramah hian ka hmu dâwn tawh lo va; Khawvêla awmte zîngah hian mihring ka hmu leh dâwn tawh lo a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka awmna hi sawnin a awm a, berâm vêngtu puan in angin ka hnên ata lâk bovin a awm ta; Puan tahtun a puan a zial angin ka nunna hi ka zial a. Ani chuan thembu aṭangin mi chep chhum hmawk dâwn a; Nangin ni khat leh zan khat thil thûah mi titâwp mai dâwn a nih hi ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zîng thlengin ka ngawi hrâm hrâm a; Sakeibaknei angin ka ruh zawng zawng a titliak vek a; Nangin ni khat leh zan khat thil thûah mi titâwp mai dâwn a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vamûr emaw, kânghlai emaw angin ka hrâm ka hrâm a; Ṭhûro angin ka rûm ka rûm a; chung lam thlîr nân ka mit a vai zo ta. Aw Lalpa , hnehchhiaha ka awm hi; nang chuan a bul mi tumsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eng nge ka sawi ang aw? Ani chuan mi bia a, ani vêk chuan a ti ta nghâl a. Ka nunna thawpikna avâng khân ka dam chhûng kum zawng zawngah chuan zawi têin ka kal dêm dêm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Lalpa, hetiang thil avâng hian mihringte hi an nung ṭhîn a; Chûngah chauh chuan ka thlarau nunna chu a awm ṭhîn; Chumi avâng chuan mi tidam lehin mi tinung leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka thlamuanna tûrin a ni, thawpikna nasa tak ka neih kha ni; Nimahsela, nang chuan, ka nunna i hmangaih avângin, chhiatna khuarkhurum ata chu i chhan him ta, Ka sualte zawng zawng kha i hnung lamah chuan i paih vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlân hian a fak thei si lo che a; Thihna hian a chawimawi thei hek lo che; Khuarkhuruma chhukte chuan i thutak chu an beisei thei lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi nungin, mi nungin, anni ngei chuan, vawiina ka tih ang hian an fak ang che; Pa chuan fate hnênah i thutak chu a hriattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chu mi chhandam tûrin a inpeih reng a ni; Chuvângin, kan dam chhûng zawng zawngin, Lalpa inah chuan Ka hlate hi ṭingṭangte nên kan sa ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isaia chuan, “Theipui rah hlâwm khat la sela, damdawi a bela bel mi atân a khawihlîah bel rawh se; tichuan, a dam ang,” a lo ti tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hezekia pawh chuan, “ Lalpa inah ka chho leh ang tih hriatna eng chhinchhiahna nge lo awm ang?” a lo ti tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan Baladana fapa Babulon lal Merodak-baladana chuan lehkhate leh lâwmman Hezekia hnênah a thawn a, a nâ tih leh a dam leh ta tih a lo hriat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, Hezekia chu an chungah a lâwm a, an hnênah a thil hlu dahna in - tangkarua te, rangkachak te, englo rimtui te, hriak hlu tak te, a râlthuam dahna in chhûng zawng zawng te, a ro ṭha zawng zawng chu a entîr a. A ina mi leh a ram chhûnga mi Hezekian an hnêna a entîr loh thil rêng rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan zâwlnei Isaia chu Lal Hezekia hnênah a lo kal a, a hnênah, “Nichina mite khân eng nge an sawi? Khawi aṭangin nge i hnênah an lo kal?” a ti a. Tin, Hezekia chuan, “Ram hla tak ata, Babulon aṭangin ka hnênah an lo kal a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan, “I inah hian eng nge an en kha?” a ti a. Tin, Hezekia chuan, “Ka in chhûnga awm zawng zawng chu an en vek; ka ro ṭha zînga mi ka entîr loh eng mah a awm lo,” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Isaian Hezekia hnênah chuan, “Sipaihote Lalpa thu hi hre rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Ngai teh, i in chhûnga awm zawng zawng leh vawiin thlenga i puten an khâwl khâwmte chu Babulon khuaah kalpuiin a awm vek ang; eng mah rêng rêng hnutchhiahin a awm lo vang; chutiang nite chu a la thleng dâwn,’ Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Tin, i fapa, i rîla rah, i hrin tûrte ngei zînga mi chu, an kal bopui ang; anni chu Babulon lal inah chuan mi tilrehah an la awm ang,’ a ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Hezekian Isaia hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa thu i sawi hi a ṭha e,” a ti a. Amah vêk chuan, “Ka dam chhûng hian remna leh thutak a awm dâwn si a,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Thlamuan rawh u, ka mite hi thlamuan rawh u!” in Pathianin a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Jerusalem-ho hnênah thlamuan lam zâwngin thu sawi ula, an indona chu a kin a, an sualna chu ngaihdam a ni a, an thil tihsual zawng zawng aiah Lalpa kut ata a leh hnihin an hmu ta tih hril rawh u.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu! Autu râwl chuan, “Thlalêrah Lalpa kawng buatsaih ula, ram rovah kan Pathian tân lamlian tingîl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kawr tin tihsân a ni vek ang a, tlâng tin mual tin tihhniam a ni bawk ang; kawng kawite tihngîl a ni ang a, a bumboh laite tihrual a ni bawk ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa ropuina chu tihlan a ni ang a, mi zawng zawngin chu chu an hmu vek ang; Lalpa kâ chuan a sawi tawh si a,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu! Aw chuan, “Au rawh,” a tih chu. Tin, mi chuan, “Eng thu sawiin nge ka au vang?” a ti a. “ ‘Mi zawng zawng hlobet ang an ni a, an ropuina zawng zawng pawh phûl pangpâr ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa thaw chuan a chhêm avângin hlobet chu a vuai a, a pâr chu a chuai ṭhîn; mite chu hlobet ang chauh an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hlobet chu a vuai a, a pâr chu a chuai ṭhîn; kan Pathian thu erawh chu chatuanin a awm reng ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Zion hnêna Chanchin Ṭha hriltu, tlâng sâng takah khian han chho rawh; aw Jerusalem hnêna Chanchin Ṭha hriltu, ring takin i aw chhuah rawh; chhuah rawh, hlau suh; Juda khuate hnênah chuan, “En teh u, in Pathian hi!” ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En teh u, Lalpa Pathian chu mi chak tak angin a lo kal dâwn hi, a bân chuan a aiah ro a rêl ang; en teh u, a lâwmman chu a hnênah a awm hi, a rulhna chu a hmaah a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan berâm vêngtu angin a berâm rual chu a châwm ang a, berâmnote chu a bânin a pawm khâwm ang a, a ângchhûnga dahin a kalpui ang a, no hruai laite chu zawi têin a hruai dial dial ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin nge tuite chu a kutphah khuar leka teha, vân khi khâp leka teha, leia vaivut hi tehkhâwng pakhat leka thun veka, tlângte chu khîn leka bûka, mualpâwngte chu bûkna leka bûk kha le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin nge Lalpa thlarau chu thil tih dân tûr kawhhmuh le? A nih loh leh tu nge a remruatsaktu nia amah zirtîr le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan tu nge a râwna, tuin nge amah chu hriattîra, rorêlna kawng entîra, hriatna zirtîra, hriatthiamna kawng entîr ngai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, hnam tin chu bâlṭîna tui far khat ang lek an ni a, bûknaa thil dip bâng kai ang leka ruat an ni; ngai teh, ani chuan thliarkârte chu thil tê tak tê angin a la nelh nelh mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon meuh pawh tuah tham a ni lo va, a rama rante pawh hâl rala inthawina tham an ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hnam tinrêngte chu a hmaah chuan eng mah lo ang an ni a; ani ngaih chuan eng mah lo aia tlêm zâwk, boruak mai an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian chu tu nên nge in tehkhin dâwn le? A nih loh leh, eng lem nge amah nên in tehkhin dâwn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Milem siam chawp hi hna thawk mi chuan a chhûng a, rangkachak chher mi chuan rangkachakin a luan a, chu mi tân chuan tangkaraw khaidiatte a chhûnsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang thilpêk pe zo lova rethei lutuk chuan thing mawih lo tûr a thlang ṭhîn; milem siam chawp, nghîng lo tûr, a tâna dinsaktu tûr themthiam mi a zawng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In rilruin in hre ngai lo vem ni? In bengin in hre ngai lo vem ni? A tîr aṭang khân an hrilh lo che u em ni? Leilung pian tirh aṭang khân in hre thiam lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani chu leilung kualkhungna chunga ṭhua chu a ni, a mit hmuhah chuan lei chunga awmho chu khaute ang lek an ni a; ani chu vân khi puan in chung anga kai pharha, puan in awmna tûra zâra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />mi liante eng mah lova siam ṭhîna chu a ni; ani chuan leia rorêltute chu eng mah lovah a siam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ni, a phun an ni lo; a ni, a tuh an ni lo; a ni, an kûng chuan leiah zung a kai lo; chu lo pawh chu ani chuan anniho chu a chhêm a, an vuai a, ṭhâwngaleivirin buhsî a lâk bo angin a la bo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tu nên nge mi tehkhina, tu tluk lekah nge mi ruat dâwn?” Mi Thianghlima chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chung lamah khian in mitte lên chho ula, khîngte khi tu siam nge ni en rawh u; ani chuan sipaihote khi indawt zêlin a hruai chhuak ṭhîn a, an hmingin a ko ṭheuh ṭhîn a; a chakna ropui êm avâng leh, thiltihtheihna lama a chak avângin pakhat mah kim lo an awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Engati nge aw Jakob-ho, hetianga in tih ni, engati nge aw Israel-ho, hetianga in sawi ni: “Ka kawng hi Lalpa laka thup a ni a, ro mi rêlna hi ka Pathian laka lâk bo a ni ta,” tih hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />In rilruin in hre ngai lo vem ni? In bengin in hre ngai lo vem ni? Kumkhaw Pathian, Lalpa , kâwlkil Siamtu chu, a chauh ngai lohva, a hah ngai hek lohzia hi; a hriat thiamzia chu zawn chhuah rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chau hnênahte chuan thiltihtheihna a pe ṭhîn a, chakna rêng nei lote chu a tichak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tleirâwlte meuh pawh an chauvin an hah ang a, tlangvâlte pawh an tlu dêr ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa nghâktute erawh chuan an chakna chu an siam ṭha leh ang a; mupuite angin thlain an thlâwk chho vang a, hah lovin an tlân ang a, chau lovin kein an kal ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw thliarkârte u, ka hmaah ngawi ṭhiap rawh u; mi tin chuan an chakna tithar leh sela, lo hnai hlawm sela, chumi hnuah chuan sawi rawh se; rorêl tûrin i inhnaih tlâng teh ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawchhak ata mi pakhat, felna avânga a ke bula a kohva chu tuin nge kai harh? Ani chuan hnam tin a hmaah a pe a, lalho chungah ro a rêltîr a; anni chu vaivut angin a khandaih hnênah a pe a, buhsî thli chhêm lên angin a thal ngul hnênah a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan anniho chu a ûm a, him takin a kal zêl a; a kea a la kal ngai lohna kawngah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tîr ata chhuan zawng zawng kovin, tuin nge thawka, ti zo? Kei Lalpa , a hmasa ber leh a hnuhnûng bera hnêna awm hi, a titu chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thliarkârte chuan an hmu a, an hlau va, kâwlkilte chu an khûr a; an rawn hnaih a, an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi tinin mahni ṭhiante an ṭanpui a; mi tinin an unaute hnênah, “Thlamuang takin awm rawh,” an ti ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, a chârna lam thûah chuan, “A ṭha e,” tiin, themthiam mi chuan rangkachak chher mi a fuih a, tubohva dêng mâm mi chuan dolung dêng mi a fuih bawk a; tin, a nghîn lohna tûrin kilhnatein a kilh tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni Israel-ho, ka chhiahhlawh, Jakob-ho, ka mi thlan, ka ṭhian Abrahama thlahte u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />nangni leilung tâwpna ata ka mi hruai, a kil ata ka mi koh, ‘Ka chhiahhlawhte in ni, paih thla lovin ka thlang zâwk che u,’ ka tihate u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hlau suh u, kei in hnênah ka awm si a; mangang suh u, kei in Pathian ka ni si a. Ka tichak ang che u a, a ni, ka ṭanpui ang che u; ka felna kut ding lamin ka chelh reng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh, in chunga lungni lo zawng zawng chu mualpho tak leh zak takin an awm ang; nangmahni hnialtute chu eng mah lo ang an ni ang a, an boral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmahni hnialtute chu in zawng ang a, in hmu si lo vang. Nangmahni dotute chu eng mah lo ang an ni ang a, thil awm lo ang mai an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei Lalpa in Pathian hian, ‘Hlau suh u, ka ṭanpui dâwn a che u,’ tiin in kut ding lam chu ka chelh dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang Jakob changpât leh Israel mite u, hlau suh u, ka ṭanpui ang che u,” Lalpan a ti, nangmahni tlantu che u chu Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, buh chîlna khâwl thar tak, hriam tak, ha nei miah ka siam ang che u; tlângte chu chîlin in vaw sawm ang a, mual pâwngte chu buhsî angin in siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In zâp ang a, thliin a chhêm lêng ang a, ṭhâwngaleivirin a tidarh ang; tin, nangni chu Lalpa -ah chuan in lâwm ang a, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chu in la chhuang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi rethei leh pachhiate chuan tui an zawng ṭhîn a, a awm si lo va, an lei chu tuihâlin a ro vek ṭhîn; kei Lalpa hian anni chu ka chhâng ang a, kei Israel-ho Pathian hian anni chu ka kalsan lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlâng sâng kawlh vel vulah chuan luite ka luan chhuahtîr ang a, ruam laiahte chuan tuihnate ka chhuahtîr bawk ang; thlalêr chu dîlah ka siam ang a, ram ro chu tuihnaah ka siam bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thlalêrah chuan sidar thing te, thingrî te, lenhmui te, hriak thing te ka phun ang a; ram rovah chuan fâr te, phân te, tufâr te ka phun za vek ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa kut chuan chûng chu a ti a ni tih leh, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chuan a siam a ni tih an hmuha, an hriata, an ngaihtuaha, an hriat thiam tlânna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“In thu chu rawn sawi rawh u,” Lalpan a ti; “Pathian in intihna chhan berte chu lantîr rawh u,” Jakob-ho Lalin a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Chûng chu lantîr sela, thil lo la thleng tûr chu kan hnênah sawi rawh se; kan ngaihtuah theihna tûr leh a tâwpna tûr kan hriat theihna tûrin, tûn hma thilte chu eng nge a nih sawi rawh u; a nih loh leh, thil lo la thleng tûrte chu hriattîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathiante in ni tih kan hriat theihna tûrin tûn hnua thil lo la thleng tûrte chu sawi rawh u le; a ni, kan manganna tûr leh kan en tlânna tûrin, thil ṭha emaw, thil ṭha lo emaw ti rawh u le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngai teh u, eng mah in lo nih loh hi, in thiltih pawh eng mah a ni hek lo; nangmahni thlangtute chu mi tenawm tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hmâr lam ata mi pakhat ka kai harh a, ani chu a lo thleng ta, ni chhuahna ata ka hming lamtu chu; ani chuan lung chârna sawisak angin rorêltute a sawisa ang a, bêlvawtuin hlum a rap ban angin a rap bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kan hriat theihna tûrin tuin nge a tîr aṭang khân sawi ngai? A ni, ‘Ani hi a dik e,’ kan tih theihna tûrin tuin nge sawi lâwk ngai? A ni, sawi rêng rêng an awm lo, a ni, hriattîr rêng rêng an awm lo, a ni, in thusawite hi hria rêng rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keiin Zion hnênah chuan, ‘En teh, anni saw en teh,’ ka ti hmasa ang a; Jerusalem hnênah chuan Chanchin Ṭha rawn thlentu pakhat ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, ka han en pawhin mi rêng rêng an awm lo va; anmahni ka han zawh pawhin, an zînga remruattu, thu pakhat pawh chhâng thei tu mah rêng rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En teh u, an za hian, an hnathawhte chu eng mah lo a ni a, thil awm lo rêng rêng a ni; an milem chhûnte chu thli leh boruak chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh, ka chelh reng, ka thlan, ka rilruin a lawm êm êma hi en teh u; a chungah ka thlarau ka dah ta; Jentail-te hnêna pêk tûrin rorêlna thu a la chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A au lo vang a, aw a chhuah hek lo vang a, kawtthlerah a aw chu a hriattîr hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Luang sâwp a titliak fithla lo vang a, la khu pawh a timit lo vang; rorêlna chu thutakin a kengkawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leiah hian rorêlna a awmtîr hma loh chuan ani chu a chau lo vang a, a beidawng hek lo vang; tin, thliarkârte chuan a dân thu chu an nghâk reng dâwn.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian, Lalpa , vân siamtu leh kai pharhtu, lei leh a chhûng ata chhuak zawng zawng tizautu, a chunga mite hnêna thâwkna petu leh a chunga kalte hnêna thlarau petu chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kei Lalpa hian felnain ka ko a che, i kut ka chelh ang a, ka humhim ang chia, mitdelte mit tivâr tûr leh, mi tângte rip chhûng ata hruai chhuak tûr leh, thim zînga ṭhute tân in ata hruai chhuak tûrin, mite thuthlung atân leh Jentail-te tiêngtu atân ka ruat ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka ni, chu chu ka hming a ni; ka ropuina hi mi dang hnênah ka pe lo vang a, fak ka hlawhna hi milem siam chawpte hnênah ka pe hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh u, tûn hma thilte chu a lo thleng ta, thil tharte ka sawi a nih hi; a ṭiah hmain a chanchin ka hrilh che u a nih hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuifinriata zuk kalte leh, a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte leh, thliarkârte leh a chunga awm zawng zawngte u, Lalpa chawimawiin hla thar sa ula, kâwlkil aṭang pawhin amah fakna hla sa rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlalêr leh a khawpuite chuan an aw chhuah rawh se, Kedar-ho awmna khuate chuan. Sela khuaa awmte chu hlim takin zai sela, tlâng chhîp aṭangte chuan au rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chu tiropui sela, thliarkârahte chuan a fakna thu hril rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chu mi chak tak angin a chhuak ang a, indo mi angin thinurna a chawk tho vang; a au vang a, a ni, ring takin a au vang; amah dotute chungah chuan chak takin a che ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rei tak ka ngawi reng tawh a; ka awm hle hlein ka insûm hrâm hrâm ṭhîn. Tûnah erawh chuan hmeichhe nau vei angin ka au tuar tuar ang a; ka thaw huam huamin ka thaw hlawp hlawp bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tlângte leh mual pâwngte chu ka tichhia ang a, a hnim zawng zawngte chu ka tiro vek ang; luite chu thliarkârahte ka siam ang a, dîlte chu ka tikang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mitdelte chu an hriat ngai loh kawngah ka rawn hruai ang a; an hriat ngai loh kalkawngahte chuan ka hruai ang. An hmaah chuan thim chu êngah ka siam ang a, kawng kawi laite chu ka tingîl bawk ang. Chûng thil chu ka ti ang a, anni pawh ka thlahthlam lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Milem siam chawpte ringa, milem chhûnte hnêna, ‘Kan pathiante in ni,’ titute chu hawi kirtîrin an awm ang a, nasa takin an mualpho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bengngawngte u, bengin hre rawh u; mitdelte u, in hmuh theih nân en rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh lo chu tu mit nge del? A nih loh leh, ka tirhkoh tirh angin tu beng nge ngawng? Mi remtu angin tu mit nge dela, Lalpa chhiahhlawh angin tu mit nge del?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil tam tak i hmu a; nimahsela, i rilruah i vawng reng ṭhîn lo; a bengte chu a âwng a; nimahsela, a hre ṭhîn lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dân chu a felna avânga tihlena tihzahawm chu Lalpa chuan ṭha a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, hêng mite hian rawk leh suam an tâwk a, humah an tla a, tân inah an tâng bo va; sal atân man an ni a, chhantu tu mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In zîngah hian chûngah chuan tu nge bengchhi tûr awm che u? Hun lo la thleng tûr atân ngaithlaa hre tûr tu nge awm che u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuin nge Jakob-ho râllâka lâk tûra pea, Israel-ho rûkrute hnênah pe ni? Lalpa , a chunga thil kan tihsualna chuan a pêk a ni lâwm ni? A kawngahte an kal duh si lo va, a dân thu lah an awih hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin, a thinur nasa tak chu an chungah a leih a, indo râpthlâk an chungah a thlentîr a, chu chuan anmahni chu a kâng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tûnah erawh chuan, aw Jakob-hote u, Lalpa , nangmahni siamtu leh, aw Israel-hote u, nangmahni dintu chuan heti hian a ti: “Hlau suh u, ka tlan tawh che u hi; in hmingin ka ko che u a, ka ta in ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuite in dai kai lai pawhin kei in hnênah ka awm ang a; luite in dai kai lai pawhin a chîm pil lo vang che u. Meia in kal tlang lai pawhin in kâng lo vang a, mei alhin a tialh hek lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa in Pathian, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima, nangmahni chhandamtu ka ni si a; nangmahni tlanna atân Aigupta ram ka pe a, Ethiopia leh Seba ramte chu nangmahni aiah ka pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ngaiha hlu tak in niha, mi zahawm tak in nih bawka, ka hmangaih bawk che u avângin, nangmahni aiah mite ka pe ang a, in nunna aiah mi tin ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hlau suh u, in hnênah ka awm si a; in thlahte chu khawchhak lam aṭangin ka rawn hruai ang a, khawthlang lam aṭangin ka hruai khâwm ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hmâr lam hnênah chuan, ‘Thlah rawh u,’ ka ti ang a; chhim lam hnênah chuan, ‘Hrêng reng suh u,’ ka ti ang. Ka fapate chu hla tak aṭangin rawn hruai ula, ka fanute chu kâwlkil aṭangin rawn hruai rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka hming pu apiangte leh ka ropuina tûra ka siam apiangte chu; anmahni chu ka din a, a ni, anmahni chu ka siam a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mit nei si mitdelte leh, beng nei si bengngawngte chu hruai chhuak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hnam tinrêng inkhâwm sela, mi tin awm khâwm rawh se. An zîngah tuin nge hei hi sawi theia, tûn hma thilte mi hriattîr thei? Thiam chantîra an awm theihna tûrin an thuhretute chu rawn hruai rawh se; a nih loh leh, bengin hria sela, “Thutak a ni,” ti rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mi hriata, mi rina, amah chu ka ni tih in hriat theihna tûrin, nangni hi mi hriatpuitute in ni, ka chhiahhlawh, ka thlana pawh chu,” Lalpan a ti: “Ka awm hma chuan Pathian rêng rêng din an awm lo va, ka awm hnuah pawh an awm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei, keimah ngei hi, Lalpa chu ka ni; keimah lo chu chhandamtu rêng rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keimahin ka sawi a, ka chhandam a, ka hriattîr a, in zîngah khân ram dang pathian rêng rêng an awm loh kha; chuvângin, nangni hi ka thu mi hriatpuitute in ni,” Lalpan a ti; tin, “Kei hi Pathian chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ni, ni awm achinah khân kei hi amah chu ka ni; tichuan, ka kut ata chhan chhuak thei tu mah rêng rêng an awm lo; hna ka thawk ang a, tuin nge chu chu sût ang?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa , nangmahni tlantu, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chuan heti hian a ti: “Nangmahni avângin Babulon khuaah chuan sipaiho ka tîr a; tichuan, an zain, Kaldai-hote chu, an lâwmna lawngpuiahte chuan tlân bo mi hruaiin ka hruai chhuk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa , in Mi Thianghlima, Israel-ho Siamtu, in Lal chu ka ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipuia kawng siama, tui tam tak zînga lamlian sialtu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />sipai rual ropui tak, tawlailîrte leh sakawrte hruaia, tho leh hauh lo tûra titlu rem rumtu, khâwnvâr phita tihmih anga tichimittu Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tûn hma thilte chu hre reng suh ula, hmasâng thilte chu ngaihtuah hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai teh u, thil thar ka ti dâwn e; tûn apang hian a ṭiak ang; chu chu in hre dâwn lâwm ni? Thlalêrah meuh pawh kawng ka siam ang a, ram rovah chuan luite ka siam bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka mi, ka thlante, mi fakna tilangtu tûra ka tâna ka mi siamte chu in tûr ka pêk theih nân, thlalêrah chuan tuite ka awmtîr avâng leh, ram rovah chuan luite ka awmtîr avângin ramsate pawhin mi chawimawi ang, sihalte, sava nghâwngseite lamin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Jakob-ho, nangni zawngin mi ko si lo va, aw Israel-ho, nangni zawngin mi ning zâwk a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hâlrala in thilhlan ran tête chu mi rawn lâk ngai lo va; in inthawina lamte chuan mi chawimawi ngai hek lo. Thilhlanin rawng ka bâwltîr ngai lo che u a, berawin ka tihah ngai hek lo che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Fu rêng rêng tangkain mi leisak ngai lo va, in inthawinate thauvin mi titlai ngai hek lo; in sualna phurh hnate mi thawhtîr zâwk a, in khawlohnatein nangnin mi tihah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kei, keimah ngei hi, keimah leh keimah avâng ngawta in bawhchhiatnate thai bo ṭhîntu chu ka ni; in sualnate pawh ka hre reng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi hriatpui rawh u; i ngaihtuah tlâng ang u; thiam chantîra in awm theih nân in thu chu sawi rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />In pu hmasa ber khân thil a tisual a, in palaite pawhin ka lakah an bawhchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuvângin, hmun thianghlima mi liante chu ka tibawrhbâng ang a; tichuan, Jakob-ho chu ânchhe dawngah ka siam ang a, Israel-ho chu hau bûrah ka siam bawk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tûnah erawh chuan, aw Jakob-ho ka chhiahhlawhte u, aw Israel-ho ka thlante u, ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa , nangmahni siamtu, chhûl aṭanga nangmahni dintu, nangmahni ṭanpuitu tûr chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Aw Jakob-ho ka chhiahhlawhte u, nangni Jesurun-ho ka thlante u, hlau suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram rovah chuan tui ka leih ang a, lei chârah chuan lui ka luantîr bawk dâwn a ni; in thlahte chungah ka thlarau ka leih ang a, in fate chungah ka malsâwmna ka leih bawk ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tichuan, anni chu, tuipuisuthlahte tui luanna kianga a ṭo ang hian, hlobet zîngah chuan an ṭo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi pakhatin, Lalpa ta ka ni, a ti ang a; mi dangin Jakoba hming a invuah ang a; mi dangin a kutah, Lalpa ta, tia ziakin, Israel hming chu a chi hmingah a hmang ang,’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“ Lalpa , Israel-ho Lal, an tlantu Sipaihote Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Kei hi Hmasabera chu ka ni a, Hnuhnûngbera pawh ka ni; keimah lo chu Pathian rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmasânga mite ka din achinah khân keima tih angin tuin nge ko vanga, tuin nge chûng chu sawi anga, tuin nge ka aiah indawt zêlin tilang ang le? Thil lo thleng tûrte leh lo la awm tûrte chu sawi rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hlau suh ula, ṭih hek suh u: hmânah khân in hnênah ka sawi tawhin ka hriattîr tawh che u a ni lâwm ni? Tichuan, nangni hi mi hriatpuitute in ni. Keimah lo hi Pathian rêng rêng an awm em? A ni, Lungpui rêng rêng a awm lo; pakhat mah a awm ka hre lo.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Milem siam chawp siamtute chu an zain boruak mai an ni a, an thil duh zâwngte chu a ṭangkai lo vang; an mualpho dâwn tih anmahni hriatpuitute pawhin an hmu thei lo va, an hre thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin nge pathian din tehlul le? A nih loh leh, tuin nge eng maha ṭangkai hlei lo milem siam chawp chhûng tehlul le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh, a pâwlpui zawng zawng chu an mualpho vang a; hnathawk mite pawh mihring ve bawk an ni: an zain inkhâwm vek sela, ding rawh se; an hlau vang a, an mualpho tlâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thîrdêngin hreipui a chher ṭhîn a, meilingah a thawlh a, tubohtein a dêng a, a bân chak tak chuan a chher thîn: a ni, a ril a lo ṭâm a, a tha chu a lo zawi ṭhîn; tui rêng rêng a in lo va, a chau ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thingrem siamtuin hrui a pawt mar a, pensilin a rîruat a; nawhmâmnatein a rîruang a din a, bial siamnain a rîruat a, mihring ruangâm angin a din a, ina awm atân mihring mawina angin a din ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sidar thingte a tân a kit a, ṭhîl leh sasua a la a, ngaw thing zînga mi pakhat chu a puala awm tûrin a tinghet a; fâr kûng a phun a, ruahin a châwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan mi tân meia tuahah a ni tawh ang; chuta mi chu a la a, a intilum ṭhîn; a ni, meiah a chhêm a, chhang a ur ṭhîn; a ni, pathian a siam a, a be ṭhîn; chu thing chuan milem a siam chawp a, chu chu bawkkhupin chibai a bûk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu thing chu a ṭhen meiah a tuah a; a ṭhen chu sa ei nân a hmang a; sa a rawh a, a tlai ṭhîn: a ni, mei lum a ai a, “Chhei! Ka lum ta, mei hmêl ka hmu ta le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A bâng chu pathianah a siam a, a siam chawp milem ngeiah chuan; chu chu bawkkhupa chibai bûkin a bia a, a hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, “Mi chhan him rawh, ka pathian i ni si!” a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An hre lo va, an ngaihtuah hek lo; ani chuan an hmuh theih lohna tûrin a maimitchhîntîr a, an hriat thiam lohna tûrin an thinlung pawh a khârsak ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, tu mân an hre chhuak leh lo va, “Ṭhenkhat chu meiah ka tuah si a; a ni, a vâmah pawh chhang ka hem nghe nghe a; sa pawh ka rawh a, ka ei si a; a bâng chu thil tenawmah ka siam dâwn em ni? Thingtum hmaah kûnin chibai ka bûk dâwn em ni?” ti tûrin anmahniah chuan hriatna leh hriat thiamna a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vut chauh a ei ṭhîn a; a thinlung buma awm chuan a nunna a inchhanhim theih lohna tûr leh, “Ka kut ding lamah hian dâwt a awm lo vem ni?” a tih theih lohna tûrin amah chu a pêntîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Aw Jakob-hote u, chûng thilte chu hre reng rawh u, Israel-hote u, hre reng bawk rawh u, ka chhiahhlawh in ni si a; keiin ka din che u a, ka chhiahhlawh in ni; aw Israel-hote u, ka theihnghilhin in awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In bawhchhiatnate chu chhûm chhah mup tihbo angin ka tibo ta a, in sualnate chu chhûm tihbo angin ka tibo ta bawk a. Ka hnênah lo kîr leh rawh u, ka tlan tawh si che u a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw vânte u, hlim takin zai rawh u, Lalpan chu chu a ti ta si a; lei hnuai lamte u, au rawh u; tlângte u, aw ramhnuai leh a chhûnga thing awm tinrêngte u, hla sa chhuak phut rawh u; Lalpa chuan Jakob-ho a tlan tawh a, Israel-hovah chuan a inchawimawi dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa , nangmahni tlantu, chhûl aṭanga nangmahni dintu chuan heti hian a ti: “Kei hi Lalpa , thil zawng zawng siamtu, mahni chauhva vân kai pharhtu, lei tizautu chu ka ni; tu nge ka hnênah awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kei hi dawtheiho chhinchhiahna eng mah lova siama, aienthiamte mi âa siamtu, mi fingte hawi kîrtîra, an hriatna âtthlâka siamtu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />mahni chhiahhlawh thu tingheta, mahni palaite remruat hlensaktu, Jerusalem chungchâng thûa, ‘Chutah chuan mi an awm leh ang,’ titu leh, Juda ram khaw chungchâng thûa, ‘Siamin a awm leh hlawm ang a, a chhe laite chu ka siam ṭha leh ang,’ titu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tui thûk tak hnêna, ‘Kang chat rawh, i luite pawh ka tikang bawk dâwn,’ titu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kura chungchâng thûa, ‘Ani chu ka berâm vêngtu a ni a, Jerusalem chungchâng thûa, “Siamin a awm leh ang,” tih leh, Pathian biak in hnêna, “I lungphûm chu remin a awm leh ang,” ti hial khawpin ka duh zâwng zawng zawng chu a ti ang,’ titu ka ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hriak thih Kura, hnamte chu a hmaah tudawl tûr leh, lalho kâwnghrênte phelhsak tûr leh, a hmaa kawngkhârte hawnsak tûr leh, kulh kawngkhârte khâr lova awmtîr tûra a kut ding lam ka chelha hnênah chuan, heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘Kei i hmaah ka kal ang a, a bumboh laite chu ka tirual ang; dâr kawngkhârte chu ka tichhe rem rum ang a, a kalhna thîr tlâwnte chu ka tibung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa , i hminga kotu che, Israel-ho Pathian ngei chu ka ni tih i hriat theih nân thim zînga rote chu ka pe ang chia, hmun fianrialtea sum thuhrûkte pawh ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jakob-ho ka chhiahhlawhte leh Israel-ho ka thlante avâng chuan i hmingin ka ko che a ni; mi hre ngai lo mah la, hming ka saksak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni, a dang rêng rêng an awm lo; keimah lo chu Pathian rêng rêng an awm lo. Keimah lo chu a dang rêng rêng an awm lo tih ni chhuahna lam aṭang leh thlang lam aṭanga an hriat theihna tûrin, mi hre ngai lo mah la, i tai ka hrênsak ang che. Kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni, a dang rêng rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eng ka siam ṭhîn a, thim pawh ka siam ṭhîn a ni; remna ka siam ṭhîn a, sualna pawh ka siam ṭhîn a ni; kei hi Lalpa , chûng thil zawng zawng ti ṭhîntu chu ka ni,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vânte u, chung lam aṭang khân far thlâktîr rawh u, vân dumte khân felna rawn leih thla rawh se; chhandamna an chawr chhuahtîr theih nân lei hi inhawng sela, felna nên ṭo duntîr rawh se. Kei, Lalpa hian chu chu ka siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mahni Siamtu hnialtu chu a chung a pik e! Leia lampei zînga lampei mai mai chu! Hlum chuan a vawtu hnênah, ‘Eng nge i siam ni?’ a ti dâwn em ni? A nih loh leh, i hnathawh chuan, ‘A kutin thiam rêng a nei lo,’ a ti dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pa hnêna, ‘Eng nge i hrin ni?’ titu leh, a nu hnêna, ‘Eng nge i hrin dâwn ni?’ titu chu an chung a pik e!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima, anmahni Siamtu chuan heti hian a ti: “Thil lo la thleng tûr thu chu mi zâwt ula; ka fapate thûah leh ka kut hnathawh thûah hian thu min pe rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lei hi ka siam a, a chunga mihring awm hi ka siam bawk a. Keiman ka kut ngei hian vân ka kai pharh a, a sipaihote chu thu ka pe bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kura chu felna neiin ka kai harh a, a kawng zawng zawng chu ka tingîl ang; ani chuan ka khawpui chu a siam leh ang a, an tlanna man duh vâng ni lovin, lâwmman duh vâng ni hek lovin, ka salte chu a chhuahtîr ang, Sipaihote Lalpan a ti,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Aigupta thawk rimho leh Ethiopia sumdâwng mi leh Seba-ho mi sâng takte chu in hnên lamah an lo kal ang a, in taah an awm tawh ang; nangmahni an zui ang che u, khaidiat bunin a ni an lo kal dâwn ni; tichuan, bawkkhupin chibai an bûk ang che u a, ‘Pathian chu nangmahniah a awm ngei mai, a dang rêng rêng an awm lo; pathian dang rêng rêng an awm lo,’ tiin in hnênah khawngaihna an dîl ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Israel-ho Pathian, Chhandamtu, Pathian inthup ṭhîna chu i ni ngei mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mualpho takin an awm ang, a ni, an zain zak takin an awm ang; milem siamtute chu zahnaah chuan an lût tlâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel-ho erawh chu kumkhaw chhandamnaa Lalpa chhandamin an awm ang; chatuan thleng pawhin in mualphovin in zak hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa , vân siamtu chuan (ani chu Pathian, leilung hi dina siamtu chu a ni; ani chuan leilung hi a tinghet a, eng mah lovah a siam lo va, mihring awm nân a din zâwk a ni) heti hian a ti si a: “Kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni, a dang rêng rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A rûkin ram thim hmunah thu ka sawi ngai lo va; Jakoba thlahte hnênah, ‘Eng mah lovah mi zawng rawh u,’ ka ti ngai hek lo; kei Lalpa hian felna thu ka sawi ṭhîn a, thu dik tak ka hril ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Inkhâwm ula, lo kal rawh u; hnam tin zînga hremna pumpelhhote u, lo hnai tlâng rawh u. An thing milem siam chawp keng ṭhîna, mi chhan him thei hlei lo pathian hnêna ṭawngṭai ṭhîntute chuan hriatna rêng rêng an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sawi ula, rawn tichhuak rawh u; a ni, inberâwn hlawm rawh se. Hmasâng ata tuin nge hriattîr? Hmânlai ata tuin nge sawi? Kei Lalpa hian ka tih a ni lâwm ni? Keimah lo chu Pathian dang rêng rêng an awm lo; Pathian fel leh chhandamtu ka ni; keimah lo chu a dang rêng rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kâwlkila mi zawng zawngte u, ka lam lo hawi ula, chhandamin awm rawh u; kei hi Pathian ka ni si a, a dang rêng rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Khûp tinrêng chu ka hmaah an ṭhingṭhi tawh ang a, lei tinrêng pawhin ka hnênah chhechhamin thu an tiam tawh ang,’ tiin mahni leh mahni inchhâlin chhia ka chham ta, thu chu felna hlîrin ka kâ aṭangin a chhuak tawh a, a lo lêt leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Miin, ‘ Lalpa ah chauh felna leh chakna a awm,’ tiin ka hnênah an la sawi ang. Ama hnên ngeiah mi an lo kal ang a, a chunga lungni lo zawng zawngte chu mualpho takin an awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israela thlahte zawng zawng chu Lalpa -ah chuan a ni, thiam chantîra an awma, Lalpa chu an chhuan dâwn ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bela chu a lo kûn reng a, Neboa chu a lo intihniam reng a; an milemte chu sa chungah leh ran chungah an hlâng a: in thil vah vêlpui ṭhinte chu phurah lek siam a ni a, sa chau tâna phurritah lek siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An lo intihniam rengin, an lo kûn dûn reng a; phurrit chu an chhan him thei lo va, anmahni ngei pawh chu sala hruaiin an awm ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Jakoba chhûngte leh, Israela chhûngte zînga a la awm chhun zawng zawng, pum aṭanga ka puaka, chhûl aṭanga ka kawm tawhte u, ka thu ngaithla rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />in tarkûn thleng pawhin amaha chu ka ni ang a, in lua kêlsam a ṭo vek thleng pawhin ka pawm ang che u. Keiman ka siam a, keimah vêkin ka pua ang; a ni, kei chuan ka pawm ang a, ka chhan him ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuhmuna ngaih kan nihna tûrin tu nên nge mi tehkhina, tu tlukah nge mi siama, tu nên nge mi tehkhin dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Iptêa mi rangkachak bun chhuak ṭhîna, tangkaraw bûknaa bûk ṭhînate chuan rangkachak chhertu an ruai a, ani chuan pathianah a siam ṭhîn a; tichuan, an bawkkhup a, a ni, chibai an bûk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An kokiah an pu a, an kalpui a, a hmun tûrah chuan an dah ṭhîn a, a ding ta reng a; a awmna ata chu a sawn tawh lo vang. A ni, miin ani chu an au vang a; nimahsela, a chhâng thei si lo vang a, an manganna ata a chhan chhuak thei hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw bawhchhetute u, chu chu hre reng ula, intimipa ula, hre chhuak leh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûn hma thilte chu hre reng rawh u; kei hi Pathian ka ni a, a dang rêng rêng an awm si lo; kei hi Pathian ka ni, keimah ang rêng rêng an awm lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />keiin a tâwp tûr chu a tîr aṭang rêngin ka sawi ṭhîn a, thil la tih lohte chu hmasâng aṭang rêngin ka sawi ṭhîn; ‘Ka remruat chu a ding chhuak ang a, ka duh zâwng zawng zawng chu ka ti vek ang,’ ka ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khawchhak lam ata sava koham tak, ram hla tak ata ka mi ruat chu ka ko va; a ni, ka sawi tawh a, ka hlen bawk ang; ka tum tawh a, ka ti bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rilru uangthuang, felna hlata awmte u, ka thu ngaithla rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ka felna chu ka rawn la hnai a, hla takah a awm lo vang, ka chhandamna pawhin rei a rial lo vang; tichuan, ka ropuina Israel-ho tân chhandamna chu Zion-ah chuan ka dah ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Babulon fanu nula, chhuk la, vaivutah ṭhu rawh; aw Kaldai fanu, lalṭhutphah tel lovin leiah ṭhu rawh. Awm no leh nuamsa an ti dâwn tawh si lo che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Buh râwt sawmna lungte la la, chhangphut siam rawh. I inkhuhna puan kha dah la, i fên fual kha hlîp la, i ke kha hawng la, luite dai kai rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I saruak chu khuh lohvin a awm ang a, a ni, i zahmawh chu a lang ang; phuba ka la ang a, mi tu mah ka ren lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Min tlantu chu, a hming Sipaihote Lalpa a ni, Israel-hote Mi Thianghlima chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Aw Kaldai fanu, ngawi rengin ṭhu la, thim hnuaiah lût rawh, ‘Ram tin lalnu’ an ti dâwn tawh lo che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite chungah ka thinur a, ka rochan chu ka tibawrhbâng a; i kutah ka pe chia, nang chuan an chungah khawngaihna rêng rêng i lantîr lo va; tarho chungah lam pawh i nghâwngkawl rit tak chu i nghat ta chawrh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ‘Kei hi kumkhuain lalnuah ka awm ang,’ i ti a; chutichuan, chûng thilte chu i rilruin i ngaihtuah lo va, a tâwpna tûr lah chu i hre reng hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, nang nun khaw nawm bâwla, ngaihsam taka awma, mahni rilrua, ‘Keimah ka ni, keimah lo chu mi dang rêng rêng an awm lo; hmeithaiah ka ṭhu lo vang a, fate chân thu ka hre hek lo vang,’ titu, hei hi hre rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hêng thil pahnih, fate chânna leh hmeithaina hian ni khat thil thûah, mitkhapkâr lovah a tlâkbuak zâwk dâwn che a ni. I dawi hmanna chu tam hlein, i invênna chu tam rei rui mah sela, chûng chu nasa tak maiin i chungah a lo thleng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I suahsualna chu i ring a, ‘Tu mân min hmu lo ve,’ i ti vei si a; i finna leh i hriatna chuan a tikhawlo chia; ‘Keimah ka ni, keimah lo chu mi dang rêng rêng an awm lo,’ i rilruin i ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, thil ṭha lo i chungah a lo thleng ang a; a vên dân i thiam lo vang. Vânduaina pawhin a tlâkbuak ang chia; chu chu i tibo thei lo vang; ṭiauna pawh vawi leh khatah i chungah a lo thleng thut ang a, chu chu i hre lâwk lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I invênna leh i dawi hmanna, i naupan têt ata i intihhah ṭhinnate chu dinpui ta che; i sâwtpui theih dâwn phawta, i hnehpui theih dâwn phawt chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I remruat a tam êm avângin i hah ta a nih hi; tûnah chuan vân semtute, arsi thlîrtute, thla kipa thu hrilh lâwktute chu ding sela, i chunga thil lo la thleng tûrte lakah chuan chhan him che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh, buhpâwl ang mai a ni ang a, meiin a kâng ang; mei alh thiltihtheihna lakah chuan an inchhanhim lo vang; intihlumna tûr meihawl ang a ni lo vang a, ai tûr mei ang pawh a ni hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutiang chuan i intihhah ṭhinna thilte chu i tân a awm dâwn a ni; i naupan têt ata i laka sumdâwngtute chu mahni kawng ṭheuhvah an vâk bo vang a; chhanhimtu tûr che tu mah rêng rêng an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Jakoba chhûng, Israela hming ṭâwma, Juda tuite laka chhuaka, thutakah ni si lova, felnaah ni si hek lova, Lalpa hming chhâla chhechhama, Israel-ho Pathian hming lam ṭhîntute u, hei hi ngaithla rawh u
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(Khawpui thianghlima mi an inti si ṭhîn a, Israel-ho Pathian chungah rinna an nghat bawk a ni; a hming chu Sipaihote Lalpa a ni):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tûn hma thilte chu hmasâng aṭangin ka sawi a; a ni, ka kâ aṭangin a chhuak a, ka hriattîr a; vawi leh khatah ka hlen thut a, a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi luhlul in niha, in nghâwng chu thîr thâ a niha, in chal chu dâr a nih ka hriat avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />hmasâng aṭangin in hnênah ka sawi a; a lo thlen hma pawhin in hnênah ka hriattîr che u kha; chuti lo chuan, ‘Ka milem chuan a tih a ni, ka milem siam chawp leh milem chhûn chuan thu a pêk a ni,’ in ti dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In hriat kha; hêng zawng zawng hi en rawh u; nangmahnin in sawi dâwn tawh lâwm ni? Tûn achinah thil thar ka hriattîr dâwn a che u, thil inthup in hriat ngai lohte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chûng chu hmâsâng aṭanga siam ni lovin, tûna siam a ni a; vawiin ni hma khân in bengin in hre ngai lo; chuti lo chuan, ‘Ngai teh, chûng chu kan hre reng alâwm,’ in ti dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ni, in bengin in hre ngai lo va; a ni, in rilruin in hre ngai hek lo; a ni, hmasâng aṭang rêngin in beng chu hawnin a awm ngai lo. Vervêk tak takin in ti ṭhîn tih leh, chhûl aṭang rêngin bawhchhetu an ti ṭhîn che u tih ka hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tihboral lohna tûr che uin ka hming avângin ka thinur chu ka khêk rih ang a, fak ka hlawh nân in chungah ka insûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai teh u, ka tithianghlim che u a ni; nimahsela, tangkaraw tihthianghlim angin a ni lo; hrehawmna rawh tuina meiah chuan ka fiah che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keimah leh keimah avâng ngawtin a ni ka tih dâwn ni; ka hming hi engah nge tihchhiatin a awm ang? Ka ropuina hi mi dang hnênah ka pe lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Jakob-ho leh ka koh Israel-hote u, ka thu ngaithla rawh u: kei hi Amaha chu ka ni; a hmasa ber chu ka ni a, a hnuhnûng ber ka ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ni, ka kut hian leilung nghahchhan chu a phûm a, ka kut ding lam hian vânte khi a kai pharh a; ka koh veleh an ding ho ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangniho zawng zawng hi, inkhâwm ula, ngaithla rawh u; an zîngah chuan tuin nge hêng thil hi sawi ngai? Lalpa chuan amah chu a hmangaih a; ani chuan Babulon chungah a duh zâwng a ti ang a, a bân chu Kaldai-ho chungah lekin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei, keimah ngei hian thu ka sawi ta; a ni, amah chu ka ko va, ka hruai a, a kawng chu a titluang zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangniho hian mi rawn hnaih ula, hei hi ngaithla rawh u: a tîr aṭang khân a rûkin thu ka sawi ngai lo va; a awm tirh aṭang khân chutah chuan ka awm. Tûnah hian Lalpa Pathian leh a thlarau chuan kei hi min tîr ta a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa , nangmahni tlantu, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chuan heti hian a ti: “Kei hi Lalpa in Pathian, in ṭhatna tûra nangmahni zirtîrtu, in kalna tûr kawnga hruaitu che u chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw, nangni hian ka thupêkte chu lo ngaithla ta ula chu aw! In chunga remna chu lui ang maia awmin, in felna chu tuifinriat fâwnte ang maiin a awm tûr!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In thlahte pawh ṭiau vaivut zâta awmin, in rîla rahte pawh ṭiauvut mal tê tê zâtin an awm tûr; an hming chu ka hma ata thai bovin a awm lo vang a, tihboralin a awm hek lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babulon ata chhuak ula, Kaldai-ho chu tlân bosan rawh u! Hei hi hla sa thâwmin hriattîr ula, hrilh ula, kâwlkil thleng pawhin tiri ula, “ Lalpa chuan a chhiahhlawh Jakob-ho chu a tlan ta!” ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thlalêrahte a hruai lai khân an tuihâl lo va: lungpui aṭangin an tân tui a luan chhuahtîr a; lungpui chu a tiphel a, tui a lo chhuak ta dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Mi suaksualte tân chuan muanna rêng rêng a awm lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aw thliarkârte u, ka thu ngaithla ula, hla tak ata mi tinte u, ngaithla bawk rawh u: Lalpa chuan chhûl aṭang rêngin mi ko va; ka nu pum chhûng aṭang rêngin ka hming a lo sawi tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kâ hi khandaih hriam tak angin a siam a, a kutah chuan mi thukru a; thal nawh tlêt varah mi siam a, a thal bâwmah chuan mi khung tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, ‘Nang chu ka chhiahhlawh i ni a, Israela, chawimawia ka awmna tûra chu i ni,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan, ‘A thlâwn maiin ka thawk rim a, eng mah lovah leh boruak maiah ka tha ka sêng a; nimahsela, mathei lovin ka chunga rorêlna tûr chu Lalpa hnênah a ni a awm ni, mi rulhna tûr pawh chu ka Pathian hnênah a ni a awm ni,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, tûnah chuan Lalpa , Jakob-ho a hnêna hruai leh nân leh, Israel-ho a hnêna hruai khâwma an awm nân, a chhiahhlawha awm tûra chhûl aṭanga mi dintu chuan a sawi a (Lalpa mit hmuhin mi zahawm ka ni si a, ka Pathian chu ka chakna a lo ni ta bawk a):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a ni, ani chuan, ‘Jakob-ho hnamte tundin nân leh Israel-ho zînga humhimate chu awmtîr leh nâna ka chhiahhlawha i awm hi thil tê tak tê a la ni; Jentail-te tiêngtuah ka ruat bawk ang che, kâwlkil thlenga ka chhandamtua i awm theihna tûrin,’” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-ho tlantu leh an Mi Thianghlima chuan, mite hmusita, hnamho ten riauva, rorêltute chhiahhlawh hnênah chuan heti hian a ti: “ Lalpa rinawma, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima, nangmah thlangtu avâng khân lalten an hmu ang a, an tho vang; mi liante pawhin chibai an bûk ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, “Hun lâwmawmah ka ngaithla chia, chhandamna nîah ka ṭanpui che; mi tângte hnênah, ‘Chhuak rawh u,’ thima awmte hnênah, ‘Lo lang rawh u,’ tia, ram tungding tûr leh, rochan ram ṭiau tawh hnute anniho chu luahtîr tûrin ka humhim chein, mite thuthlung atân ka ruat ang che. Kawngahte chuan an ei zêl ang a, tlâng sâng kawlh vel vul zawng zawngahte chuan an tlatna hmun chu a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An rilṭâmin an tuihâl lo vang a, lumin a tihrehawmin niin a em hek lo vang; anmahni khawngaihtu chuan a hruai dâwn si a, tuihna kiang ngeiahte chuan a hruai dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, ka tlâng zawng zawng chu kawngah ka siam ang a, ka lamliante chu tihsânin a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />En teh, sâwngte saw hla tak aṭangin an lo kal dâwn saw; en teh, sâwngte saw hmâr lam aṭang te, thlang lam aṭang tein an lo kal dâwn saw; sâwngte saw Sinim ram aṭangin an lo kal dâwn saw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw vânte u, hlim takin zai rawh u; aw leilung, hlim takin awm rawh; aw tlângte u, hla sa chhuak phut rawh u! Lalpa chuan a mite chu a thlamuan si a, mi, hrehawm tuarte pawh chu a khawngaih dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, Zion chuan, “Jehovan mi kalsan a, Lalpan mi theihnghilh ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Hmeichhiain a fapa, a rîla rah chu, khawngaih lohna tûrin a fa, a hnute hne lai chu a theihnghilh thei em ni? Thei e, chûngte chuan an theihnghilh a ni thei e; nimahsela, kei chuan ka theihnghilh lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />En teh, ka kutphahahte hian ka ziak che hi; i kulh bangte chu ka hmaah a awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I fate chu an hmanhmawh ang a; nangmah tiboraltute leh nangmah tichhetute chuan an kal bosan ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dâk la, i mit lên vêl la, en rawh; hêng zawng zawng hi an inkhâwm a, i hnênah an lo kal a nih hi. Ka nunna chhâlin. ‘Nang chuan cheimawina inbel angin hêngho hi i inbelin, mo a inhrêng angin hêngho hian i inhrêng ngei ang,’ ” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“I hmun chhia leh ṭiau hnute leh i ram tihboral hnu thûah zawng, tûnah chuan a awmate tân i tê lutuk ngei ngei dâwn tawh si a, nangmah lemtute kha hla takah an awm dâwn tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I fa hloh hnua i fa neih lehte chuan, ‘Hmun hi ka tân a tê lutuk a; ka awmna tûrin hmun mi pe rawh,’ tiin i beng hriatah an la sawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, nangin i rilruin, ‘Hêngho hi tuin nge mi hrinsak ni le, ka fate ka hloh va, mahni maia sala vâk vâk ka ni si a? Tichuan, hêngho hi tuin nge tiseilian ni le? Ngai teh, keimah chauhva hnutchhiahin ka awm si a; hêngho hi khawiah nge an lo awm ni le?’ i ti ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh, hnam tin tân ka kut ka pharin, mi tin tân ka chhinchhiahna ka târ chhuak ang; tichuan, i fapate chu a pawma pawmin i hnênah an rawn hruai ang a, i fanute pawh an kokia chhuanga rawn hruaiin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalte chu i fate pawmtupa an ni ang a, an lalnute pawh chu i fate pawmtunu an ni ang; anni chuan hmaia lei siin chibai an bûk ang chia, i kea vaivut chu an liak ang; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih i hre mai ang, mi nghâktute chu mualphovin an awm lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Râllâkte chu mi chak tak lakah chhuhsaka awmin, mi hlauhawm salte chu chhan chhuahin an awm dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Dâwn e a! Mi chak tak salte meuh pawh chhan chhuahin an awm ang a; mi hlauhawm râllâkte chu chhuhsakin an awm ang; nangmah dotu chu ka do dâwn si a, i fate pawh ka chhandam dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, nangmah hnehchhiahtute chu anmahni sa ka eitîr ang a, uain thlum rui angin anmahni thisenin an rui ang. Tichuan, mi zawng zawngin, kei Lalpa hi nangmah chhandamtu leh nangmah tlantu, Jakob-ho Mi Chaka chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “In nu mâkna lehkha, ka mâkna chu khawiah nge a awm ni? A nih loh leh, ka leibatnate a tu bera hnênah nge ka hralh che u ni? Ngai teh u, in khawlohnate avângin a ni, hralha in awma, in bawhchhiatnate avângin a ni, in nu pawh kha mâka a awm ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eng vângin nge ka lo kal khân mi rêng rêng an awm loh le? Eng vângin nge ka koh khân mi chhâng tûr rêng rêng an awm loh le? Ka kut hi tlan thei lo tûrin tihtawiin a awm rêng rêng em ni? A nih loh leh, chhan him tûrin thiltihtheihna rêng rêng ka nei lo vem ni? Ngai teh u, ka zilhhau chauh pawhin tuipui ka tikang ṭhîn a, luipuite chu ram rovah ka siam ṭhîn: tui rêng rêng a awm loh avângin a sanghate chu a uih a, tuihâlin an thi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vân khi thimin ka tuam ṭhîn a, saiip puana khuhna tûrin ka siam ṭhîn,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mi hah tak chu thûa ka tihhahdam thiam nân Lalpa Pathian chuan zirtîrte lei mi pe a; ani chuan a tûk a tûk tin a kai harh a, zirtîrten an hriat anga hre tûrin ka beng hi ka kai harh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan ka beng mi tih-âwngsak a, kei chu ka hel lo va, ka hawi kîr hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hnungzâng hi vawtute hnênah ka dawh a, ka biangte hi hmul pawttute hnênah ka dawh bawk a; mualphonaah leh chilah ka hmai ka hup lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan mi ṭanpui dâwn si a; chuvângin, ka zak ngai lo va; chuvângin, meilung ang tlatin ka hawi ṭhîn a, ka mualpho lo vang tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thiam mi chantîrtu chu a hnai e; tuin nge mi do vang? I ding ve ve ang. Mi dotu chu tu nge ni? Mi rawn hnaih rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa Pathian chuan mi ṭanpui ang; tuin nge thiam loh mi chantîr ang? Ngai teh, chûng zawng zawngte chu silhfên angin a la hlui ang a, thîmin a ei chhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In zîngah Lalpa ṭiha, a chhiahhlawh thu âwih chu tu nge ni? Thima lênga, êng rêng rêng nei lova chuan Lalpa hming chu ring sela, a Pathian chungah innghat rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mei chhêma, thingthûtea inhrêng ṭhîn zawng zawngte u, ngai teh u; in mei alhah leh in thingthu hâlte zîngah chuan lêng rawh u. Hei hi ka kut aṭanga in la hmuh tûr chu a ni: lungngai taka in la mutna tûr chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Felna ûmtute u, Lalpa zawngtute u, ka thu ngaithla rawh u: nangmahni chherna lungpui lam leh, khuarkhuruma nangmahni laih chhuahna khur lam kha en rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In pu Abrahama lam leh nangmahni hringtu Sari lam en rawh u; ani chu pakhat chauh a nih lai khân ka ko va, mal ka sâwm a, mi tam takah ka siam tâk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Zion chu a thlamuan ta si a; a hmun chhe tawhte zawng zawng chu a thlamuan a, a thlalêr chu Eden angin a siam a, a ram ro chu Lalpa huan angin a siam bawk a; chutah chuan lâwmna leh hlimna te, lâwmthu sawina leh hla sa thâwm te a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw ka mite u, ka thu hi ngaithla ula; aw ka hnamte u, ka thûah hian beng lo chhi rawh u: keimah aṭangin dân thu a lo chhuak dâwn si a, mi tin ênna tûrin ka rorêlna chu ka chawlhtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka felna chu a hnai e, ka chhandamna chu a chhuak tawh a, ka bânte hian mi tin ro a rêlsak ang, thliarkârte chuan mi nghâk ang a, ka bân hi an ring ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vân lamahte khian in mit lên chho ula, hnuai lama leilung chu en rawh u. Vân khi meikhu angin a la zâm ral ang a, leilung hi silhfên angin a la hlui ang, a chhûnga awmte chu chutiang bawkin an la thi ang; ka chhandamna erawh chu kumkhuain a awm ang a, ka felna pawh tihbovin a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Felna hretu, ka dân thu thinlunga pai mite u, ka thu ngaithla rawh u; mihringte sawichhiatna hlau suh ula, an hauna che u avângin mangang hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thîmin silhfên a ei chhe vek angin, anni chu a ei chhe vek dâwn si a, sûlrûlin sahmul a ei angin anni chu a ei dâwn a ni; ka felna erawh chu kumkhuain a awm ang a, ka chhandamna chu chhuan zawng zawng thlengin a awm ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa bân, harh la, harh la, chakna inbel rawh; hmânlai, hmasâng chhuante awm laia i harh ang khân harh rawh. Nang hi Rahab sât sawmtu, dragon chhuntu kha i ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang hi tuifinriat, tui thûk zau tak tui tikangtu, tuifinriat mawng thûk chu tlante kal kaina tûr kawnga siamsaktu i ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa tlante chu an kîr leh ang a, hla sa chungin Zion chu an thleng ang a, chatuana lâwmna an lû chungahte a awm tawh ang. Lâwmna leh hlimna an hmu ang a; lungngaihna leh rûmna chu a bo tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nangmahni thlamuantu che u ka ni a; mihring thi leh mai tûr, hlobet ang lek hi engati nge in hlauh le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hi nangmahni siamtu ka ni a, vânte khi kai pharha, leilung nghahchhan siamtu ka nih in theihnghilh ta elo? Engtizia nge nangmahni hnehchhiah duhtute thinur hlau rêng rênga in la awm fo le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sal hruai bo chu rang taka chhuahin a awm ang a; khuarkhurumah a thi lo vang a, chaw a tlachham hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei Lalpa i Pathian, a fâwnte chu ri hum hum khawpa tuifinriat chawk lettu chu ka ni si a: ka hming chu Sipaihote Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, vân khi ka kaih pharh theiha, leilung nghahchhante ka phûm theiha, Zion-ho hnênah, ‘Ka mite in ni e,’ ka tih theih nân ka thute chu i kâah ka dah a, ka kutin ka hûm che a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, Lalpa kut ata a thinrimna nova mi in nu, harh la, harh la, tho rawh; nang chuan pai paina no berhbua mi i in a, i in fai kêlh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A fapa hrin zawng zîngah chuan amah hruaitu tûr tu mah an awm lo va; a fapa châwm len zawng zawng zîngah chuan a kuta chelh tu mah an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hêng thil pahnih hian a tlâkbuak tâk che hi; tuin nge ṭahpui dâwn che aw? Ṭiauna leh chhiatna te, ṭâm leh khandaihte hian; engtin nge ka thlamuan ang che aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I fapate chu an chau va, sathâr lêna a âwk angin thlêr lû lam zawng zawngah chuan an mu phung a; Lalpa thinrimna leh i Pathian zilhhaunain an khat hlawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuvângin, nang tihretheih leh uain rui ni si lova mi rui, hei hi hre rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />i Lalpa Jehova, i Pathian, a mite thu sawipui ṭhîntu chuan heti hian a ti, “Ngai teh, pai paina no, ka thinrimna no berhbu ngei chu, i kut ata ka la chhuak ta; i in leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmah tiretheitute kutah ka dah ang; anni chuan i nunna hnênah, ‘Kan zawh tûr chein bawkkhup rawh,’ an tih kha; tichuan, nangin zawhtute hnênah chuan i hnungzâng chu lei ang leh kawtthlêr angin i dawh kha,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Zion, harh la, harh la, i chakna inbel rawh; aw Jerusalem, khawpui thianghlim, i silhfên mawi takte chu inbel rawh. Tûn achinah chuan serhtan loh leh mi bawlhhlawh chu i chhûngah an lût tawh dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, vaivut i kai kha inthing rawh; tho la, ṭhu rawh. Aw Zion fanu, sala awm, i nghâwng phuarnate kha phelh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti si a: “Eng mah lova hralh in ni a; tichuan, tangka lova tlan in ni tawh ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti si a: “Ka mite chu a tîrah chuan Aigupta rama awm tûrin an chhuk a; tin, Assuria miten enga khaw lawilovin an hnehchhiah hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, tûnah hetah hian eng nge ka tih dâwn? Ka mite hi eng mah lova hruai bovin an awm si a,” Lalpan a ti, “An chunga rorêltute chu an ṭê tuar tuar a,” Lalpan a ti, “Ka hming hi nilênga sawichhiatin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka mite chuan ka hming an hria ang; chuvângin, chumi nîah chuan a sawitu chu ka ni tih an hria ang: ‘Ngai teh, keimah hi ka ni,’” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tlângahte Chanchin Ṭha thlena, remna thu tlângaupuia, thil ṭha Chanchin Ṭha thlena, chhandamna thu tlangaupuia, Zion hnêna, “I Pathian chu lalah a ṭhu,” titu ke chu a va mawi êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu! I râl vêngtute aw chu! Aw an chhuaha, hlim takin an zai ho chu; Lalpa chu Zion-ah a lo kîr leh hunah chuan inhmatawnin an hmu dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem hmun chhe tawhte u, hlim chhuak phut ula, hlim takin zai ho rawh u, Lalpa chuan a mite chu a thlamuan ta si a, Jerusalem chu a tlan ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hnam tinrêngte mit hmuhah a bân thianghlim chu a hlîm ta; tichuan, kâwlkila mi zawng zawngin kan Pathian chhandamna chu an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chhuak rawh u, chhuak rawh u, chuta ṭang chuan chhuak rawh u, thil bawlhhlawh rêng rêng dek suh u; a chhûng ata kal chhuak rawh u; Lalpa bungbêl kengtute u, thianghlim takin awm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmanhmawh takin in kal chhuak dâwn si lo va, tlânchhiain in kal dâwn hek lo; Lalpa chuan in hma a hruai ang a, Israel-ho Pathian chu in hnu dâltu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka chhiahhlawh chuan fing takin a ti ang; chawimawi leh chawi sânin a awm ang a, sâng tak maiin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hmêl chu mihring hmêl ai maha tihchhiat a ni a, a pianhmang pawh mihring pianhmang aia tihchhiat a ni bawk, mi tam takin mak an tih ang bawkin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hnam tam takin mak an ti a, lalho pawh mak tiin an dang reng ang; an hmuh ngai loh an hmuin an hriat ngai loh an hria ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan thusawi tuin nge ring? Lalpa kut chu tu hnênah nge a lan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmaah chuan thil ṭiak no tak angin ani chu a chawr chhuak si a, lei ro aṭanga zung angin a puak chhuak bawk a ni. Pianhmang ṭhatna leh hmêl mawina rêng rêng a nei lo va; amah kan hmuhin amah kan duhna tûrin mawina rêng rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chu mihringte hmuhsit leh duh lohvin a awm a; lungngaihnate nei mi leh natna hre mi a ni a. Miten an hmai an huhsana ang chuan ani chu hmuhsitin a awm a; keini lah chuan ani chu kan ngaisâng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan kan natnate phurin, kan lungngaihnate pawh a phur ngei a; nimahsela, keini chuan lungngaihna tlâkbuakah, Pathian vuakah, tihretheihah kan ngai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu kan bawhchhiatnate avângin hliamin a awm a, kan khawlohnate avângin vuak thitlinin a awm a; kan thlamuanna tûra thununna chu a chungah a tla a, a vuakna vualtea tihdamin kan awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan za hian berâm angin kan vâk bo va; mahni kawng kawngah kan pêng ṭheuh va; Lalpa chuan ani chungah chuan kan zaa khawlohna chu a nghat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chu hnehchhiahin a awm a; nimahsela, a inngaitlâwm a, a ka pawh a âng lo; berâmno talh tûra an hruaia ang leh, berâm a hmul mêttu hmaa ngawi renga awma ang maiin; a ni, a ka a âng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnehchhiahna leh rorêlnaa lâk bovin a awm a; a dam rualpuite lek phei chuan tuin nge mi nung ram ata tihborala a awm chu ngaihtuah tehlul ni? Ka mite bawhchhiatna avângin lungngaihna tlâkbuakin a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, thil râwng taka ti ngai lovin, a kaah tihderna rêng rêng awm ngai lo mah sela, a thlân chu mi sualte hnên lamah an ruatsak a, a thih hnu chuan mi hausa hnên lamah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan ani chu vuak thitlin a duh rêng a ni; a tina ta ngei a. A nunna chu sual tân thilhlana i hman tikah, a chi thlah chu a hmu tawh ang a, a dam chhûng nite chu a tisei ang a, Lalpa duh zâwng chu a kutah hlawhtlingin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A nunna thawh rim rah chu a hmu ang a, a lungawi tawh ang. Ka chhiahhlawh fel tak chuan a hriatnain mi tam tak chu thiam a chantîr ang a, an khawlohnate chu a phurhsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, ani chu mi liante chanvo ang ka sem ve ang a, ani chuan râllâk sumte chu mi chakte a sem ve ang; a nunna chu thi khawp hiala a leih buaka, bawhchhetute zînga chhiar tela a awm avângin; nimahsela, mi tam tak sualna chu a phur a, bawhchhetute tân chuan a ṭawngṭaisak a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aw ching, nang, fa hring ngai lo, hlim takin zai rawh; nang, nau vei ngai lo, hla sa chhuak phutin, au chhuak rawh. Pasal nei mi fate ai chuan khawharnu fate an tam zâwk si,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“I puan in hmun chu zauh rawh, i awmnate puan in chung chu kai pharh rawh se; ren suh; i hruite chu tisei la, i kaih marna khente chu tinghet rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ding lam leh vei lamah i darh zau dâwn si a; tichuan, i chi thlahte chuan hnam tin an rochung ang a, khawpui ṭiau hnuahte chuan mi an awmtîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hlau suh, i mualpho dâwn si lo; zak hek suh, mualphovin i awm dâwn si lo; i tleirâwl lai mualphona chu i theihnghilh tawhin, i hmeithaina hmingchhiatna chu i hre reng dâwn tawh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah siamtu chu i pasal a ni a, a hming chu Sipaihote Lalpa a ni; Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chu nangmah tlantu a ni a, ani chu khawvêl zawng zawng Pathian an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nupui mâk, rilrua lungngai tak, tlangvâl laia nupui tawh, paih hnu koh leh angin Lalpan a ko che a nih hi,” i Pathianin a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mitkhapkâr lek ka ma chia; nimahsela, khawngaihna nasa takin ka hruai leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thinur liamin mitkhapkâr i lakah ka hmai ka thup a; nimahsela, kumkhaw ngilneihnain ka khawngaih ang che,” Lalpa , nangmah tlantu chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Chu chu ka tân Nova tuite ang kha a ni si a; ‘Nova tuite chuan lei a chîm pil leh tawh lo vang,’ tia chhia ka chham ang khân, ‘I chungah ka thinur tawh lo vang a, ka zilhhau tawh hek lo vang che,’ tiin chhia ka chham ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlâng liante chu an kal bo vang a, tlâng tête chu sawnin an awm bawk ang; ka ngilneihna erawh hi chu i lak ata a kal bo lo vang a, ka remna thuthlung chu sawnin a awm hek lo vang,” Lalpa , a khawngaihtu che chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Aw nang tihretheih, tuifâwn vawrh vawrh, thlamuanna nei lo, ngai teh, i lungrem chu lung ṭha miin ka rem ang a, i lungphûmte chu sapphir lungtein ka rem bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I chhîp zumte chu rubi lungin, i kawngkhârte chu karbankul lungin, i kulh zawng zawng chu lungmawitein ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, i fate zawng zawng chu Lalpa zirtîrin an awm ang a, i fate thlamuanna chu nasa tak a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Felnaa tihnghehin i awm ang a; hnehchhiahna ata hla takah i awm ang a, i hlau dâwn lo a ni; thil râpthlâk ata hla takah i awm bawk ang a, a hnaih dâwn lo che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh, bei tûr chein an la pung khâwm a ni thei e; nimahsela, ka thu a ni lo vang; nangmah bei tûra pung khâwm apiangte chu nangmah avângin an tlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngai teh, kei chuan thîrdêng pûm zâpa a hnathawhna tûr hriam chher ṭhîntu chu ka siam a; keimah vêkin tichhe tûrin tichhetu ka siam bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangmah beihna tûra hriam chher rêng rêng a sâwt lo vang; lei tinrêng thupawia nangmah rawn khingtute chu thiam loh i chantîr ang. Chu chu Lalpa chhiahhlawhte rochan chu a ni a, an felna chu ka hnên ata a ni,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hawh u, tuihâl apiangte u, tuiahte hian lo kal rawh u; tangka nei lote pawh, lo kal ula, lei ula, ei rawh u. A ni, lo kal ula, uain leh hnute tui tangka pe lovin, a man pawh pe lovin lei rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chaw ni si lovah eng vângin nge tangka in sên? Puar leh fânna ni si lovah eng vângin nge in tha in sên? Ka thu ngun takin ngaithla ula, thil ṭha chu ei rawh u, in nunna chu thil thauvah chuan hlim rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In beng rawn dawh ula, ka hnênah lo kal rawh u. Ngaithla ula, tichuan in nunna chu a nung ang; tin, in hnênah kumkhaw thu ka thlung ang, Davida hnêna khawngaihna tiam tlatte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh, ani chu mi tin tân thuhretuah ka ruat a, mi tin tân hruaitu leh hotuah ka ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh, i hriat ngai loh hnam chu i ko vang a, nangmah hre ngai lo hnam chu i hnênah an lo tlân ang, Lalpa i Pathian avâng leh Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima avâng chuan; ani chuan a chawimawi si chia.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmuh awla a awm lai hian Lalpa chu zawng ula, a hnaih lai hian ko rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi suaksual chuan a awm dân chu bânsan sela, mi fel lo chuan a ngaihtuahte chu bânsan bawk rawh se. Lalpa hnênah kîr leh rawh se; tichuan, anin a lo khawngaih ang; kan Pathian hnênah kîr leh rawh se, anin a ngaidam nasa khawp dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka ngaihtuahte hi i ngaihtuahte a ni si lo va, i awm dânte chu ka awm dân a ni hek lo,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Vân khi lei aia a sâng zâwk angin, ka awm dânte hi in awm dânte aiin a sâng zâwk si a, ka ngaihtuahte pawh hi in ngaihtuahte aiin a sâng zâwk bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ruah leh vûr chu vân aṭangin a sûr ṭhîn a, khi lamah khian a kîr leh ngai lo va, lei hi a châwm zâwk a, thil a ṭotîrin a chawrtîr a, buh chi thehtu hnênah buh chi a pe a, eitu hnênah ei tûr a pe ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />chutiang bawkin ka kâ aṭanga ka thuchhuak chu a awm ang: eng mah tih nei lovin ka hnênah a kîr leh lo vang a, ka duh ang chu a tizo zâwk ang a, thil ti tûra ka tirhnaah chuan a hlawhtling bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hlim taka chhuakin, thlamuang taka hruai chhuahin in awm dâwn si a; tlâng liante leh tlâng tête chuan in hmaah hla an sa chhuak phut ang a, phûl thing zawng zawngte chuan an kut an bêng bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnimhlîngnei ai chuan fâr a ṭo zâwk ang a, buar ai chuan lenhmui a ṭo zâwk ang; chu chu Lalpa tân hming ṭhatna tûr leh kumkhaw chhinchhiahna, tihborala awm lo tûr a ni ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Dik takin ro rêl ula, fel takin ti rawh u, ka chhandamna chu a lo thleng dâwn dâwnin, ka felna chu a lo lang dâwn dâwn ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutiang ti mi leh, chumi pawm tlattu mihring fapa chu, a eng a thâwl e; Chawlhni bawhchhe lova serh ṭhîntu leh, thil ṭha lo rêng rêng ti lo tûra a kut vêng ṭha ṭhîntu chu.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ram dang mi, Lalpa zawmtu chuan, “ Lalpan a mite lakah mi tihrang ngei ang,” ti suh se; mi tilreh chuan, “Thing ro mai ka nih hi,” ti hek suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka Chawlhnite serha, ka lâwm zâwng thilte thlanga, ka thuthlung pawm tlattu mi tilrehte chungchâng thûah chuan Lalpan heti hian a ti si a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘An hnênah ka in chhûngah leh ka kulh chhûngahte chuan, fanu leh fapa neite ai mah chuan hriat rengna ṭha zâwk leh hming ṭha zâwk ka pe ang; an hnênah kumkhaw hming, tihboral tawh loh tûr ka pe ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram dang mite pawh, Chawlhni bawhchhe lova serh ṭhîn leh, ka thuthlung pawm tlat apiang, Lalpa rawng bâwl tûr leh, Lalpa hming ngaina tûr leh, a chhiahhlawhahte awm tûra Lalpa zawm apiangte chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />anni ngei chu ka tlâng thianghlimah chuan ka hruai ang a, ka ṭawngṭaina inah ka tihlim ang; hâlrala an thilhlante leh an inthawinate chu ka maichâmah chuan lawmin a awm ang; ka in chu mi tinrêng tân ṭawngṭaina in an ti dâwn si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian, Israel hnawh chhuahhote hruai khâwmtu chuan, “Hruai khâwm sate bâkah mi dang pawh ka la hruai khâwm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ramsa zawng zawngte u, a ni, ramhnuaia sa awm zawng zawngte u, ei tûrin lo kal rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A râlvêngtute chu an mit a del a, hriatna nei lo hlîr an ni a; ui aw nei lo hlîr an ni a, an bauh thei lo; mumang neia, mu renga, mut duh mi an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni, uite chu duhâm tak an ni a, tâwk tih lêm an nei ngai lo; chûng chu berâm vêngtu thil hre thei lote an ni; mahni kawng kawng, mahni hlâwkna lam ṭheuh an hawi hlawm, an zavai maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Lo kal rawh u, uain ka la ang a; tichuan, zuin kan inthun khat dâwn nia; naktûk chu vawiin ang hi a ni leh ang a, ni ropui nasa deuh mai a ni ang,” an ti ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi ṭha an thi a, tu mân pawi an ti lo; Pathian ngaihsak mite pawh an thi a, tu mân chhiatna thleng tûr laka lâk bo an ni tih an ngaihtuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi fel chu a thi a, thil ṭha lovin a khawih phâk lo va, dik taka ti ṭhînte chu thlamuang takin an khumah an mu siai siai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Nimahsela, nangni dawithiamnu fapa, uire leh nawhchizuar thlahte u, hetah lo hnai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu nge nuihza siam nân in hman ṭhin le? Tu nge in chhiat khuma, lei in chhuah khum ṭhin le? Nangni sasaw zînga, thing buk hnuai tina intizauthauva, ruam chhûngtea lung khi bulahte naupang that ṭhînte u, bawhchhiatna fa, dâwt theihna thlahte in ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Luikawr ruam lung mâm zîngah chuan i chanvo a awm a; chûng, chûngte ngei chu i chanpual chu a ni; chûngte tân ngei chuan thilhlanin mi i leih a, thilpêk i hlan kha. Chûng thilah chuan tihlungawiin ka awm dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tlâng sâng zo tak chungah chuan i khum chu i dah a; Moleka hnênah i kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, kawngkhârte leh kawngka biang phênahte chuan i hriat rengna chu i tung a; ka lakah ni lovin mi dang lakah i inhlîp a, i han chho si a, i khum i zauh va, an hnênah thu i thlung a; an khum chu i hmuhnaah chuan i hmangaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, hriak nên lal hnênah i kal a, i rimtuite chu i ti nasa zual a, i palaite chu hla takah i tîr a, Seol thleng rawkin i intihhniam kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I kalna kawng sei avâng khân i hah a; nimahsela, ‘Beiseina rêng rêng a awm lo,’ i ti si lo va. I chakna tihharhna i hmu a; chuvângin, i chauh tâk loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu nge i hlauhva i ṭiha, dâwt i sawi ṭhina, kei mi hriat tâk lohva, i rilrua i ngaihtuah tâk loh le? Rei tak ka ngawi reng lo vem ni? Hlauh pawh mi hlauh loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I felna thu hi ka sawi ang a; i thiltihte zawng i tân eng mah a hnemhnâng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I au hunah chuan i milim lâk khâwmte chuan chhan him che rawh se; nimahsela, anniho chu thliin a la ang a, thawin a lên bo vek ang. Kei mi ringtu erawh chuan ram hi a nei ang a, ka tlâng thianghlim hi a luah ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan, “Chhûng pâwng rawh u, chhûng pâwng rawh u, kawng buatsaih rawh u, ka mite kawng ata tlûkna tûr chu paih rawh u,” a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi chungnung, chawisân, chatuana awm, a hming Thianghlima chuan heti hian a ti si a: “Kei hmun chungnung leh thianghlimah ka awm a, mi thuhnuairawlhte rilru tiharh tûr leh inchhîr ngawih ngawihte thinlung tiharh tûrin, mi, rilrua inchhîr ngawih ngawiha thuhnuairawlh tak hnênah pawh ka awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumkhuain ka do dâwn si lo va, ka thinur fo dâwn hek lo; chutichuan, mi rilru ka hmaah a chau vang a, nunna ka siamte pawh chu an chau bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A duhâma a khawlohna avângin ka thin a ur a, ka vua a, ka hmai ka hup a, ka thin a ur a ni; ani lah chu a thinlung awm dân pângngaiah luhlul takin a awm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A awm dânte chu ka hmu a, amah chu ka tidam ang; ka hruai bawk ang a, amah leh a sûnpuitute hnênah thlamuannate ka pe leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei chuan hmui rah ka siam ṭhîn a: ‘Remna, remna, hla taka awm hnênah leh hnai taka awm hnênah chuan awm rawh se,’” Lalpan a ti, “Ani chu ka tidam ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi suaksualte erawh chu tuifinriat fâwn fâwn ṭhîn ang chu an ni; an awm hle hle thei si lo va, a tuite chuan bawlhhlawh leh chirhdiak a vawrh chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka Pathian chuan, “Mi suaksualte tân chuan muanna rêng rêng a awm lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ring takin au rawh, inren suh, tawtawrâwt angin i aw chhuah tuar tuar la, ka mite hnênah an bawhchhiatna chu hrilh la, Jakoba chhûngte hnênah an sualnate hrilh bawk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anni chuan zawn zawng ni tin mi zawng ṭhîn a, ka kawng thute hriat zawng an châk ṭhîn; fel taka ti leh an Pathian rorêlna bânsan ngai lo hnam angin ka hnênah rorêlna fel tak mi dîl ṭhîn a, Pathian rawn hnaih pawh an châk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Eng vângin nge chaw kan ngheia, i hmuh si loh? Eng vângin nge kan intihretheiha, i hriat si loh?’ an ti ṭhîn. Ngai teh u, in chaw nghei ni chuan nangmahni nawmsak in bâwl a, in hnathawktute zawng zawng in hnehchhiah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh u, innghirnghona leh inhnialna tûr leh, suahsualna kuttuma inchûm tûrin a ni, chaw in nghei ṭhin ni. In aw hi chung lama hriattîr tlâk zâwngin chumi ni chuan chaw in nghei ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutiang chu chaw ngheina ka duh zâwnga chu em ni? Mi a intihretheihna tûr ni a ni em ni? Phûngladin anga a lû kûn tûr leh, a hnuaia saiip puan phaha vut phul tûr em ni? Chûng chu chaw ngheina leh Lalpa tâna ni lawm tlâk i ti dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hei hi ka duh zâwnga chaw ngheina chu a ni lâwm ni: dik lo taka phuarna phelhsak leh, nghâwngkawl hruite hlihsak leh, hnehchhiahho chhuahtîr leh, nghâwngkawl tinrêng tihtliahsak hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mahni chaw rilṭâmte hnêna sem leh, rethei hnawh chhuahho mahni ina hruai hi a ni lâwm ni? Mi saruak hmuha puan vawm leh, mahni tisa ang pu laka bihrûk loh hi a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan i êng chu zîng ni chhuak angin a lo chhuak ang a, i damna tûr chu a lo chawr chhuak thuai ang; i felna chuan i hma a hruai ang a, Lalpa ropuina chu i hnudâltu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan i ko vang a, Lalpan a chhâng ang; i au vang a, anin, ‘Heta hi ka awm,’ a ti ang. In zîng ata nghâwngkawl te, zungṭanga mi kawh te, sual taka ṭawng te hi i tihbova,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />rilṭâmte tân i inphala, tihretheihte i tihtlai bawk chuan, i êng chu thim zîngah a êng chhuak ang a, i thim mupna chu chhûn ang a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hruai zel ang chia, hmun rovah pawh a titlai ang chia, i ruhte pawh a tichak bawk ang; tin, huan tuia châwm ang leh, tuihna kang ngai lo ang i ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, i laka lo la chhuak tûrte chuan hmun hlui chhe tawhte chu an rem leh ang a; chhuan tam tak lungphûmahte chuan i rem chho leh ang; tichuan, nang chu, ‘A chhe lai siamṭhatu,’ ‘Mi awmna tûra kawngte siamṭhatu,’ an ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chawlhni bawhchhe lo tûra, ka ni thianghlima i duh zâwng ti lo tûra i kephah chu i hawi kîrtîra, Chawlhni lâwmawm i tiha, Lalpa ni thianghlim chu zahawm i tiha, mahni kawng zawng lova, mahni nawmsak bâwl lova, mahni thu sawi lova i chawimawi chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chungah chuan i lâwm ang a; leilung hmun sângahte chuan ka chuantîr ang chia, i pu Jakoba rochun thilin ka châwm ang che.” Lalpa kâ chuan chu chu a sawi tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Lalpa kut chu chhandam thei lo tûrin tihtawiin a awm lo va; a beng chu hre thei lo tûrin a ngawng hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In khawlohnate chu nangni leh in Pathian kâra tlain a tiṭhen zâwk che u a, benga a hriat duh lohna tûrin in sualnate chuan a hmai chu a hliahsak bawk che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In kutte chu thisena tihbawlhhlawhin a awm a, in kut zungṭangte lah khawlohnaa tihbawlhhlawhin a awm si a; in hmuite chuan dâwt a sawi a, in lei chu suahsualna thu sawiin a phun nuah nuah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu mân dik takin thupawi an sawi lo va, tu mân thu tak takin thu an sawipui ngai lo. Boruak mai mai hi an ring a, dâwt an sawi ṭhîn a; thil sual tih duhna an pai a, khawlohna an hring ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rûlmuk tuite an awp keu va, maimawm rîl puan an tah ṭhîn; an tui eitute chu an thi ṭhîn a, tihkeha awmah chuan rûl a lo chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An maimawm rîl puan chu silhfênahte a chang lo vang a, an thiltihte chu an inbel hek lo vang; an thiltihte chu khawlohna thiltihte a ni a, thil râwng taka tihna chu an kutah a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An kete chu thil ṭha lo lamah a tlân ṭhîn a, pawisawi lo thisen chhuah tûrin an hmanhmawh ṭhîn; an ngaihtuahte chu khawlohna ngaihtuahnate a ni ṭhîn a; ṭiauna leh chhiatna chu an kawngahte a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlamuanna kawng an hre lo va, an kalnaahte chuan dikna rêng rêng a awm ngai lo; an tân kawng kawite an siam a; chuta kal apiang chuan thlamuanna an hre ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, rorêlna chu keimahni aṭanga hla takah a awm ṭhîn a, felna chuan min ûm phâk ngai hek lo; êng kan nghâk ṭhîn a; nimahsela, ngai teh, thim a lo ni ṭhîn; ênna kan nghâk ṭhîn a; nimahsela, thim mupah bawk kan kal ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mitdel angin bang kan dap dun dun ṭhîn a, a ni, mit nei lote angin kan dap dun dun ṭhîn; thimhlim ang maiin chhûnah kan inchhuih ṭhîn a; mi chakte zîngah chuan mitthi ang mai kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Savawmte angin kan zain kan hûk dur dur ṭhîn a, ṭhurote angin nasa takin kan rûm nghuat nghuat ṭhîn; rorêlna kan nghâk ṭhîn a; nimahsela, a awm hauh si lo va; chhandamna kan nghâk ṭhîn a; nimahsela, keimahni aṭangin hla takah a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan bawhchhiatnate hi i hmaah a pung ta si a, kan sualnate hian min hêk ṭhîn a ni; kan bawhchhiatnate hi kan hnênah a awm reng si a, kan khawlohnate zawng kan hria a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />kan bawhchhiat te, Lalpa kan phatsan te, kan Pathian zui zêl lova kan hawisan te, hnehchhiah thu leh hel thu kan sawi te, dâwt thu kan paia, thinlung ata kan sawi chhuah ṭhinte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, rorêlna chuan hnung lam min hawisan a, felna chuan hla takah min dinsan ta; thutak chu kawtthlêrah a tlu reng si a, dikna chu a lût thei lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ni, thutak a awm ta lo va; thil ṭha lo bânsantu chu râllâkah a insiam ṭhîn; tichuan, Lalpan chu chu a hmu a, rorêlna rêng rêng awm ta lo chuan a tilungni ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, mi rêng rêng an awm lo tih a hria a, dîlsaktu rêng rêng an awm lo chu mak a ti a; chuvângin, ama bân ngei chuan chhandamna a insiam a; ama felna ngei chuan a inchelh ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, felna chu âwmphawah a ha a, chhandamna lukhum a khum a; tin, inthuamnaah chuan phuba lâkna silhfênte chu a inbel a, kawrfualah chuan ṭhahnemngaihna a ha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An thiltihte angin, an thiltihte ang ngeiin ani chuan a thungrûl ang, amah dotute chu thinrimnain, a hmêlmate chu thungrulhnain a thungrûl ang a, thliarkârte chu thungrulhnain a thungrûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa hming chu thlang lam aṭangin an ṭih ang a, a ropuina chu ni chhuahna aṭangin an ṭih bawk ang; ani chu tui lian thut, Lalpa thawa chhêm luan vut vut angin a lo kal dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zion-ah chuan tlantu a lo kal ang a, Jakob-ho zînga bawhchhiatna hawisantute hnênah pawh a lo kal ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Kei zawng, hei hi a ni, an hnêna ka thuthlun chu ni,” Lalpan a ti: “Ka thlarau i chunga awm leh, ka thu i kâa ka dahte chuan, tûn achinah chatuan thleng pawhin i ka chu an chhuahsan lo vang a, i thlahte ka chu an chhuahsan hek lo vang a, i thlahte thlah lehchhâwng ka pawh tûn aṭanga kumkhuain an chhuahsan hek lo vang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tho la, êng rawh; i êng chu a lo thleng a, Lalpa ropuina chu i chungah a lo chhuah tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh, thimin leilung hi a khuh dâwn si a, thim chhah mupin mite a khuh bawk dâwn a ni; nimahsela, Lalpa chu i chungah a lo chhuak ang a, a ropuina chu i chungah a la lang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, hnam tin i êng lamah an lo kal ang a, lalte pawh i lo chhuah ênna lamah an lo kal bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Dâk la, i mit lên vêl la, en rawh: an zain an inkhâwm a, i hnênah an lo kal a nih hi; i fapate chu hla tak aṭangin an lo kal ang a, i fanute chu an rawn pawm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan i hmu ang a, i êng tawh ang a, i thinlung chu a khûr ang a, tihzauvin a awm ang; tuifinriata sumdâwnna tam tak mai chuan i hnên lam a pan dâwn avâng leh, hnam tin sum chuan i hnên a lo thlen dâwn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sanghâwngsei tam tak mai chuan an tuam dûl dûl ang che, Midian leh Epha rama sanghâwngsei tuaite chuan; chûng zawng zawng chu Seba ram aṭangin an lo kal ang; rangkachak leh beraw an rawn phur ang a, Lalpa fakna thu an hriattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kedar-ho ran rual zawng zawng chu i hnênah an lo kal khâwm ang a, Nebaioth-ho berâmpate chuan i rawng an bâwl ang; ka maichâmah chuan lâwmin an chho vang a, ka ropuina in chu ka chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chhûm anga thlâwkte leh, ṭhûro anmahni tukverh pana thlâwk noh noh anga thlâwkte saw tute nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan a chawimawi che avângin, Lalpa i Pathian hming atân leh Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima tân chuan i fapate an tangkarua leh rangkachak nên hla tak aṭanga hruai tûrin, mathei lovin thliarkârte chuan mi nghâk ang a, Tarsis lawng liante chuan hmasak ber an chuh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, ram dang mite chuan i kulh bangte chu an rem chho leh ang a, an lalte pawhin i rawng an bâwl tawh ang; ka thinrim chuan ka vua chia; nimahsela, ka duhsaknain ka khawngaih si che a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I kawngkhârte pawh hawnin a awm reng ang a, a chhûn a zânin an khâr lo vang; miten hnam tin sum chu i hnênah an rawn lâka, an lalte pawh an rawn hruai ve theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I rawng bâwl duh lo hnam leh ram chu a boral dâwn si a; a ni, chûng hnamte chu tihchhiat hlauhvin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hmun thianghlim cheimawi tûrin Lebanon ropuina chu i hnênah a lo kal ang, fâr te, phân te, tufâr te chu an lo kal tlâng ang; tichuan, ka ke rahna hmun chu ka tiropui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, nangmah tiretheituteho fapate chu kûnin i hnênah an lo kal ang a, nangmah hmusittute zawng zawng chu chibai bûkin i kephah hnuaiah an kûn ang; nang chu, ‘ Lalpa khawpui’, ‘Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima Zion’ an ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu ma tlawh ngai loh khawpa kalsan leh huata i awm aiah kumkhaw chhuan ber, chhuan tam tak lâwmnaah ka siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, hnam tin hnute tui i fâwp ang a, lalho hnute pawh i hne ang; kei Lalpa hi nangmah chhandamtu leh nangmah tlantu, Jakob-ho Mi Chaka chu ka ni tih i la hre bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dâr aiah rangkachak ka rawn la ang a, thîr aiah pawh tangkarua ka rawn la ang, thing aiah pawh dâr, lung aiah pawh thîr. Thlamuanna chu i hotuah ka ruat bawk ang a, felna chu nangmah phûttuah ka ruat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Râwng taka thiltih thâwm chu i ramah hriat a ni tawh lo vang a, ṭiauna leh chhiatna thâwm pawh i ramri chhûngah hriat a ni tawh lo vang; i kulh chu ‘Chhandamna’ i ti zâwk ang a, i kawngkhârte pawh ‘Fakna’ i ti bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni khi chhûnah nangmah êntu a ni tawh lo vang a, thla pawh khian ênna tûrin a tiêng hek lo vang che; Lalpa erawh chu i tân kumkhaw êntuah a awm ang a, i Pathian chu i ropuina atân a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I ni chu a tla tawh lo vang a, i thla pawh chu a ral tawh hek lo vang; Lalpa chu i kumkhaw êntu a ni dâwn tawh si a, i lusûn nite chu a tâwp dâwn tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I mite pawh an zain mi fel an ni ang a, i ram hi an luah kumkhua ang; chawimawia ka awm theihna tûrin anni chu a zung puak chhuak ka phun, ka kutchhuak chu an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In zînga hnam tê ber pawh hnam ropui tak an la ni ang a, hnam tlêm tê pawh hnam chak tak an la ni ang. Kei Lalpa hian a hun takah ka thlentîr thuai ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuhnuairawlhte hnênah Chanchin Ṭha hril tûra Lalpan hriak mi thih avângin, Lalpa Pathian thlarau chu ka chungah a awm; ani chuan, thinlung lungchhiate tuam tûr te, salte hnêna chhuahna thu leh mi tângte hnêna tân in hawnna thu sawi tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa lungawi kum thu leh kan Pathian phuba lâk ni thu sawi tûr te, lungngai zawng zawng thlamuan tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />vut aiah pangpâr ṭhi hrui te, lungngaih aiah hlimna hriak te, nguina thlarau aiah fakna silhfên te an hnêna pêkah, Zion-a lungngaia awmte tân ruat tûr tein mi tîr a ni; ani chu chawimawia a awmna tûrin, felna thing, Lalpa phunte, tih an nih theih nân.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, hmun hlui chhe tawhte chu an rem leh ang a, tûn hmaa khaw lo ṭiau tawhte chu an din ṭha leh ang a, khawpui chhe tawh, chhuan tam tak ṭiaunate chu an siam ṭha leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ram dang mite chuan in ran rualte chu dingin an tlattîr ang a, hriat ngai loh mite chu in leilettuahte leh in grêp hrui enkawltuahte an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangni erawh chu “ Lalpa puithiamte” tia vuahin in awm ang a, miten “Kan Pathian rawngbâwltute” an ti ang che u. Hnam tin sum in ei ang a, an ropuina chu in inchhuan phah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In mualpho aiah a leh hnih in hmu ang a, in zah aiah in chanvovah hlimin in zai ang; chutichuan, in ramah chuan a leh hnih in luah ang a; kumkhaw hlimna in hnênah a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hian rorêlna fel ka ngaina si ṭhîn a, khaw lo taka ram hi ka haw ṭhin a ni; tichuan, anmahni ka rulhna chu tihtak meuhvin an hnênah ka pe ang a, an hnênah kumkhaw thu ka thlung bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An thlahte chu hnam tin zîngah hriat an ni ang a, an fate chu mi tin zîngah hriat an ni bawk ang. Anmahni hmu apiangin Lalpa malsâwm chi an ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa -ah chuan nasa takin ka hlim ang a, ka nunna hi ka Pathianah chuan lâwm takin a awm ang; mo neitu chu pangpâr ṭhi hruia a inchei ṭhîn ang leh, mo chu a incheinatea a inchei ṭhîn ang hian, ani chuan chhandamna silhfênte mi bel a, felna kawrfualin mi tuam ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leilungin a thil chawr a chhuahtîr ang leh, huanin a chhûnga thil chînte a chawrtîr ang hian, Lalpa Pathian chuan felna leh fakna chu hnam tinrêng hmaah chuan a chawrtîr dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A felna chu ênna anga a chhuaha, amah chhandamna chu khâwnvâr alh anga a chhuah hma loh chuan, Zion avângin ka ngawi reng lo vang a, Jerusalem avângin ka awm hle hle lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hnam tinin i felna chu an hmu ang a, lal zawng zawngin i ropuina chu an hmu bawk ang; hming thar, Lalpa kâin a vuah tûr chuan an ko vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa kuta mawina lallukhum leh i Pathian kuta ropuina lukhum i ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mâk” an ti leh tawh lo vang che; i ram pawh chu “Tihṭiau” an ti leh tawh hek lo vang; “Duhlai” an ti tawh zâwk ang chia, i ram pawh chu “Pawmlai” an ti bawk ang; Lalpa i chungah a lâwm si a, i ram pawhin pasal a nei dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlangvâlin nula nupuia an nei ṭhîn ang hian i fapaten nupuiah an nei ang che; mo neitu chu mo chungah a lâwm angin, i Pathian chu i chungah a lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, i kulh chungah râlvêngtute ka vêntîr a; a chhûn a zânin eng tikah mah an ngawi lo vang. Jerusalem hi a tihngheha, leiah hian fakawma a siam hma loh chuan, nangni Lalpa hriatpuitua awmte u, awm hle hle hlek suh ula, amah pawh chu awm hle hletîr hlek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan , “I buh chu nangmah dotute chawah a pe leh tawh hauh lo vang a, ram dang miten i thawh chhuah uain chu an in tawh lo vang; a sengtute chuan an ei tawh zâwk ang a, Lalpa chu an fak ang; a lotute chuan ka hmun thianghlim hung chhûng kawtlaiah chuan an in tawh ang,” tiin, a kut ding lam leh a bân chak tak chhâlin chhia a chham ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chhuak ula, kulh kawngkaahte chhuak rawh u! Mite tân kawng buatsaih ula; chhûng pâwng ula, lamlian chu chhûng pâwng rawh u! Lungte chu chhar fai ula; mite tân chhinchhiahna târ chhuak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Lalpan kâwlkil thlengin heti hian a hriattîr a ni: “Zion fanu hnênah heti hian sawi rawh u, ‘En teh, nangmah chhandamna a lo thlen dâwn hi; en teh, a lâwmman chu a hnênah a awm hi, a rulhna chu a hmaah a awm bawk a,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu - Mi thianghlimho, Lalpa tlante, an ti ang a; nang chu - Zawn chhuah, Kalsan loh khawpui, an ti ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Edom ram aṭanga lo kal, Bozra khua aṭanga silhfên tihsen sin saw tu nge ni? A puan sina ropui tak, a chakna nasa tak nêna lo kal saw? “Keimah, fel taka thu sawia, chhandam kawnga mi chak taka kha ka ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eng vângin nge i puan sin kha a sena, i silhfênte pawh kha grêp sâwrna khura rap sâwrtu silhfên anga a awm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Keimah chauhvin grêp sâwrna khurah ka rap sâwr a, mipui zîng aṭangin mi pakhat mah ka hnênah an awm ve lo. Anni chu ka thinurin ka rap a, ka thinrimin ka chîl a; an nunna thisen chu ka silhfênahte hian thehin a awm a, ka puan zawng zawng hi ka tibawlhhlawh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Phuba lâk ni chu ka thinlungah a awm a, ka mi tlante kum chu a lo thleng ta bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, ka han en a, ṭanpuitu tûr rêng rêng an awm lo va, chelh dingtu rêng rêng an awm lo chu mak ka ti a; chuvângin, keima bân ngei hian chhandamna mi thlen a, ka thinrimna chuan mi chelh ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, mipui chu thinrimin ka rap bet a, ka thinrimin ka tirui a, an nunna thisen chu leiah ka leih baw ta.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpan thil engkima min vûr avângin, Lalpa ngilneihzia thute leh Lalpa fakna thute ka sawi ang; a khawngaihnate leh a ngilneihna a nasat avângin, Israela chhûngte laka a ṭhatna nasa taka an chunga a vûr thu pawh kha ka sawi bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka mite, fa a dera ti lo tûrte an ni ngei mai,” a ti si a; chutichuan, anmahni chhandamtuah a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An manganna zawng zawngah chuan ani chu a mangang ve ṭhîn a, vântirhkoh, a hmaa awm chuan anni chu a chhan him bawk ṭhîn; a hmangaihna leh a khawngaihnain a tlan ta hlawm a; hmasâng ni zawng zawngah chuan anmahni a puain anmahni a pawm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, an hel a, a thlarau thianghlim chu an tilungngai ta a; chuvângin, anmahni dotua awm tûra tihlamlêtin a awm a, amah ngei chuan anni chu a bei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan a mite chuan Mosia hmasâng nite chu an hre reng a, heti hian an ti: “Tuifinriat aṭanga a berâm rual vêngtute nêna anmahni hruai chhotu kha khawiah nge? A thlarau thianghlim an zînga dahtu kha khawiah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A bân ropui tak Mosia ding lama kaltîrtu kha khawiah nge? Kumkhaw hming insiam nâna an hmaa tui tiṭhentu kha khawiah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An inchhuih lohna tûra tui thûk taka, thlalêra sakawr hruai anga anmahniho hruaia kaitu kha khawiah nge?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ruama ran chhukte angin Lalpa thlarau chuan anniho chu a chawlhtîr a; chutiang chuan, hming ropui tak i insiam nân i mite chu i hruai kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vân aṭang khân rawn thlîr thla la, i thianghlimna leh i ropuina awmna aṭang khân rawn en teh. I ṭhahnemngaihna leh i chaknate kha khawiah nge? I thinlunga i ngaihna leh i lainatnate kha ka lakah tihrehin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abrahaman min hre lovin, Israela pawhin min ngaihsak lo mah sela, nang chu kan Pa i ni si a; nang chu, aw Lalpa , kan Pa i ni a, i hming chu chatuan ata keimahni min tlantu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin eng vângin nge i kawng aṭangtea min vah botîr ṭhina, nangmah ṭih lo tûra kan thinlung min tihkhauhsak ṭhin le? I chhiahhlawh, i roluah hnamte avâng hian lo kîr leh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I mi thianghlimte chuan rei lo te chauh an nei a; min dotute chuan i hmun thianghlim chu an rap chhe ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An chunga ro i rêl ngai lohte ang, i hming pu ngai lote ang chu kan lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, hnam tin i hmaa an khurhna tûrin nangmah dotute hnêna i hming hriattîr nân, meiin thing nawi a tialha, mei chuan tuite a tiso ang hian tlângte chu i hmaa an luan thlâk dûl dûl nân, vân kha tithlêrin lo chhuk teh hrâm la aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan beisei loh thil râpthlâk i tih lai khân i lo chhuk a, tlângte chu i hmaah an luan thlâk dûl dûl kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmasâng ata tawh miten, nangmah chauh lo chu, anmahni nghâktu atâna thawhsak ṭhîntu Pathian an hre ngai si lo va, bengin an hre ngai hek lo va, mitin an hmu ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang chuan hlim taka awma, fel taka titu, i kawngtea nangmah hre reng ṭhîntute chu i hmuak ṭhîn a; ngai teh, nang i thinur a, keinin thil kan tisual a; chûngahte chuan rei tak kan lo awm tawh si a, chhandamin kan awm thei ang em le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi bawlhhlawh angin kan lo awm ta vek si a, kan felna zawng zawngte pawh silhfên bawlhhlawh ang a ni; kan zain hnah angin kan vuai ṭhîn a, kan khawlohnate hian thli angin min lên bo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, i hming lama nangmah chelh tûra mahni intiharh tu mah rêng rêng an awm lo; kan lakah hian i hmai i thup ta si a, kan khawlohnate hmangin min tiboral ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûnah erawh chuan, aw Lalpa , nang chu kan Pa i ni a; keini hi bellei kan ni a, nang chu min vawtu i ni; tichuan, kan za hian i kutchhuak kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , thinur nasa lutuk suh la, kan khawlohnate pawh kumkhua chuan hre reng hek suh ang che; ngai teh, khawngaih takin min en la, kan za hian i mite kan nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I khawpui thianghlimte chu thlalêrah a lo chana, Zion chu thlalêrah a lo chana, Jerusalem chu hmun tihṭiauvah a lo chan tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan in thianghlim leh kan in mawi tak, kan puten an lo fak ṭhinna che chu meia hâl a ni a; kan thil duhawmte zawng zawng lah chu tihchhiatin a awm ta vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , chûng thilahte chuan i insûm thei dâwn em ni? I ngawi rengin, min tirethei nasa reng dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mi lam ngai lote zawnin ka awm a, mi zawng ngai lote hmuhin ka awm a. Ka hming pu lo hnam hnênah chuan, ‘Mi en rawh u, mi en rawh u,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi hel hmangte tân nilêngin ka bânte ka phar ṭhîn, chûngho chu anmahni ngaihtuahte ang zêla kawng ṭha lova kal ṭhînte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />huanahte inthawia, leirawhchan chungahte englo rimtui hâla, ka hmaichhan ngeia mi tithinur ṭhînte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thlân zîngahte ṭhua, hmun fianrialtea riak ṭhînte, vawksa eia, an bêltea thil tenawm tuihâng âwm ṭhînte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Nangmah chauhvin ding rawh, mi rawn hnaih suh, nang ai chuan ka thianghlim zâwk hi,’ ti ṭhînte chu an ni. Chûngho chu ka hnâra mei khu awm, nilênga mei nung reng ṭhîn chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai teh u, ka hmaah ziakin a awm: ka ngawi reng lo vang a, ka thungrûl zâwk ang, a ni, an ângchhûngah nangmahni khawlohna leh in pute khawlohnate chu ka thungrûl ve ve ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Chûngho chuan tlâng lian chungahte englo rimtui hâlin tlâng tê chungahte ka hming an sawi chhe ṭhîn; chuvângin, an hnathawh chu a hmasa berin an ângchhûngah ka tehsak ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Grêp bâwrah uain thar an hmu a, miin, ‘Tichhe suh, khatah khân malsâwmna a awm si,’ an ti ang khân, ka chhiahhlawhte avângin ka ti ve ang, an zaa ka tihchhiat vek loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakoba aṭangin chi pakhat ka tichhuak ang a, Juda aṭangin ka tlângte luahtu tûr ka tichhuak ang; ka mi thlante chuan chu chu an luah ang a, ka chhiahhlawhte chu chutah chuan an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mi, mi zawngtute tân chuan, saron chu berâm rualho huang a ni ang a, Akor ruam chu bâwng rualho bawhna hmun tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, nangni Lalpa kalsana, ka tlâng thianghlim theihnghilha, Vânneihna Siamtua tân dawhkân buatsaiha, Chantâwka Khawrêlsaktui tân uain chawhpawlh sa chhûng khat ṭhînte u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ka koh lai che u khân mi in chhân duh lohva, thu ka sawi lai khân benga in hriat duh lohva, ka mit hmuha thil sual chu in tih zâwka, ka thil lawm loh zâwng chu in thlan avângin, khandaihin in chan tâwka khawrel chu ka siamsak ang che u a, in zain thahnaah chuan in kûn vek ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh u, ka chhiahhlawhte chuan an ei ang a, nangni erawh chu rilṭâmin in awm ang; ngai teh u, ka chhiahhlawhte chuan an in ang a, nangni erawh chu tuihâlin in awm ang; ka chhiahhlawhte chu an hlim ang a, nangni erawh chu in zak ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ngai teh u, ka chhiahhlawhte chu thinlunga an lâwm avângin hlim takin an zai ang a, nangni erawh chu thinlunga in lungngaih avângin in ṭap ang a, thlarauva in vui avângin in chiau vak vak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In hming chu chhechham nân ka mi thlante hnênah in hnutchhiah ang a, Lalpa Pathian chuan a tihlum ang che u; tin, a chhiahhlawhte chu hming dangin a ko tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, leiah hian mahni mal insâwm chawptu chu thutak Pathianah chuan mal a insâwm ang a; leiah hian chhechhamtu chuan thutak Pathian chhâlin chhia a chham ang; tûn hma mangannate chu theihnghilha a awm tâk avâng leh ka mit laka thupa a awm tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngai teh u, vân tharte leh lei thar ka siam a nih hi; tûn hma thilte chu hriat rengin a awm tawh lo vang a, rilruah pawh a lût tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka thilsiamah chuan kumkhuain lâwmin hlim rawh u; ngai teh u, Jerusalem chu hlimnaah ka siam a, a mite chu lâwmnaah ka siam a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem chungah chuan ka hlim ang a, ka mite chungah pawh ka lâwm ang; a chhûngah chuan ṭap thâwm chu hriat a ni tawh lo vang a, chiau thâwm pawh hriat a ni tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuta ṭanga chhuak chu nausên ni rei lo tê dam an awm lo vang a, putar a dam chhûng nite tlingtla lo an awm hek lo vang; naupang chu kum za mi niin a thi dâwn si a, mi sual kum za chauh dam chu ânchhe dawng a ni dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Inte an sa ang a, chûngah chuan an chêng ang; grêp huante an siam ang a, a rah an ei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi dang awmna tûrin in an sa tawh lo vang a, mi dang eiah grêp huan an siam tawh lo vang. Thing dam chhûng nite ang hian ka mite dam chhûng nite chu a awm dâwn si a, ka mi thlante chu an thawh chhuah chungah chuan rei tak an lâwm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thlâwnin an thawk rim lo vang a, vânduaina mai tûrin fa an hring hek lo vang; Lalpa malsâwm mi thlahte an ni si a, an fate chu an hnênah an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Heti hi a ni ang a, annin mi koh hma pawhin ka chhâng ang a; thu an la sawi lai mêk pawhin ka bengin ka hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chinghnia leh berâmno chu an tla dûn tawh ang a, sakeibaknei chuan bâwngpa angin buhpâwl a ei tawh ang a, vaivut chu rûl chaw a ni ang. Ka tlâng thianghlim rêng rêngah chuan an tina tawh lo vang a, an tichhe tawh hek lo vang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Vân ka ṭhutphah a ni a, lei ka ke nghahchhan a ni. Khawiah nge ka tâna in i sak tûr chu? Khawiah nge ka chawlhna hmun tûr chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hêng thil engkim hi ka kutin ka siam a ni a; chutichuan, hêng thil engkim hi a lo awm ta a ni,” Lalpan a ti. “Amaherawhchu, mi, rethei taka awm, rilrua inchhîr ngawih ngawih, ka thûa khûr ṭhîna lam hi ka en zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bâwngpa talhtu chu mihring thattu ang a ni a; berâmnova inthawi chu ui nghâwng titliaktu ang a ni a; thilpêk hlântu chu vawk thisen hlântu ang a ni a; beraw hâltu chu milem malsâwmtu ang a ni. Mahni kawng kawng an thlang ta a, an thil tenawmahte chuan an rilru a lâwm ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka koh lai khân tu mân mi chhân lohva, thu ka sawi lai khân benga an hriat lohva, ka mit hmuha thil sual chu an tih zâwka, ka thil lawm loh zâwng chu an thlan avângin, kei pawhin anmahni bumna tûrte chu ka thlansak ang a, an hlauh zâwngte chu an chungah ka thlentîr ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thûa khûr ṭhînte u, Lalpa thu hi hre rawh u: “In unau, nangmahni hawtu leh ka hming avânga nangmahni hnawt chhuaktute chuan, ‘In lâwmna kan hmuh theih nân Lalpa chu tihropuiin awm rawh se,’ an ti a; nimahsela, an zak tawh zâwk ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu! Khawpuia sa mur mur thâwm chu! Biak ina thâwm a nih chu! A hmêlmate thungrûltu Lalpa thâwm a nih chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ani chuan vei hman lovin nau a nei a; na hre hman lovin mipa naupang a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutiang chu tuin nge hre ngai? Chutiangte chu tuin nge hmu ngai? Ni khatah ram a piang thut dâwn em ni? Vawi leh khatah hnam hrinin a awm thut dâwm em ni? Zion chuan nau a vei veleh a fate chu a hring ta pang si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pian hun thlentîr siin ka hrintîr dâwn lo vem ni?” Lalpan a ti. “Kei hrintîr ṭhîntu hian fa ka neihtîr phal dâwn lo vem ni?” i Pathianin a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Jerusalem hmangaihtu zawng zawngte u, Jerusalem chu hlimpui ula, lâwmpui rawh u; amah sûntu zawng zawngte u, lâwm avângin hlimpui rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />in hnêka, thlamuanna hnutêahte chuan in tlai theih nân leh, in hnêk dâka, a ropuina tam takah chuan in lâwm theih nân,” tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti si: “Ngai teh u, remna chu luipui ang maiin a hnên thlengin ka luantîr ang a, hnam tin ropuina chu luitê a kuang liam dûl dûl ang maiin a hnên thlengin ka luantîr bawk ang; tichuan, chu chu in hne ang, a hmathlâk ang che u a, a mal chungah chuan a ṭumtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi, a nuin a thlamuan angin ka thlamuan ang che u; tichuan, Jerusalem-ah chuan thlamuanin in awm dâwn nia.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, chu chu in hmu ang a, in thinlung chu a hlim ang a, in ruhte pawh hlobet hring dup angin a duah hluah hluah ang; Lalpa kut chu a chhiahhlawhte lamah a awm tih an hria ang a, a hmêlmate chungah a lungni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh u, a thinur chu thinrimnaa hrithla tûr leh, a zilhhauna chu mei alhtea hrithla tûrin, Lalpa chu mei nên a lo kal dâwn si a, a tawlailîrte chu ṭhâwngaleivir ang mai a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Meiin a ni, Lalpan a ngaihtuah dâwn ni; khandaihin a ni, mi zawng zawng a ngaihtuah dâwn ni: Lalpa tihhlumte chu tam tak an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Huanahte inthawi tuma inzui dum dum tûra intithianghlim leh inthian fai ṭhînte, vawksa leh thil tenawm leh chaichîmsa eite chu an boral tlâng ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“An thiltihte leh an ngaihtuahte chu ka hre si a. Hnam tinrêng leh ṭawng tinrêng ka hruai khâwm hun a lo thleng dâwn; tichuan, an lo kal ang a, ka ropuina an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An zîngah chuan chhinchhiahna ka awmtîr ang a; tichuan, an zînga hremna pumpelh apiangte chu hnam tin hnênah - Tarsis te, Pul te, thal ngul kuaiho Lud hnênah te, Tubal leh Javan-ho hnênah te, thliarkâr hla tak, ka hmingthan la hre ngai lova, ka ropuina la hmu ngai lohote hnênah chuan - ka tîr ang; tichuan, hnam tin zîngah ka ropuina thu an sawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Israela thlahten an thilhlan chu bungbêl thianghlim taka Lalpa ina an rawn la lût ṭhîn ang hian, Lalpa hnêna thilhlan atân hnam tinrêng zîng ata in unaute zawng zawng chu sakawr chungah te, tawlailîrah te, zâwnnaah te, sabengtung chungah te, sanghâwngsei chungah te, Jerusalem ka tlâng thianghlimah chuan an rawn hruai ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tin, chûng zînga mi pawh chu puithiam atânte leh Levia mi atânte ka la ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Vân tharte leh lei thar ka la siam tûr chu ka hmaah a awm reng dâwn angin, in thlahte leh in hming chu a awm reng bawk dâwn a ni,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, thla thar aṭanga thla thar dang thlengin, Chawlhni aṭanga Chawlhni dang thlengin mi zawng zawng ka hmaah chibai mi bûk tûrin an lo kal zut zut ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tin, an kal chhuak ang a, ka laka bawhchhetute ruang chu an en ang: an lungte chu a thiin, an mei chu tihmihin a awm dâwn si lo; mi zawng zawng tân thil tenawm tak an ni ang.”
  </para>
</usx>
